rocessing with adaptive validation and real-time monitoring"},"features":{"zh":["基于Puppeteer的浏览器自动化","域驱动任务处理","自适应验证","实时监控","支持多种浏览器"],"ja":["Puppeteerを基盤とするブラウザ自動化","ドメイン駆動タスク処理","適応型バリデーション","リアルタイムモニタリング","多種のブラウザをサポート"],"ko":["Puppeteer 기반의 브라우저 자동화","도메인 주도 작업 처리","적응형 검증","실시간 모니터링","다양한 브라우저 지원"],"es":["Automatización de navegador con Puppeteer","Procesamiento de tareas con validación adaptativa","Monitoreo en tiempo real","Integración con tecnologías de vanguardia","Flexibilidad y personalización","Seguridad y escalabilidad"],"fr":["Automatisation de navigateur avec Puppeteer","Traitement de tâches avec validation adaptative","Surveillance en temps réel","Intégration avec des technologies de pointe","Flexibilité et personnalisation","Sécurité et évolutivité"],"de":["Browser-Automatisierung mit Puppeteer","Aufgabenverarbeitung mit adaptiver Validierung","Echtzeit-Überwachung","Integration mit state-of-the-Art-Technologien","Flexibilität und Anpassungsfähigkeit","Sicherheit und Skalierbarkeit"],"pt":["Automação de navegador com Puppeteer","Processamento de tarefas orientado a domínio","Validação adaptativa em tempo real","Monitoramento em tempo real","Integração com CLI"],"ru":["Автоматизация браузера с Puppeteer","Доменно-ориентированная обработка задач","Адаптивная валидация в режиме реального времени","Мониторинг в режиме реального времени","Интеграция с CLI"],"ar":["التحكم في المتصفح مع Puppeteer","عمليات المهام الموجهة بالمحتوى","التحقق التكيفي في الوقت الفعلي","مراقبة الوقت الفعلي","التكامل مع CLI"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","浏览器自动化","Puppeteer","如何使用rag-mcp-lsp-ops","rag-mcp-lsp-ops安装","rag-mcp-lsp-ops设置指南","浏览器自动化工具","AI工具"],"ja":["AIエージェント","ブラウザ自動化","Puppeteer","rag-mcp-lsp-opsの使い方","rag-mcp-lsp-opsインストール","rag-mcp-lsp-ops設定ガイド","ブラウザ自動化ツール","AIツール"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","브라우저 자동화","Puppeteer","rag-mcp-lsp-ops 사용법","rag-mcp-lsp-ops 설치","rag-mcp-lsp-ops 설정 가이드","브라우저 자동화 도구","AI 도구"],"es":["agente AI","automatización de navegador","Puppeteer","procesamiento de tareas","validación adaptativa","monitoreo en tiempo real","cómo usar Puppeteer","qué es un agente AI","alternativas a Puppeteer","instalación de Puppeteer"],"fr":["agent IA","automatisation de navigateur","Puppeteer","traitement de tâches","validation adaptative","surveillance en temps réel","comment utiliser Puppeteer","qu''est-ce qu''un agent IA","alternatives à Puppeteer","installation de Puppeteer"],"de":["KI-Agent","Browser-Automatisierung","Puppeteer","Aufgabenverarbeitung","adaptive Validierung","Echtzeit-Überwachung","wie man Puppeteer verwendet","was ist ein KI-Agent","Alternativen zu Puppeteer","Puppeteer-Installation"],"pt":["agente AI","automação de navegador","Puppeteer","processamento de tarefas","validação adaptativa","monitoramento em tempo real","como usar agente AI","o que é agente AI","agente AI vs robô"],"ru":["ИИ агент","автоматизация браузера","Puppeteer","обработка задач","адаптивная валидация","мониторинг в режиме реального времени","как использовать ИИ агент","что такое ИИ агент","ИИ агент vs робот"],"ar":["وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","التحكم في المتصفح","Puppeteer","عمليات المهام","التحقق التكيفي","مراقبة الوقت الفعلي","كيفية استخدام وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هو وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي مقابل الروبوت"]}},"owner":"Ilenburg1993","repo":"chatgpt-docker-puppeteer","repoPath":"Ilenburg1993/chatgpt-docker-puppeteer","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-28T01:32:52.711Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"rag-mcp-lsp-ops","description":"","bodyPreview":"# RAG MCP LSP Ops\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill defines the canonical operational workflow for RAG + MCP + LSP in this repository. Use it\nwhen the assistant needs reliable code-context retrieval, semantic navigation readiness, or full RAG\nrebuild. For contract governance, runbook observability and deep proposal generation, combine with:\n\n- `audit-contracts-v3-ops`\n- `audit-runbook-observability`\n- `audit-proposal-deep-triage`\n\nWhen specifically working with language-server features (definitions, comp","body":"# RAG MCP LSP Ops\n\n## Overview\n\nThis skill defines the canonical operational workflow for RAG + MCP + LSP in this repository. Use it\nwhen the assistant needs reliable code-context retrieval, semantic navigation readiness, or full RAG\nrebuild. For contract governance, runbook observability and deep proposal generation, combine with:\n\n- `audit-contracts-v3-ops`\n- `audit-runbook-observability`\n- `audit-proposal-deep-triage`\n\nWhen specifically working with language-server features (definitions, completions, diagnostics), you\ncan also pair this with the dedicated `lsp-ops` skill for finer semantic guidance.\n\n## When To Use\n\n- User asks to rebuild/reindex RAG.\n- MCP tools are unavailable or inconsistent.\n- LSP tools need validation before deeper coding work.\n- Assistant must prepare runtime (`pm2`, `server`, `mcp`) before coding tasks that depend on tool\n  context.\n\n## Canonical Workflow\n\n1. Preflight runtime.\n\n- Check Ollama local: `curl http://host.docker.internal:11434/api/version`\n- Ensure PM2 runtime: `npm run daemon:start`\n- Wait endpoints: `GET /health` and `GET /api/mcp` on `http://localhost:3008`\n\n2. Diagnose MCP.\n\n- Run `npm run mcp:diagnose`\n- Confirm required tools (`rag_*`, `ollama_*`, `lsp_*`) are listed.\n\n3. Rebuild RAG from zero.\n\n- Run `npm run rag:rebuild:zero`\n- If needed, force profile full manually: `npm run rag:index -- --profile full`\n- For scope control, use the same flags across rebuild/index/watch:\n  - `--docs-mode include|exclude|only`\n  - `--include-glob` / `--exclude-glob` (repeatable)\n  - `--max-file-bytes`\n- Recommended phased indexing:\n  - Code/config first (no markdown): `npm run rag:index -- --profile full --docs-mode exclude`\n  - Docs later: `npm run rag:index -- --profile full --docs-mode only`\n\n4. Validate usable retrieval.\n\n- Execute one `rag_search` smoke call over MCP (`tools/call`) and confirm non-error response.\n\n5. Validate index freshness policy.\n\n- Prefer index freshness within 24h for high-signal triage.\n- If `index_freshness_ms` is stale, mark reduced confidence and recommend refresh/rebuild.\n\n6. Continue coding flow.\n\n- For normal coding queries use `profile=core`.\n- Reserve `profile=full` for rebuild/reindex and wide investigation.\n\n## Tooling Policy\n\n- Prefer MCP tools before broad local text search when task is semantic code understanding:\n  - `rag_search` first for recall.\n  - Then `lsp_definition`, `lsp_references`, `lsp_hover`, `lsp_diagnostics`.\n- Daily coding order:\n  - Symbol/API-level navigation: LSP (`lsp_*`) first.\n  - Broad cross-file context: `rag_search`.\n  - If embeddings are degraded: keep working in lexical mode temporarily, with diagnostics enabled.\n- If MCP is down, recover via canonical preflight, then retry MCP tools.\n\n## Failure Handling\n\n- `mcp:diagnose` failing:\n  - Recheck PM2 status (`npm run daemon:status`)\n  - Re-run `npm run daemon:restart`\n  - Re-run `npm run mcp:diagnose`\n- RAG health failing:\n  - Confirm `OLLAMA_LOCAL_BASE_URL`\n  - Run `npm run rag:rebuild:zero`\n- If Ollama/model remains unavailable:\n  - Continue in lexical mode (non-blocking fallback).\n  - Mark risk explicitly in tracker/snapshot (`rag degraded`, confidence reduced).\n  - Keep MCP/LSP diagnostics active.\n- Long rebuild:\n  - Keep process running; full profile can take minutes.\n  - If markdown volume is delaying index, run with `--docs-mode exclude` and process docs in a\n    second pass.\n\n## Command Reference\n\n- `npm run daemon:start`\n- `npm run daemon:status`\n- `npm run mcp:diagnose`\n- `npm run rag:rebuild:zero`\n- `npm run rag:rebuild:zero -- --docs-mode exclude`\n- `npm run rag:health -- --json`\n- `npm run rag:index -- --profile full --docs-mode only`\n\n## Done Criteria\n\n- PM2 shows `agente-gpt`, `dashboard-web`, `chrome-proxy` online.\n- `http://localhost:3008/api/mcp` responds.\n- `mcp:diagnose` passes.\n- RAG rebuild completes with exit code `0`, or fallback lexical explicitly registrado com risco.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-28T03:10:26.407Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Autonomous AI Agents needing domain-driven task processing with adaptive validation and real-time monitoring for browser automation with Puppeteer","zh":"非常适合需要基于域的任务处理、自适应验证和实时监控的自动化 AI 代理，特别是在使用 Puppeteer 的浏览器自动化中","ja":"Puppeteer を使用したブラウザ自動化で、ドメイン駆動のタスク処理、適応型バリデーション、リアルタイム監視が必要な自律型 AI エージェントに最適","ko":"Puppeteer를 사용한 브라우저 자동화에서 도메인 기반의 태스크 처리, 적응형 검증, 실시간 모니터링이 필요한 자율형 AI 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA Autónomos que necesitan procesamiento de tareas orientadas al dominio con validación adaptativa y monitoreo en tiempo real para la automatización del navegador con Puppeteer","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de IA Autonomes ayant besoin d''un traitement de tâches orientées vers le domaine avec une validation adaptative et une surveillance en temps réel pour l''automatisation du navigateur avec Puppeteer","de":"Perfekt für autonome KI-Agents, die domänengetriebene Aufgabenverarbeitung mit adaptiver Validierung und Echtzeitüberwachung für die Browserautomatisierung mit Puppeteer benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA Autônomos que precisam de processamento de tarefas orientadas por domínio com validação adaptativa e monitoramento em tempo real para automação de navegador com Puppeteer","ru":"Идеально подходит для автономных агентов ИИ, которым требуется обработка задач, управляемая доменом, с адаптивной валидацией и мониторингом в режиме реального времени для автоматизации браузера с помощью Puppeteer","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المستقلة الذين يحتاجون إلى معالجة المهام الموجهة بال домين مع التحقق من صحة التكيف والمراقبة في الوقت الحقيقي للتحكم الآلي للمتصفح مع Puppeteer"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform reliable code-context retrieval, semantic navigation readiness, or full RAG rebuild using Puppeteer for browser automation, combining with contract governance, runbook observability, and deep proposal generation through protocols like LSP","zh":"赋予代理执行可靠的代码上下文检索、语义导航准备或使用 Puppeteer 进行浏览器自动化的完整 RAG 重建，结合契约治理、运行手册可观察性和深度提案生成通过 LSP 等协议","ja":"Puppeteer を使用したブラウザ自動化を組み合わせて、契約ガバナンス、ランブックの可観測性、深い提案の生成を実行するための LSP などのプロトコルを使用して、エージェントが信頼性の高いコードコンテキストの取得、セマンティックナビゲーションの準備、または完全な RAG の再構築を実行できるようにする","ko":"Puppeteer를 사용한 브라우저 자동화와 계약 治理, 런북 관찰 가능성, 깊은 제안 생성을 통해 LSP 등의 프로토콜을 결합하여 에이전트가 신뢰할 수 있는 코드 컨텍스트 검색, 의미 탐색 준비 또는 전체 RAG 재구성을 수행할 수 있도록 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar una recuperación de código contextual confiable, preparación de navegación semántica o una reconstrucción completa de RAG utilizando Puppeteer para la automatización del navegador, combinando con la gobernanza de contratos, la observabilidad de runbook y la generación de propuestas profundas a través de protocolos como LSP","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer une récupération de code contextuel fiable, une préparation de navigation sémantique ou une reconstruction complète de RAG en utilisant Puppeteer pour l''automatisation du navigateur, en combinant avec la gouvernance des contrats, l''observabilité des runbooks et la génération de propositions profondes via des protocoles tels que LSP","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, eine zuverlässige Code-Kontext-Wiederherstellung, semantische Navigationsbereitschaft oder einen vollständigen RAG-Neuaufbau durchzuführen, indem Puppeteer für die Browserautomatisierung verwendet wird, kombiniert mit der Vertragsverwaltung, der Runbook-Beobachtbarkeit und der tiefen Vorschlagenerstellung durch Protokolle wie LSP","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar a recuperação confiável do contexto do código, a preparação da navegação semântica ou a reconstrução completa do RAG usando Puppeteer para automação de navegador, combinando com governança de contrato, observabilidade de runbook e geração profunda de propostas por meio de protocolos como LSP","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выполнять надежный возврат контекста кода, подготовку к навигации на основе семантики или полную перестройку RAG с помощью Puppeteer для автоматизации браузера, сочетая это с управлением контрактами, наблюдаемостью за runbook и глубокой генерацией предложений посредством протоколов, таких как LSP","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على أداء استرجاع سياق الشفرة الموثوق، استعداد الملاحة الدلالية أو إعادة بناء RAG الكاملة باستخدام Puppeteer للتحكم الآلي للمتصفح، مع الجمع بين حوكمة العقد والرصدية للكتاب والتنبؤ العميق من خلال بروتوكولات مثل LSP"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating browser interactions with Puppeteer for domain-driven tasks","Generating contract governance reports with audit-contracts-v3-ops integration","Debugging runbook observability issues with audit-runbook-observability integration"],"zh":["使用 Puppeteer 自动化浏览器交互以进行基于域的任务","使用 audit-contracts-v3-ops 集成生成契约治理报告","使用 audit-runbook-observability 集成调试运行手册可观察性问题"],"ja":["Puppeteer を使用したブラウザの相互作用の自動化でドメイン駆動のタスクを実行","audit-contracts-v3-ops の統合を使用して契約ガバナンスレポートを生成","audit-runbook-observability の統合を使用してランブックの可観測性の問題をデバッグ"],"ko":["Puppeteer를 사용하여 브라우저 상호작용을 자동화하여 도메인 기반 태스크를 수행","audit-contracts-v3-ops 통합을 사용하여 계약 治理 보고서 생성","audit-runbook-observability 통합을 사용하여 런북 관찰 가능성 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar interacciones del navegador con Puppeteer para tareas orientadas al dominio","Generar informes de gobernanza de contratos con integración de audit-contracts-v3-ops","Depurar problemas de observabilidad de runbook con integración de audit-runbook-observability"],"fr":["Automatiser les interactions du navigateur avec Puppeteer pour les tâches orientées vers le domaine","Générer des rapports de gouvernance des contrats avec une intégration de audit-contracts-v3-ops","Déboguer les problèmes d''observabilité des runbooks avec une intégration de audit-runbook-observability"],"de":["Automatisieren von Browser-Interaktionen mit Puppeteer für domänengetriebene Aufgaben","Erstellen von Vertragsverwaltungsberichten mit audit-contracts-v3-ops-Integration","Beheben von Runbook-Beobachtbarkeitsproblemen mit audit-runbook-observability-Integration"],"pt":["Automatizar interações de navegador com Puppeteer para tarefas orientadas por domínio","Gerar relatórios de governança de contrato com integração audit-contracts-v3-ops","Depurar problemas de observabilidade de runbook com integração audit-runbook-observability"],"ru":["Автоматизировать взаимодействия с браузером с помощью Puppeteer для задач, управляемых доменом","Генерировать отчеты по управлению контрактами с интеграцией audit-contracts-v3-ops","Отлаживать проблемы с наблюдаемостью за runbook с интеграцией audit-runbook-observability"],"ar":["تحكم آلي في التفاعلات المتصفح مع Puppeteer للمهام الموجهة بال домين","توليد تقارير حوكمة العقد مع التكامل audit-contracts-v3-ops","تصحيح أخطاء الرصدية للكتاب مع التكامل audit-runbook-observability"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Puppeteer for browser automation","Limited to RAG + MCP + LSP workflow","Needs integration with other skills like audit-contracts-v3-ops for full functionality"],"zh":["需要 Puppeteer 进行浏览器自动化","仅限 RAG + MCP + LSP 工作流","需要与其他技能（如 audit-contracts-v3-ops）集成以获得全部功能"],"ja":["ブラウザ自動化に Puppeteer が必要","RAG + MCP + LSP ワークフローに限定","audit-contracts-v3-ops などの他のスキルとの統合が必要であるため、完全な機能を提供できない"],"ko":["Puppeteer를 사용한 브라우저 자동화가必要","RAG + MCP + LSP 워크플로우로 제한","audit-contracts-v3-ops 等 다른 스킬との 통합이 필요한 全부 기능을 제공하지 않음"],"es":["Requiere Puppeteer para la automatización del navegador","Limitado a flujo de trabajo RAG + MCP + LSP","Necesita integración con otras habilidades como audit-contracts-v3-ops para la funcionalidad completa"],"fr":["Nécessite Puppeteer pour l''automatisation du navigateur","Limité au flux de travail RAG + MCP + LSP","Nécessite une intégration avec d''autres compétences comme audit-contracts-v3-ops pour la fonctionnalité complète"],"de":["Benötigt Puppeteer für die Browserautomatisierung","Begrenzt auf RAG + MCP + LSP-Workflow","Benötigt Integration mit anderen Fähigkeiten wie audit-contracts-v3-ops für die vollständige Funktionalität"],"pt":["Requer Puppeteer para automação de navegador","Limitado ao fluxo de trabalho RAG + MCP + LSP","Necessita de integração com outras habilidades, como audit-contracts-v3-ops, para funcionalidade completa"],"ru":["Требует Puppeteer для автоматизации браузера","Ограничен рабочим процессом RAG + MCP + LSP","Требует интеграции с другими навыками, такими как audit-contracts-v3-ops, для полной функциональности"],"ar":["يتطلب Puppeteer للتحكم الآلي للمتصفح","محدود بتدفق العمل RAG + MCP + LSP","يحتاج إلى التكامل مع مهارات أخرى مثل audit-contracts-v3-ops للوظائف الكاملة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"c2b0d7aa80f5db08e0cd9924ba796de5b755d2f2527dbc622ef764b4f5715ee0","qualityScore":44}');
