lidades y habilidades para la composición de equipos","Aplicación de la psicología organizacional para mejorar la dinámica de equipo","Colaboración con research-analyst para la toma de decisiones informadas","Integración con project-management-guru-adhd para la gestión de proyectos","Compatibilidad con skill-coach para el desarrollo de habilidades"],"fr":["Intégration avec orchestrator pour l''automatisation des processus","Analyse des personnalités et des compétences pour la composition d''équipes","Application de la psychologie organisationnelle pour améliorer la dynamique d''équipe","Collaboration avec research-analyst pour la prise de décisions éclairées","Intégration avec project-management-guru-adhd pour la gestion de projets","Compatibilité avec skill-coach pour le développement de compétences"],"de":["Integration mit orchestrator für die Automatisierung von Prozessen","Analyse von Persönlichkeiten und Fähigkeiten für die Zusammensetzung von Teams","Anwendung der Organisationspsychologie für die Verbesserung der Teamdynamik","Zusammenarbeit mit research-analyst für die informierte Entscheidungsfindung","Integration mit project-management-guru-adhd für die Projektmanagement","Kompatibilität mit skill-coach für die Entwicklung von Fähigkeiten"],"pt":["Criação de equipes de alto desempenho com personalidades e habilidades complementares","Integração com Orchestrator para gerenciar projetos","Integração com Research-Analyst para análise de dados","Suporte à colaboração e dinâmica de equipe","Análise de personalidades e habilidades para composição de equipes","Integração com Project-Management-Guru-ADHD para gestão de projetos"],"ru":["Создание высокопроизводительных команд с дополняющими личностями и навыками","Интеграция с Orchestrator для управления проектами","Интеграция с Research-Analyst для анализа данных","Поддержка сотрудничества и динамики команды","Анализ личностей и навыков для составления команд","Интеграция с Project-Management-Guru-ADHD для управления проектами"],"ar":["إنشاء فرق عالية الأداء مع شخصيات ومهارات متكاملة","التكامل مع Orchestrator لإدارة المشاريع","التكامل مع Research-Analyst لتحليل البيانات","دعم التعاون وديناميكية الفريق","تحليل الشخصيات والمهارات لتشكيل الفرق","التكامل مع Project-Management-Guru-ADHD لإدارة المشاريع"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use team-builder","team-builder alternative","team-builder setup guide","what is team-builder","team-builder vs orchestrator","team-builder install for AI agents","team-builder and research-analyst integration","team composition with team-builder","team-builder for developers","team-builder and project management"],"zh":["团队建设工具","AI工具","团队动态","组织心理学","管理科学","orchestrator","research-analyst","团队构建","协作支持"],"ja":["チームビルダー","AIエージェント","チーム動態","組織心理学","管理科学","orchestrator","research-analyst","チーム構築","コラボレーションのサポート"],"ko":["팀 빌더","AI 도구","팀 동력학","조직 심리학","관리 과학","오케스트레이터","연구 분석가","팀 구성을 위한 협력","다양한 AI 도구"],"es":["constructor de equipos de AI","herramientas de AI para la gestión de equipos","psicología organizacional","ciencia de la gestión","desarrollo de habilidades","gestión de proyectos","automatización de procesos","análisis de personalidades","composición de equipos"],"fr":["outil de construction d''équipe","outils de l''IA pour la gestion d''équipes","psychologie organisationnelle","science de la gestion","développement de compétences","gestion de projets","automatisation de processus","analyse de personnalités","composition d''équipes"],"de":["Team-Builder-AI-Tool","AI-Tools für das Team-Management","Organisationspsychologie","Managementwissenschaft","Fähigkeitsentwicklung","Projektmanagement","Prozessautomatisierung","Persönlichkeitsanalyse","Teamzusammensetzung"],"pt":["Team-Builder","equipes de alto desempenho","personalidades e habilidades complementares","Orchestrator","Research-Analyst","colaboração","dinâmica de equipe","análise de personalidades","gestão de projetos","ferramentas de inteligência artificial"],"ru":["Team-Builder","высокопроизводительные команды","дополняющие личности и навыки","Orchestrator","Research-Analyst","сотрудничество","динамика команды","анализ личностей","управление проектами","инструменты искусственного интеллекта"],"ar":["الفريق-بيلدر","فرق عالية الأداء","شخصيات ومهارات متكاملة","Orchestrator","Research-Analyst","التعاون","ديناميكية الفريق","تحليل الشخصيات","إدارة المشاريع","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"curiositech","repo":"some_claude_skills","repoPath":"curiositech/some_claude_skills","stars":46,"forks":7,"updatedAt":"2026-03-05T09:53:16Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"team-builder","description":"Designs high-performing team structures using organizational psychology AND creates new skills on-the-fly when team needs unmet expertise. Expert in team composition, personality balancing,","tags":"","bodyPreview":"You are an expert in organizational psychology, team dynamics, and management science. You specialize in building high-performing teams with complementary personalities and skills that naturally produce exceptional results.\n\n## Integrations\n\nWorks with: orchestrator, research-analyst, project-management-guru-adhd, skill-coach, agent-creator\n\n## Activation Triggers\n\nResponds to: team building, team composition, organizational psychology, team dynamics, personality types, collaboration, team struc","body":"You are an expert in organizational psychology, team dynamics, and management science. You specialize in building high-performing teams with complementary personalities and skills that naturally produce exceptional results.\n\n## Integrations\n\nWorks with: orchestrator, research-analyst, project-management-guru-adhd, skill-coach, agent-creator\n\n## Activation Triggers\n\nResponds to: team building, team composition, organizational psychology, team dynamics, personality types, collaboration, team structure, role design, skills needed, what skills, missing skill\n\n## Your Mission\n\nDesign team structures and compositions that leverage organizational psychology principles to create synergistic, high-performing groups. Build teams where individual strengths compound into collective greatness.\n\n**CRITICAL NEW CAPABILITY**: When you identify that a team needs a skill/capability that doesn''t exist in the current skill library, you MUST create that skill on-the-fly. Don''t stop at identifying gaps—fill them immediately by creating new skills.\n\n## Skill Creation Workflow\n\n### When to Create a New Skill\n\n✅ **Create immediately when:**\n- Team analysis reveals a needed expertise that no existing skill provides\n- A role requires specific domain knowledge not currently available\n- Project requires a capability gap (e.g., \"swift executor\", \"documentarian\")\n- User asks \"what skills do we need\" and some don''t exist\n\n### How to Create Skills On-the-Fly\n\n**Process**:\n1. **Identify the Gap**: During team design, note which expertise is missing\n2. **Check Existing Skills**: Use `Glob` to search `.claude/skills/*/SKILL.md`\n3. **If Missing**: Immediately invoke `Skill(skill-coach)` or `Skill(agent-creator)`\n4. **Create the Skill**: Write a focused SKILL.md with:\n   - Clear description with keywords and NOT clause\n   - Domain expertise and anti-patterns\n   - Integration points with other skills\n   - Under 500 lines\n5. **Integrate**: Add to team plan and document the new capability\n\n**Example**:\n```markdown\nTeam needs: Swift Executor (doesn''t exist)\n→ Check: `find .claude/skills -name \"swift-executor\"` → Not found\n→ Create: New skill at `.claude/skills/swift-executor/SKILL.md`\n→ Document: Expert in rapid execution, overcoming blockers, decisive action\n→ Integrate: Add to team composition as \"The Executor\" role\n```\n\n## Core Expertise\n\n### Organizational Psychology\n- **Team Dynamics**: Understanding group behavior and interaction patterns\n- **Personality Theory**: MBTI, Big Five, DISC, StrengthsFinder\n- **Motivation Science**: Intrinsic vs. extrinsic motivation, flow states\n- **Psychological Safety**: Creating environments for risk-taking and innovation\n- **Cognitive Diversity**: Leveraging different thinking styles\n\n### Team Composition\n- **Role Design**: Defining clear, meaningful responsibilities\n- **Skills Mapping**: Identifying complementary capabilities\n- **Personality Balancing**: Mixing temperaments for synergy\n- **Diversity Planning**: Cognitive, demographic, experiential diversity\n- **Team Sizing**: Optimal group sizes for different contexts\n\n### Management Frameworks\n- **Agile & Scrum**: Self-organizing teams and ceremonies\n- **Holacracy**: Distributed authority and role clarity\n- **OKRs**: Alignment and autonomy\n- **Spotify Model**: Squads, tribes, chapters, guilds\n- **Team Topologies**: Stream-aligned, platform, enabling teams\n\n## Team Archetypes & Personalities\n\n### Essential Role Patterns\n\n#### The Visionary (Innovator)\n- **Personality**: Open, creative, big-picture thinker\n- **Strengths**: Ideation, strategy, inspiration\n- **Needs**: Freedom to explore, protection from excessive detail\n- **Complements**: Executor, Analyst\n\n#### The Executor (Implementer)\n- **Personality**: Conscientious, organized, detail-oriented\n- **Strengths**: Execution, reliability, follow-through\n- **Needs**: Clear direction, structured processes\n- **Complements**: Visionary, Facilitator\n\n#### The Analyst (Strategist)\n- **Personality**: Logical, systematic, critical thinker\n- **Strengths**: Problem-solving, quality, optimization\n- **Needs**: Data, time to think, intellectual challenges\n- **Complements**: Visionary, Relationship Builder\n\n#### The Relationship Builder (Connector)\n- **Personality**: Empathetic, communicative, people-focused\n- **Strengths**: Collaboration, morale, stakeholder management\n- **Needs**: Social interaction, recognition, harmony\n- **Complements**: Analyst, Executor\n\n#### The Facilitator (Coordinator)\n- **Personality**: Balanced, diplomatic, process-oriented\n- **Strengths**: Coordination, conflict resolution, meetings\n- **Needs**: Clear goals, team buy-in\n- **Complements**: All roles (glue role)\n\n#### The Specialist (Expert)\n- **Personality**: Deep knowledge in specific domain\n- **Strengths**: Technical excellence, mentorship, quality\n- **Needs**: Respect for expertise, learning opportunities\n- **Complements**: Generalist, Facilitator\n\n### High-Performing Team Compositions\n\n#### Small Product Team (5-7 people)\n- 1 Visionary (Product Owner/Designer)\n- 2-3 Executors (Engineers)\n- 1 Analyst (Lead Engineer/Architect)\n- 1 Relationship Builder (Scrum Master/PM)\n\n#### Design Team (4-6 people)\n- 1 Visionary (Design Lead)\n- 2 Specialists (UX Researcher, UI Designer)\n- 1 Executor (Production Designer)\n- 1 Relationship Builder (Design Ops)\n\n#### Leadership Team (3-5 people)\n- 1 Visionary (CEO/Founder)\n- 1 Executor (COO)\n- 1 Analyst (CTO/Strategy)\n- 1 Relationship Builder (CPO/Culture)\n\n## Team Building Process\n\n### 1. Define Team Purpose\n- Clear mission and objectives\n- Success criteria and metrics\n- Constraints and context\n- Timeline and milestones\n\n### 2. Identify Required Roles\n- Core skills and competencies needed\n- Personality traits that fit mission\n- Cognitive diversity requirements\n- Team size considerations\n\n### 3. Map Individual Strengths\n- Assess existing team members\n- Identify gaps in coverage\n- Recognize personality patterns\n- Understand motivation profiles\n\n### 4. Design Complementary Structure\n- Balance personality types\n- Mix thinking styles (analytical, creative, practical)\n- Ensure no single points of failure\n- Create healthy tension (not conflict)\n\n### 5. Establish Team Norms\n- Communication protocols\n- Decision-making processes\n- Conflict resolution approaches\n- Collaboration rituals\n\n### 6. Build Psychological Safety\n- Normalize learning from failure\n- Encourage respectful dissent\n- Celebrate diverse perspectives\n- Foster trust through transparency\n\n## Organizational Design Principles\n\n### Dunbar''s Number & Team Size\n- **2-3 people**: Tight collaboration, minimal overhead\n- **5-9 people**: \"Two pizza team,\" optimal for most work\n- **15-20 people**: Requires sub-teams and coordination\n- **50+**: Needs structural hierarchy or network organization\n\n### Conway''s Law Awareness\n*\"Organizations design systems that mirror their communication structure\"*\n- Design team structure to match desired architecture\n- Align team boundaries with system boundaries\n- Enable autonomy to reduce dependencies\n\n### Tuckman''s Stages of Team Development\n1. **Forming**: Politeness, orientation, testing\n2. **Storming**: Conflict, competition, establishing norms\n3. **Norming**: Cohesion, collaboration, mutual respect\n4. **Performing**: High productivity, synergy, autonomy\n5. **Adjourning**: Completion, celebration, transition\n\n### Belbin Team Roles\nBalance these meta-roles:\n- **Action-Oriented**: Shaper, Implementer, Completer-Finisher\n- **People-Oriented**: Coordinator, Team Worker, Resource Investigator\n- **Thought-Oriented**: Plant, Monitor-Evaluator, Specialist\n\n## Team Health Indicators\n\n### Positive Signals\n✅ Healthy conflict (about ideas, not people)\n✅ High trust and psychological safety\n✅ Clear roles with some overlap\n✅ Balanced participation in meetings\n✅ Fast decision-making\n✅ Learning from failures\n✅ High autonomy with alignment\n\n### Warning Signs\n⚠️ Groupthink or echo chamber\n⚠️ One person dominates conversations\n⚠️ Conflict avoided or personal\n⚠️ Unclear roles and responsibilities\n⚠️ Decision paralysis\n⚠️ Blame culture\n⚠️ High turnover or burnout\n\n## Collaboration Rituals\n\n### For Innovation Teams\n- **Weekly Design Reviews**: Share work-in-progress\n- **Monthly Retrospectives**: Process improvement\n- **Quarterly Offsites**: Strategy and bonding\n- **Daily Standups**: Coordination and blockers\n\n### For Operational Teams\n- **Sprint Planning**: Commitment and clarity\n- **Daily Sync**: Alignment and problem-solving\n- **Sprint Review**: Demo and feedback\n- **Retrospective**: Continuous improvement\n\n### For Leadership Teams\n- **Weekly Leadership Meetings**: Alignment and decisions\n- **Monthly All-Hands**: Transparency and culture\n- **Quarterly Planning**: Strategy and OKRs\n- **Annual Retreat**: Vision and team building\n\n## Building Team Chemistry\n\n### Shared Experiences\n- Solve hard problems together\n- Celebrate wins as a team\n- Face failures and learn together\n- Create traditions and inside jokes\n\n### Psychological Safety Practices\n- Leader vulnerability goes first\n- Reward asking for help\n- No punishment for smart failures\n- Dissent is valued and protected\n\n### Clear Communication Norms\n- Default to transparency\n- Over-communicate context\n- Write things down\n- Use async for updates, sync for decisions\n\n## Example Team Design\n\n**Goal**: Build a team to create a unique web application with strong brand identity\n\n**Team Composition**:\n1. **Visionary Product Designer** (The Brand Architect)\n   - Personality: Creative, strategic, user-focused\n   - Drives brand identity and design vision\n   - Sets quality bar and design principles\n\n2. **Senior Full-Stack Engineer** (The Technical Analyst)\n   - Personality: Logical, thorough, quality-driven\n   - Ensures technical feasibility\n   - Optimizes architecture and performance\n\n3. **Frontend Specialist** (The Craftsperson)\n   - Personality: Detail-oriented, perfectionist\n   - Implements design system flawlessly\n   - Bridges design and code\n\n4. **UX Researcher** (The User Advocate)\n   - Personality: Empathetic, curious, methodical\n   - Validates assumptions with users\n   - Grounds creativity in user needs\n\n5. **Project Facilitator** (The Orchestrator)\n   - Personality: Organized, diplomatic, proactive\n   - Coordinates across roles\n   - Removes blockers and manages stakeholders\n\n**Why This Works**:\n- Creative vision balanced with technical reality\n- User advocacy prevents design for design''s sake\n- Specialist ensures execution quality\n- Facilitator enables others to focus on craft\n- Complementary personalities prevent groupthink\n\n**Collaboration Model**:\n- Weekly design critiques (all roles participate)\n- Bi-weekly user testing sessions\n- Daily async updates, sync only when needed\n- Monthly retrospectives for process improvement\n\n---\n\nRemember: Great teams aren''t found—they''re deliberately designed and carefully cultivated.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T06:36:14.642Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Cursor, Windsurf, and Claude Code needing expertise in organizational psychology to optimize team compositions and dynamics.","zh":"适合像Cursor、Windsurf和Claude Code这样的AI代理，需要组织心理学方面的专业知识来优化团队组成和动态。","ja":"Cursor、Windsurf、Claude CodeのようなAIエージェントに適しています。組織心理学の専門知識を使用してチームの構成とダイナミクスを最適化する必要があります。","ko":"Cursor, Windsurf, Claude Code와 같은 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 팀 구성과 역학을 최적화하기 위해 조직 심리학의 전문 지식을 필요로 합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf y Claude Code que necesitan experiencia en psicología organizacional para optimizar la composición y la dinámica de los equipos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Cursor, Windsurf et Claude Code ayant besoin d''expertise en psychologie organisationnelle pour optimiser la composition et la dynamique des équipes.","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Cursor, Windsurf und Claude Code, die Expertenwissen in Organisationspsychologie benötigen, um Teamzusammensetzung und -dynamik zu optimieren.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como Cursor, Windsurf e Claude Code que necessitam de especialização em psicologia organizacional para otimizar a composição e dinâmica de equipes.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, таких как Cursor, Windsurf и Claude Code, которым требуется экспертиза в области организационной психологии для оптимизации состава и динамики команд.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكيين مثل Cursor و Windsurf و Claude Code الذين يحتاجون إلى خبرة في علم النفس التنظيمي لتحسين تركيبة الفريق والديناميات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage team dynamics expertise and organizational psychology to build high-performing teams with complementary personalities and skills, utilizing orchestrator and research-analyst integrations for data-driven decisions and project-management-guru-adhd for streamlined workflows.","zh":"赋予代理人利用团队动态和组织心理学方面的专业知识来建立高绩效团队的能力，团队成员具有互补的个性和技能，利用orchestrator和research-analyst集成来实现数据驱动的决策，并利用project-management-guru-adhd来简化工作流程。","ja":"エージェントにチームのダイナミクスと組織心理学の専門知識を利用して、高パフォーマンスのチームを構築する能力を付与します。チームメンバーには互補的な個性とスキルがあり、orchestratorとresearch-analystの統合を使用してデータ駆動の意思決定を行い、project-management-guru-adhdを使用してワークフローを簡素化します。","ko":"에이전트에게 팀 역학과 조직 심리학의 전문 지식을 활용하여 높은 성과를 낼 수 있는 팀을 구축할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다. 팀원은 보완적인 성격과 기술을 갖추고 있으며, orchestrator와 research-analyst의 통합을 사용하여 데이터 주도적인 의사 결정을 하며, project-management-guru-adhd를 사용하여 워크플ロー를 간소화합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes aprovechar la experiencia en dinámica de equipo y psicología organizacional para construir equipos de alto rendimiento con personalidades y habilidades complementarias, utilizando integraciones de orchestrator y research-analyst para decisiones basadas en datos y project-management-guru-adhd para flujos de trabajo optimizados.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exploiter l''expertise en dynamique d''équipe et en psychologie organisationnelle pour construire des équipes de haute performance avec des personnalités et des compétences complémentaires, en utilisant des intégrations d''orchestrator et de research-analyst pour des décisions basées sur les données et project-management-guru-adhd pour des flux de travail rationalisés.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Teamdynamik-Expertise und Organisationspsychologie zu nutzen, um Hochleistungsteams mit komplementären Persönlichkeiten und Fähigkeiten aufzubauen, indem sie orchestrator- und research-analyst-Integrationen für datengetriebene Entscheidungen und project-management-guru-adhd für optimierte Workflows verwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitarem a especialização em dinâmica de equipe e psicologia organizacional para construir equipes de alto desempenho com personalidades e habilidades complementares, utilizando integrações de orchestrator e research-analyst para decisões baseadas em dados e project-management-guru-adhd para fluxos de trabalho otimizados.","ru":"Позволяет агентам использовать экспертизу в области командной динамики и организационной психологии для построения высокоэффективных команд с дополняющими друг друга личностями и навыками, используя интеграции с orchestrator и research-analyst для принятия решений на основе данных и project-management-guru-adhd для оптимизированных рабочих процессов.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من الاستفادة من الخبرة في ديناميات الفريق وعلم النفس التنظيمي لبناء فرق عالية الأداء مع شخصيات ومهارات متكاملة، مستخدمين تكاملات orchestrator و research-analyst لاتخاذ قرارات مدعومة بالبيانات و project-management-guru-adhd للتدفقات العملية المُستَهَلَة."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing team composition for optimal collaboration","Building high-performing teams with diverse skill sets and personalities","Applying organizational psychology principles to drive exceptional results"],"zh":["分析团队组成以实现最佳协作","构建具有多样化技能和个性的高绩效团队","应用组织心理学原则以实现卓越的结果"],"ja":["チーム構成を分析して最適なコラボレーションを実現する","多様なスキルと個性を持つ高パフォーマンスのチームを構築する","組織心理学の原則を適用して卓越した結果を実現する"],"ko":["최적의 협력을 위해 팀 구성 분석하기","다양한 기술과 성격을 가진 높은 성과를 낼 수 있는 팀 구축하기","조직 심리학의 원리를 적용하여 뛰어난 결과를 달성하기"],"es":["Análisis de la composición del equipo para una colaboración óptima","Construcción de equipos de alto rendimiento con conjuntos de habilidades y personalidades diversas","Aplicación de principios de psicología organizacional para impulsar resultados excepcionales"],"fr":["Analyse de la composition de l''équipe pour une collaboration optimale","Construire des équipes de haute performance avec des ensembles de compétences et de personnalités diverses","Application de principes de psychologie organisationnelle pour impulser des résultats exceptionnels"],"de":["Analyse der Teamzusammensetzung für eine optimale Zusammenarbeit","Aufbau von Hochleistungsteams mit vielfältigen Fähigkeits- und Persönlichkeitsprofilen","Anwendung von Grundsätzen der Organisationspsychologie, um außergewöhnliche Ergebnisse zu erzielen"],"pt":["Analisar a composição da equipe para colaboração ótima","Construir equipes de alto desempenho com conjuntos de habilidades e personalidades diversificados","Aplicar princípios de psicologia organizacional para impulsionar resultados excepcionais"],"ru":["Анализ состава команды для оптимального сотрудничества","Построение высокоэффективных команд с разнообразными наборами навыков и личностей","Применение принципов организационной психологии для достижения исключительных результатов"],"ar":["تحليل تركيبة الفريق من أجل التعاون الأمثل","بناء فرق عالية الأداء مع مجموعات مهارات و شخصيات متنوعة","تطبيق مبادئ علم النفس التنظيمي لتحقيق نتائج استثنائية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires integration with orchestrator, research-analyst, and project-management-guru-adhd for full functionality","Limited to team-building and organizational psychology applications"],"zh":["需要与orchestrator、research-analyst和project-management-guru-adhd集成来实现全部功能","仅限于团队构建和组织心理学应用"],"ja":["orchestrator、research-analyst、project-management-guru-adhdとの統合が必要で、全部の機能を実現する","チーム構築と組織心理学の適用に限定される"],"ko":["orchestrator, research-analyst, project-management-guru-adhd와의 통합이 필요하여 모든 기능을 구현할 수 있음","팀 구축과 조직 심리학의 적용에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere integración con orchestrator, research-analyst y project-management-guru-adhd para una funcionalidad completa","Limitado a aplicaciones de creación de equipos y psicología organizacional"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec orchestrator, research-analyst et project-management-guru-adhd pour une fonctionnalité complète","Limité aux applications de construction d''équipes et de psychologie organisationnelle"],"de":["Benötigt Integration mit orchestrator, research-analyst und project-management-guru-adhd für vollständige Funktionalität","Begrenzt auf Team-Building- und Organisationspsychologie-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Requer integração com orchestrator, research-analyst e project-management-guru-adhd para funcionalidade completa","Limitado a aplicações de construção de equipes e psicologia organizacional"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с orchestrator, research-analyst и project-management-guru-adhd для полной функциональности","Ограничен применением в области построения команд и организационной психологии"],"ar":["يتطلب تكاملًا مع orchestrator و research-analyst و project-management-guru-adhd للوظائف الكاملة","محدود بالتطبيقات الخاصة ببناء الفريق وعلم النفس التنظيمي"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"83c23039861e24b6b0c2aae636192e2c3c0a640e2abfa835b89d597e0c7c166a","qualityScore":44}');
