iOS e Xcode.","ru":"Что такое bump-ios-version? Это ИИ Агент, который обновляет версию iOS и Xcode.","ar":"ما هي bump-ios-version؟ هي أداة ذكاء اصطناعي لتحديث إصدار آي أو إس و إكس كود."},"features":{"en":["Prompts users for target iOS and Xcode versions","Verifies version support with CircleCI","Supports multiple iPhone models for simulators","Works with React-Native, Objective-C, and Swift","Checks supported Xcode versions at CircleCI developer portal","Guides through bumping iOS and Xcode versions in Eigen"],"zh":["升级iOS版本","升级Xcode版本","支持CircleCI","支持React Native","自动化版本升级","支持iPhone模拟器"],"ja":["iOSバージョンのアップグレード","Xcodeバージョンのアップグレード","CircleCIのサポート","React Nativeのサポート","自動化されたバージョンアップグレード","iPhoneシミュレーターのサポート"],"ko":["iOS 버전 업그레이드","Xcode 버전 업그레이드","CircleCI 지원","React Native 지원","자동화된 버전 업그레이드","iPhone 시뮬레이터 지원"],"es":["Compatibilidad con CircleCI","Verificación de versiones compatibles","Actualización de la versión de iOS","Actualización de la versión de Xcode","Selección del modelo de iPhone para simuladores"],"fr":["Prise en charge de CircleCI","Vérification des versions prises en charge","Mise à jour de la version d''iOS","Mise à jour de la version de Xcode","Sélection du modèle d''iPhone pour les simulateurs"],"de":["Unterstützung für CircleCI","Überprüfung der kompatiblen Versionen","Aktualisierung der iOS-Version","Aktualisierung der Xcode-Version","Auswahl des iPhone-Modells für Simulatoren"],"pt":["Atualiza a versão do iOS","Atualiza a versão do Xcode","Verifica a compatibilidade com o CircleCI","Suporta diferentes modelos de iPhone","Permite a escolha da versão do Xcode","Permite a escolha do modelo de iPhone para simulações"],"ru":["Обновляет версию iOS","Обновляет версию Xcode","Проверяет совместимость с CircleCI","Поддерживает разные модели iPhone","Позволяет выбрать версию Xcode","Позволяет выбрать модель iPhone для симуляций"],"ar":["تحديث إصدار آي أو إس","تحديث إصدار إكس كود","التحقق من التوافق مع CircleCI","دعم نماذج آي فون مختلفة","السماح باختيار إصدار إكس كود","السماح باختيار نموذج آي فون للсимуляت"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use bump-ios-version","bump-ios-version setup guide","bump-ios-version alternative","bump-ios-version vs Xcode version manager","bump-ios-version install","what is bump-ios-version","bump-ios-version for React-Native","bump-ios-version for iOS development","bump-ios-version and CircleCI integration"],"zh":["iOS版本升级","Xcode版本升级","CircleCI","React Native","AIエージェント","iOS开发","Xcode开发","自动化版本升级"],"ja":["iOSバージョンアップグレード","Xcodeバージョンアップグレード","CircleCI","React Native","AIエージェント","iOS開発","Xcode開発","自動化されたバージョンアップグレード"],"ko":["iOS 버전 업그레이드","Xcode 버전 업그레이드","CircleCI","React Native","AI 도구","iOS 개발","Xcode 개발","자동화된 버전 업그레이드"],"es":["bump-ios-version","actualización de versión de iOS","actualización de versión de Xcode","compatibilidad con CircleCI","desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles","herramientas de desarrollo de iOS"],"fr":["bump-ios-version","mise à jour de la version d''iOS","mise à jour de la version de Xcode","prise en charge de CircleCI","développement d''applications mobiles","outils de développement d''iOS"],"de":["bump-ios-version","Aktualisierung der iOS-Version","Aktualisierung der Xcode-Version","Unterstützung für CircleCI","Entwicklung von mobilen Anwendungen","Entwicklungstools für iOS"],"pt":["bump ios version","atualizar ios","atualizar xcode","circleci","desenvolvimento ios","react native","swift","objective-c"],"ru":["bump ios version","обновить ios","обновить xcode","circleci","разработка ios","react native","swift","objective-c"],"ar":["bump ios version","تحديث آي أو إس","تحديث إكس كود","circleci","تطوير آي أو إس","react native","swift","objective-c"]}},"owner":"artsy","repo":"eigen","repoPath":"artsy/eigen","stars":3757,"forks":593,"updatedAt":"2026-02-25T20:04:02Z","topics":["android","app","app-store","art","ios","objective-c","react-native","swift"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"bump-ios-version","description":"Bump iOS and Xcode versions in Eigen. Use when the user wants to upgrade iOS SDK version, update Xcode version, change simulator version, or update CI configuration for new iOS/Xcode releases.","bodyPreview":"# Bump iOS/Xcode Version\n\nThis skill guides you through bumping the iOS and Xcode version in Eigen.\n\n## Before You Start\n\n**Prompt the user for the target version:**\n\n- Ask which iOS version they want to bump to (e.g., \"26.2\")\n- Ask which Xcode version they want to use (e.g., \"26.2\")\n- Ask which iPhone model to use for simulators (e.g., \"iPhone 17 Pro\")\n\n**Verify version support before making changes:**\n\n### CircleCI Support\n\nCheck supported Xcode versions at: https://circleci.com/developer/mach","body":"# Bump iOS/Xcode Version\n\nThis skill guides you through bumping the iOS and Xcode version in Eigen.\n\n## Before You Start\n\n**Prompt the user for the target version:**\n\n- Ask which iOS version they want to bump to (e.g., \"26.2\")\n- Ask which Xcode version they want to use (e.g., \"26.2\")\n- Ask which iPhone model to use for simulators (e.g., \"iPhone 17 Pro\")\n\n**Verify version support before making changes:**\n\n### CircleCI Support\n\nCheck supported Xcode versions at: https://circleci.com/developer/machine/image/xcode\n\nCurrently supported versions include:\n\n- 26.2, 26.1.1, 26.1, 26.0.1, 26.0\n- 16.4, 16.3, 16.2\n\n### GitHub Actions Support\n\nCheck macOS runner images at: https://github.com/actions/runner-images\n\nFor macOS 15 runners, available Xcode versions include:\n\n- 26.2, 26.1.1, 26.0.1\n- 16.4 (default), 16.3, 16.2, 16.1, 16.0\n\nIf the requested version is not supported by both CI systems, warn the user that CI builds may fail.\n\n### iPhone Device Compatibility\n\nDifferent iOS versions require specific iPhone simulator models. **You must verify the iPhone model is available for the target iOS version in CircleCI''s image manifest.**\n\n**How to verify:**\n\n1. Go to https://circleci.com/docs/guides/test/testing-ios/#supported-xcode-versions\n2. Find the target Xcode version row\n3. Click on \"Installed software\" link in the \"VM Software Manifest\" column\n4. In the manifest, search for the iOS version to see which iPhone simulators are available\n\n**Example compatibility (from CircleCI Xcode 26.2 manifest):**\n\n| iOS Version | Available iPhone Models                                                 |\n| ----------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| iOS 18.x    | iPhone 16 Pro, iPhone 16 Pro Max, iPhone 16, iPhone 16 Plus, iPhone 16e |\n| iOS 26.x    | iPhone 17 Pro, iPhone 17 Pro Max, iPhone 17, iPhone Air, iPhone 16e     |\n\n**Important:** iOS 26 simulators require iPhone 17 series devices. Using iPhone 16 Pro with iOS 26 will fail because it''s not available in the manifest.\n\n## Steps\n\n### 1. Update `ios-config.json` (single source of truth)\n\nUpdate ALL fields in `ios-config.json` at the project root:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"xcode_version\": \"<NEW_XCODE_VERSION>\",\n  \"ios_version\": \"<NEW_IOS_VERSION>\",\n  \"iphone_model\": \"<NEW_IPHONE_MODEL>\",\n  \"simulator_device_type\": \"com.apple.CoreSimulator.SimDeviceType.<DEVICE-TYPE-ID>\",\n  \"simulator_runtime\": \"com.apple.CoreSimulator.SimRuntime.iOS-<MAJOR>-<MINOR>\"\n}\n```\n\n### 2. Update `.circleci/config.yml` (cannot read from JSON at runtime)\n\nCircleCI pipeline parameter defaults must be static YAML values. Update these three values in the `parameters` section:\n\n```yaml\nparameters:\n  xcode_version:\n    type: string\n    default: \"<NEW_XCODE_VERSION>\"\n  simulator_version:\n    type: string\n    default: \"<NEW_IOS_VERSION>\"\n```\n\nAlso update the `device` in the `macos/preboot-simulator` step of the `build-test-app-ios` job:\n\n```yaml\n- macos/preboot-simulator:\n    version: << pipeline.parameters.simulator_version >>\n    platform: \"iOS\"\n    device: \"<NEW_IPHONE_MODEL>\"\n```\n\n### 3. That''s It!\n\nThe following files read directly from `ios-config.json` and need NO manual updates:\n\n- `scripts/ci/ci-setup-export-vars` (reads via `jq`)\n- `scripts/utils/doctor.js` (reads via `fs.readFileSync` + `JSON.parse`)\n- `fastlane/Fastfile` (reads via `File.read` + `JSON.parse`)\n- `.github/actions/setup-ios-environment/action.yml` (reads via `jq`)\n- `.github/workflows/ios-e2e-maestro.yml` (reads via `jq`)\n- `ios/ArtsyTests/Supporting_Files/ARTestHelper.m` (reads via `NSJSONSerialization` from test bundle)\n\n## Summary Checklist\n\n- [ ] Verify target Xcode version is supported by CircleCI\n- [ ] Verify target Xcode version is supported by GitHub Actions\n- [ ] Verify iPhone model is available for target iOS version (check CircleCI manifest)\n- [ ] Update `ios-config.json`\n- [ ] Update `.circleci/config.yml` (xcode_version, simulator_version, preboot-simulator device)\n\n## Testing (done by user)\n\nAfter making changes:\n\n1. Push changes and verify CircleCI builds pass\n2. Verify GitHub Actions E2E tests create the simulator correctly\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T06:25:05.151Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Mobile App Agents requiring streamlined iOS and Xcode version updates for React-Native, Objective-C, and Swift projects.","zh":"适用于需要为React-Native、Objective-C和Swift项目简化iOS和Xcode版本更新的移动应用代理。","ja":"React-Native、Objective-C、SwiftプロジェクトのiOSとXcodeバージョンアップデートをストリームライン化する必要があるモバイルアプリエージェントに適しています。","ko":"React-Native, Objective-C, Swift 프로젝트를 위한 iOS 및 Xcode 버전 업데이트를 간소화해야 하는 모바일 앱 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Aplicaciones Móviles que requieren actualizaciones de versiones de iOS y Xcode optimizadas para proyectos React-Native, Objective-C y Swift.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''applications mobiles nécessitant des mises à jour de versions iOS et Xcode rationalisées pour les projets React-Native, Objective-C et Swift.","de":"Ideal für Mobile App Agents, die optimierte iOS- und Xcode-Versionen-Updates für React-Native-, Objective-C- und Swift-Projekte benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Aplicativos Móveis que exigem atualizações de iOS e Xcode otimizadas para projetos React-Native, Objective-C e Swift.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов мобильных приложений, требующих упрощенных обновлений iOS и Xcode для проектов React-Native, Objective-C и Swift.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطبيقات الجوال التي تتطلب تحديثات iOS و Xcode المُتدَفقة لمشاريع React-Native و Objective-C و Swift."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to update iOS and Xcode versions in Eigen, supporting CircleCI and simulator configurations for iPhone models, while ensuring version compatibility and support.","zh":"赋予代理更新Eigen中的iOS和Xcode版本的能力，支持CircleCI和模拟器配置以适应iPhone机型，同时确保版本兼容性和支持。","ja":"Eigenの中でiOSとXcodeバージョンを更新するエージェントの能力を与え、CircleCIとシミュレータ構成をサポートしてiPhoneモデルに対応し、バージョンの互換性とサポートを確保します。","ko":"Eigen에서 iOS 및 Xcode 버전을 업데이트하는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하여 CircleCI 및 시뮬레이터 구성이 iPhone 모델을 지원하고 버전 호환성 및 지원을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para actualizar las versiones de iOS y Xcode en Eigen, admitiendo configuraciones de CircleCI y simuladores para modelos de iPhone, garantizando la compatibilidad y el soporte de versiones.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre à jour les versions iOS et Xcode dans Eigen, en prenant en charge les configurations CircleCI et les simulateurs pour les modèles iPhone, tout en garantissant la compatibilité et le support des versions.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, iOS- und Xcode-Versionen in Eigen zu aktualisieren, unterstützt CircleCI- und Simulator-Konfigurationen für iPhone-Modelle und stellt die Versionskompatibilität und den Support sicher.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a atualizar as versões do iOS e do Xcode no Eigen, com suporte a configurações do CircleCI e simuladores para modelos de iPhone, garantindo a compatibilidade e o suporte de versão.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обновлять версии iOS и Xcode в Eigen, поддерживая конфигурации CircleCI и симуляторы для моделей iPhone, обеспечивая совместимость и поддержку версий.","ar":"يُفعّل العميل لتحديث إصدارات iOS و Xcode في Eigen، مع دعم لتهيئة CircleCI ومحاكيات لطرازات iPhone، مما يضمن توافق الإصدارات ودعمها."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating iOS version bumps for Artsy''s mobile app","Updating Xcode versions for compatibility with new iPhone models","Verifying CircleCI support for targeted Xcode versions"],"zh":["为Artsy的移动应用自动执行iOS版本更新","更新Xcode版本以与新iPhone机型兼容","验证CircleCI对目标Xcode版本的支持"],"ja":["ArtsyのモバイルアプリのiOSバージョン更新を自動化する","新しいiPhoneモデルと互換性のあるXcodeバージョンを更新する","ターゲットXcodeバージョンに対するCircleCIのサポートを検証する"],"ko":["Artsy의 모바일 앱을 위한 iOS 버전 업데이트를 자동화하는 것","新的 iPhone 모델과 호환되는 Xcode 버전을 업데이트하는 것","목표 Xcode 버전에 대한 CircleCI 지원을 확인하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar los aumentos de versión de iOS para la aplicación móvil de Artsy","Actualizar las versiones de Xcode para la compatibilidad con nuevos modelos de iPhone","Verificar el soporte de CircleCI para versiones de Xcode objetivo"],"fr":["Automatiser les mises à jour de version iOS pour l''application mobile Artsy","Mettre à jour les versions de Xcode pour la compatibilité avec les nouveaux modèles iPhone","Vérifier le support de CircleCI pour les versions cibles de Xcode"],"de":["Automatisieren von iOS-Versionen-Updates für die Mobile App von Artsy","Aktualisieren von Xcode-Versionen für die Kompatibilität mit neuen iPhone-Modellen","Überprüfen des CircleCI-Supports für gezielte Xcode-Versionen"],"pt":["Automatizar aumentos de versão do iOS para o aplicativo móvel da Artsy","Atualizar versões do Xcode para compatibilidade com novos modelos de iPhone","Verificar suporte do CircleCI para versões do Xcode direcionadas"],"ru":["Автоматизация обновлений версий iOS для мобильного приложения Artsy","Обновление версий Xcode для совместимости с новыми моделями iPhone","Проверка поддержки CircleCI для целевых версий Xcode"],"ar":["أتمتة رفع إصدارات iOS لتطبيق Artsy المُدار على الجوال","تحديث إصدارات Xcode لتوافقها مع طرازات iPhone الجديدة","التحقق من دعم CircleCI للإصدارات المستهدفة من Xcode"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Eigen environment","Limited to iOS and Xcode version updates","Dependent on CircleCI support for Xcode versions"],"zh":["需要Eigen环境","仅限于iOS和Xcode版本更新","依赖于CircleCI对Xcode版本的支持"],"ja":["Eigen環境が必要","iOSとXcodeバージョンアップデートのみ","Xcodeバージョンに対するCircleCIサポートに依存"],"ko":["Eigen 환경이 필요합니다.","iOS 및 Xcode 버전 업데이트에만 제한됩니다.","Xcode 버전에 대한 CircleCI 지원에 의존합니다."],"es":["Requiere entorno Eigen","Limitado a actualizaciones de versiones de iOS y Xcode","Dependiente del soporte de CircleCI para versiones de Xcode"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Eigen","Limité aux mises à jour de versions iOS et Xcode","Dépend du support de CircleCI pour les versions de Xcode"],"de":["Benötigt Eigen-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf iOS- und Xcode-Versionen-Updates","Abhängig vom CircleCI-Support für Xcode-Versionen"],"pt":["Exige ambiente Eigen","Limitado a atualizações de versão do iOS e Xcode","Dependente do suporte do CircleCI para versões do Xcode"],"ru":["Требует среды Eigen","Ограничен обновлениями версий iOS и Xcode","Зависит от поддержки CircleCI для версий Xcode"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Eigen","محدود بتحديثات إصدارات iOS و Xcode","يعتمد على دعم CircleCI لإصدارات Xcode"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"24cbad2ad6b2d5796e78537762619949c6ccfe5d00c2e330e4b246aa09886d5b","qualityScore":43}');
