re les pages avec Streamlit","Utilisation d''ECharts pour visualiser les données","Compatibilité avec Python","Création d''applications avec plusieurs pages","Personnalisation de l''interface utilisateur avec Streamlit"],"de":["Verzeichnisstruktur für Mehrseiten-Apps","Navigation zwischen Seiten mit Streamlit","Verwendung von ECharts zur Datenvisualisierung","Kompatibilität mit Python","Erstellung von Apps mit mehreren Seiten","Anpassung der Benutzeroberfläche mit Streamlit"],"pt":["Estrutura de diretório para aplicações Streamlit com múltiplas páginas","Renderização de ECharts em aplicações Streamlit","Navegação entre páginas em aplicações Streamlit","Uso de estado global compartilhado entre páginas","Compatibilidade com a biblioteca PyECharts"],"ru":["Структура директории для приложений Streamlit с несколькими страницами","Отображение ECharts в приложениях Streamlit с помощью ИИ Агентов","Навигация между страницами в приложениях Streamlit","Использование глобального состояния, общего между страницами","Совместимость с библиотекой PyECharts"],"ar":["هيكل الملفات لتطبيقات Streamlit متعددة الصفحات","عرض ECharts في تطبيقات Streamlit باستخدام وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","التنقل بين الصفحات في تطبيقات Streamlit","استخدام الحالة العالمية المشتركة بين الصفحات","التوافق مع مكتبة PyECharts"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use building-streamlit-multipage-apps","building-streamlit-multipage-apps setup guide","streamlit multi-page apps tutorial","building-streamlit-multipage-apps vs streamlit single-page apps","building-streamlit-multipage-apps install","what is building-streamlit-multipage-apps","streamlit echarts integration","building-streamlit-multipage-apps alternative"],"zh":["Streamlit 多页应用","ECharts 渲染","PyECharts","Streamlit 构建","多页应用结构","AIエージェント","Streamlit AI","ECharts AI"],"ja":["Streamlit マルチページアプリ","ECharts レンダリング","PyECharts","Streamlit 構築","マルチページアプリ構造","AIエージェント","Streamlit AI","ECharts AI"],"ko":["Streamlit 멀티페이지 앱","ECharts 렌더링","PyECharts","Streamlit 구축","멀티페이지 앱 구조","AI 에이전트","Streamlit AI","ECharts AI"],"es":["aplicaciones multi-página Streamlit","ECharts en Streamlit","creación de aplicaciones con Streamlit","navegación en aplicaciones Streamlit","estructura de directorios Streamlit","herramientas de AI para desarrolladores"," Streamlit y Python","visualización de datos con ECharts"],"fr":["applications multi-pages Streamlit","ECharts dans Streamlit","création d''applications avec Streamlit","navigation dans les applications Streamlit","structure de répertoire Streamlit","outils d''IA pour les développeurs","Streamlit et Python","visualisation de données avec ECharts"],"de":["Mehrseiten-Apps mit Streamlit","ECharts in Streamlit","Erstellung von Apps mit Streamlit","Navigation in Streamlit-Apps","Verzeichnisstruktur von Streamlit","AI-Tools für Entwickler","Streamlit und Python","Datenvisualisierung mit ECharts"],"pt":["building-streamlit-multipage-apps","Streamlit","ECharts","PyECharts","aplicações web interativas","desenvolvimento de aplicações","bibliotecas Python","renderização de gráficos"],"ru":["building-streamlit-multipage-apps","Streamlit","ECharts","PyECharts","интерактивные веб-приложения","разработка приложений","библиотеки Python","отображение графиков","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["building-streamlit-multipage-apps","Streamlit","ECharts","PyECharts","تطبيقات ويب تفاعلية","تطوير التطبيقات","مكتبات بايثون","عرض الرسومات","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"andfanilo","repo":"streamlit-echarts","repoPath":"andfanilo/streamlit-echarts","stars":589,"forks":71,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T19:16:48Z","topics":["echarts","pyecharts","streamlit"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"building-streamlit-multipage-apps","description":"Building multi-page Streamlit apps. Use when creating apps with multiple pages, setting up navigation, or managing state across pages.","bodyPreview":"# Streamlit multi-page apps\n\nStructure and navigation for apps with multiple pages.\n\n## Directory structure\n\n```\nstreamlit_app.py          # Main entry point\napp_pages/\n    home.py\n    analytics.py\n    settings.py\n```\n\n**Important:** Name your pages directory `app_pages/` (not `pages/`). Using `pages/` conflicts with Streamlit''s old auto-discovery API and can cause unexpected behavior.\n\n## Main module\n\n```python\n# streamlit_app.py\nimport streamlit as st\n\n# Initialize global state (shared across","body":"# Streamlit multi-page apps\n\nStructure and navigation for apps with multiple pages.\n\n## Directory structure\n\n```\nstreamlit_app.py          # Main entry point\napp_pages/\n    home.py\n    analytics.py\n    settings.py\n```\n\n**Important:** Name your pages directory `app_pages/` (not `pages/`). Using `pages/` conflicts with Streamlit''s old auto-discovery API and can cause unexpected behavior.\n\n## Main module\n\n```python\n# streamlit_app.py\nimport streamlit as st\n\n# Initialize global state (shared across pages)\nif \"api_client\" not in st.session_state:\n    st.session_state.api_client = init_api_client()\n\n# Define navigation\npage = st.navigation([\n    st.Page(\"app_pages/home.py\", title=\"Home\", icon=\":material/home:\"),\n    st.Page(\"app_pages/analytics.py\", title=\"Analytics\", icon=\":material/bar_chart:\"),\n    st.Page(\"app_pages/settings.py\", title=\"Settings\", icon=\":material/settings:\"),\n])\n\n# App-level UI runs before page content\n# Useful for shared elements like titles\nst.title(f\"{page.icon} {page.title}\")\n\npage.run()\n```\n\n**Note:** When you handle titles in `streamlit_app.py`, individual pages should NOT use `st.title` again.\n\n## Navigation position\n\n**Few pages (3-7) → Top navigation:**\n\n```python\npage = st.navigation([...], position=\"top\")\n```\n\nCreates a clean horizontal menu. Great for simple apps. Sections are supported too—they appear as dropdowns in the top nav.\n\n**Many pages or nested sections → Sidebar:**\n\n```python\npage = st.navigation({\n    \"Main\": [\n        st.Page(\"app_pages/home.py\", title=\"Home\"),\n        st.Page(\"app_pages/analytics.py\", title=\"Analytics\"),\n    ],\n    \"Admin\": [\n        st.Page(\"app_pages/settings.py\", title=\"Settings\"),\n        st.Page(\"app_pages/users.py\", title=\"Users\"),\n    ],\n}, position=\"sidebar\")\n```\n\n**Mixed: Some pages ungrouped:**\n\nUse an empty string key `\"\"` for pages that shouldn''t be in a section. These ungrouped pages always appear first, before any named groups. Put all ungrouped pages in a single `\"\"` key:\n\n```python\npage = st.navigation({\n    \"\": [\n        st.Page(\"app_pages/home.py\", title=\"Home\"),\n        st.Page(\"app_pages/about.py\", title=\"About\"),\n    ],\n    \"Analytics\": [\n        st.Page(\"app_pages/dashboard.py\", title=\"Dashboard\"),\n        st.Page(\"app_pages/reports.py\", title=\"Reports\"),\n    ],\n}, position=\"top\")\n```\n\n## Page modules\n\n```python\n# app_pages/analytics.py\nimport streamlit as st\n\n# Access global state\napi = st.session_state.api_client\nuser = st.session_state.user\n\n# Page-specific content (title is handled in streamlit_app.py)\ndata = api.fetch_analytics(user.id)\nst.line_chart(data)\n```\n\n## Global state\n\nInitialize state in the main module only if it''s needed across multiple pages:\n\n```python\n# streamlit_app.py\nst.session_state.api = init_client()\nst.session_state.user = get_user()\nst.session_state.settings = load_settings()\n```\n\n**Tip:** Use `st.session_state.setdefault(\"key\", default_value)` to initialize values only if they don''t exist.\n\n**Why main module (for global state):**\n- Runs before every page\n- Ensures state is initialized\n- Single source of truth\n\n## Page-specific state\n\nUse prefixed keys for page-specific state:\n\n```python\n# app_pages/analytics.py\nif \"analytics_date_range\" not in st.session_state:\n    st.session_state.analytics_date_range = default_range()\n```\n\n## Share elements between pages\n\nPut shared UI in the entrypoint (before `page.run()`) so it appears on all pages:\n\n```python\n# streamlit_app.py\nimport streamlit as st\n\npages = [...]\npage = st.navigation(pages)\n\n# Shared title\nst.title(f\"{page.icon} {page.title}\")\n\n# Shared sidebar widgets\nwith st.sidebar:\n    st.selectbox(\"Theme\", [\"Light\", \"Dark\"])\n\npage.run()\n```\n\n## Programmatic navigation\n\nNavigate to another page programmatically:\n\n```python\nif st.button(\"Go to Settings\"):\n    st.switch_page(\"app_pages/settings.py\")\n```\n\nCreate navigation links with `st.page_link`:\n\n```python\nst.page_link(\"app_pages/home.py\", label=\"Home\", icon=\":material/home:\")\nst.page_link(\"https://example.com\", label=\"External\", icon=\":material/open_in_new:\")\n```\n\n> **Note:** Prefer `st.navigation` over `st.page_link` for standard navigation. Do not use `st.page_link` to recreate the nav bar you get with `st.navigation`. Only use `st.page_link` when linking to pages from somewhere other than the sidebar, or when building a more complex navigation menu.\n\n## Conditional pages\n\nShow different pages based on user role, authentication, or any other condition by building the pages list dynamically:\n\n```python\n# streamlit_app.py\nimport streamlit as st\n\npages = [st.Page(\"app_pages/home.py\", title=\"Home\", icon=\":material/home:\")]\n\nif st.user.is_logged_in:\n    pages.append(st.Page(\"app_pages/dashboard.py\", title=\"Dashboard\", icon=\":material/bar_chart:\"))\n\nif st.session_state.get(\"is_admin\"):\n    pages.append(st.Page(\"app_pages/admin.py\", title=\"Admin\", icon=\":material/settings:\"))\n\npage = st.navigation(pages)\npage.run()\n```\n\nCommon conditions for showing/hiding pages:\n- `st.user.is_logged_in` for authenticated users\n- `st.session_state` flags (roles, permissions, feature flags)\n- Environment variables or secrets\n- Time-based access (e.g., beta features)\n\n## Imports from pages\n\nWhen importing from page files in `app_pages/`, always import from the root directory perspective:\n\n```python\n# app_pages/dashboard.py - GOOD\nfrom utils.data import load_sales_data\n\n# app_pages/dashboard.py - BAD (don''t use relative imports)\nfrom ..utils.data import load_sales_data\n```\n\n## References\n\n- [Multipage apps docs](https://docs.streamlit.io/develop/concepts/multipage-apps)\n- [st.navigation](https://docs.streamlit.io/develop/api-reference/navigation/st.navigation)\n- [st.Page](https://docs.streamlit.io/develop/api-reference/navigation/st.page)\n- [st.session_state](https://docs.streamlit.io/develop/api-reference/caching-and-state/st.session_state)\n- [st.switch_page](https://docs.streamlit.io/develop/api-reference/navigation/st.switch_page)\n- [st.page_link](https://docs.streamlit.io/develop/api-reference/widgets/st.page_link)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T06:27:29.196Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Python Analysis Agents needing advanced data visualization capabilities with Streamlit and ECharts.","zh":"适合需要使用Streamlit和ECharts进行高级数据可视化的Python分析代理。","ja":"StreamlitとEChartsを使用した高度なデータ視覚化機能を必要とするPython分析エージェントに適しています。","ko":"Streamlit과 ECharts를 사용하여 고급 데이터 시각화를 필요로 하는 Python 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Python que necesitan capacidades de visualización de datos avanzadas con Streamlit y ECharts.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse Python nécessitant des capacités de visualisation de données avancées avec Streamlit et ECharts.","de":"Perfekt für Python-Analyseagenten, die erweiterte Datenvisualisierungsfunktionen mit Streamlit und ECharts benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise Python que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de visualização de dados com Streamlit e ECharts.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа Python, которым необходимы расширенные возможности визуализации данных с помощью Streamlit и ECharts.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل بايثون التي تحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة في تحليل البيانات مع Streamlit و ECharts."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create interactive, multi-page Streamlit apps using a specific directory structure and navigation, leveraging Streamlit''s features and ECharts for data visualization.","zh":"赋予代理创建交互式的多页Streamlit应用的能力，使用特定的目录结构和导航，利用Streamlit的功能和ECharts进行数据可视化。","ja":"特定のディレクトリ構造とナビゲーションを使用してインタラクティブなマルチページのStreamlitアプリを作成するエージェントを可能にし、Streamlitの機能とEChartsを使用したデータ視覚化を利用します。","ko":"특정 디렉토리 구조와 내비게이션을 사용하여 상호 작용형 다중 페이지 Streamlit 앱을 생성할 수 있는 에이전트를 가능하게 하며, Streamlit의 기능과 ECharts를 사용한 데이터 시각화를 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear aplicaciones Streamlit interactivas y multipágina utilizando una estructura de directorio específica y navegación, aprovechando las características de Streamlit y ECharts para la visualización de datos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications Streamlit interactives et multipages en utilisant une structure de répertoire spécifique et une navigation, en exploitant les fonctionnalités de Streamlit et ECharts pour la visualisation de données.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, interaktive Streamlit-Apps mit mehreren Seiten zu erstellen, die eine spezifische Verzeichnisstruktur und Navigation verwenden, und sich auf die Funktionen von Streamlit und ECharts für die Datenvisualisierung stützen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar aplicativos interativos de múltiplas páginas Streamlit usando uma estrutura de diretório específica e navegação, aproveitando os recursos do Streamlit e ECharts para visualização de dados.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать интерактивные, многостраничные приложения Streamlit, используя определенную структуру директорий и навигацию, используя возможности Streamlit и ECharts для визуализации данных.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء إمكانية إنشاء تطبيقات Streamlit متعددة الصفحات ومتفاعلة باستخدام هيكل دليل معين وتنقل، واستخدام ميزات Streamlit و ECharts لتحليل البيانات."},"useCases":{"en":["Building data analytics dashboards with multiple pages","Creating interactive, web-based data visualizations with ECharts","Developing Streamlit apps with custom navigation and directory structures"],"zh":["使用多个页面构建数据分析仪表板","使用ECharts创建交互式的基于Web的数据可视化","开发具有自定义导航和目录结构的Streamlit应用"],"ja":["複数のページを使用したデータ分析ダッシュボードの構築","EChartsを使用したインタラクティブなWebベースのデータ視覚化の作成","カスタムナビゲーションとディレクトリ構造を使用したStreamlitアプリの開発"],"ko":["여러 페이지를 사용하여 데이터 분석 대시보드를 구축하는 것","ECharts를 사용하여 상호 작용형 웹 기반 데이터 시각화를 생성하는 것","사용자 정의 내비게이션 및 디렉토리 구조를 사용하여 Streamlit 애플리케이션을 개발하는 것"],"es":["Creación de paneles de análisis de datos con varias páginas","Creación de visualizaciones de datos interactivas y basadas en web con ECharts","Desarrollo de aplicaciones Streamlit con navegación y estructuras de directorios personalizadas"],"fr":["Création de tableaux de bord d''analyse de données à plusieurs pages","Création de visualisations de données interactives et basées sur le web avec ECharts","Développement d''applications Streamlit avec navigation et structures de répertoires personnalisées"],"de":["Erstellung von Datenanalyse-Dashboards mit mehreren Seiten","Erstellung interaktiver, webbasierter Datenvisualisierungen mit ECharts","Entwicklung von Streamlit-Apps mit benutzerdefinierter Navigation und Verzeichnisstrukturen"],"pt":["Construir painéis analíticos de dados com várias páginas","Criar visualizações de dados interativas e baseadas na web com ECharts","Desenvolver aplicativos Streamlit com navegação personalizada e estruturas de diretório"],"ru":["Создание панелей аналитики данных с несколькими страницами","Создание интерактивных, веб-ориентированных визуализаций данных с помощью ECharts","Разработка приложений Streamlit с настраиваемой навигацией и структурами директорий"],"ar":["بناء لوحات تحليل البيانات متعددة الصفحات","إنشاء تصورات تفاعلية للبيانات على الويب باستخدام ECharts","تطوير تطبيقات Streamlit مع التنقل المخصص وهيكل الدلائل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Streamlit installation","Directory structure must follow the ''app_pages/'' convention to avoid conflicts with Streamlit''s auto-discovery API"],"zh":["需要Streamlit安装","目录结构必须遵循''app_pages/''约定，以避免与Streamlit的自动发现API发生冲突"],"ja":["Streamlitのインストールが必要","ディレクトリ構造は''app_pages/''規約に従わなければならない。 Streamlitの自動検出APIと конфликтを避けるため"],"ko":["Streamlit 설치가 필요합니다.","디렉토리 구조는 ''app_pages/'' 규칙을 따라야 합니다. Streamlit의 자동 검색 API와 충돌을 피하기 위해"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de Streamlit","La estructura del directorio debe seguir la convención ''app_pages/'' para evitar conflictos con la API de autodetección de Streamlit"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Streamlit","La structure du répertoire doit suivre la convention ''app_pages/'' pour éviter les conflits avec l''API de détection automatique de Streamlit"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation von Streamlit","Die Verzeichnisstruktur muss der Konvention ''app_pages/'' folgen, um Konflikte mit der Streamlit-Autodetect-API zu vermeiden"],"pt":["Exige a instalação do Streamlit","A estrutura do diretório deve seguir a convenção ''app_pages/'' para evitar conflitos com a API de auto-descoberta do Streamlit"],"ru":["Требует установки Streamlit","Структура директорий должна следовать конвенции ''app_pages/'', чтобы избежать конфликтов с API автопоиска Streamlit"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Streamlit","يجب أن يتبع هيكل الدلائل اتفاقية ''app_pages/'' لتجنب الصراعات مع واجهة برمجة التطبيقات للكشف التلقائي في Streamlit"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"801d8abcd2652bf3c213de7a914a5ccb5897bc3eca6ad6843d908161bcff39a5","qualityScore":43}');
