echeck를 사용한 유형 확인","pnpm build를 사용한 생산 환경 구축","Pre-Commit Checklist를 제공하여 코드 품질을 보장하는","Hyperlane Warp Route UIs 구축을 지원하는"],"es":["Formato de código con pnpm prettier","Verificación de errores con pnpm lint","Verificación de tipos con pnpm typecheck","Construcción de producción con pnpm build","Reglas de staging para garantizar la calidad del código"],"fr":["Formatage de code avec pnpm prettier","Vérification des erreurs avec pnpm lint","Vérification des types avec pnpm typecheck","Construction de production avec pnpm build","Règles de staging pour garantir la qualité du code"],"de":["Code-Formatierung mit pnpm prettier","Fehlerüberprüfung mit pnpm lint","Typüberprüfung mit pnpm typecheck","Produktionsbuild mit pnpm build","Staging-Regeln für die Gewährleistung der Code-Qualität"],"pt":["Executa `pnpm prettier` para formatar arquivos de código","Verifica erros de ESLint com `pnpm lint`","Verifica a compilação do TypeScript com `pnpm typecheck`","Garante a construção de produção com `pnpm build`","Permite apenas o stage de arquivos relacionados à tarefa atual"],"ru":["Выполняет `pnpm prettier` для форматирования кода","Проверяет ошибки ESLint с помощью `pnpm lint`","Проверяет компиляцию TypeScript с помощью `pnpm typecheck`","Гарантирует сборку производственного кода с помощью `pnpm build`","Позволяет только стейж файлов, связанных с текущей задачей"],"ar":["يقوم بتشغيل `pnpm prettier` لتنسيق ملفات الرمز","يتحقق من أخطاء ESLint باستخدام `pnpm lint`","يتحقق من تجميع TypeScript باستخدام `pnpm typecheck`","يضمن بناء الإنتاج باستخدام `pnpm build`","يسمح فقط بمرحلة ملفات متعلقة بالمهام الحالية"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use commit","commit setup guide","hyperlane warp route ui template","pnpm prettier tutorial","commit vs git hook","commit install guide","what is commit skill","commit alternative tools","commit best practices"],"zh":["Commit 技术","Hyperlane Warp Route UIs","web 应用模板","代码质量","代码正确性","pnpm prettier","pnpm lint","pnpm typecheck","pnpm build"],"ja":["Commit 技術","Hyperlane Warp Route UIs","web アプリテンプレート","コードの品質","コードの正確性","pnpm prettier","pnpm lint","pnpm typecheck","pnpm build"],"ko":["Commit 기술","Hyperlane Warp Route UIs","웹 애플리케이션 템플릿","코드 품질","코드 정확성","pnpm prettier","pnpm lint","pnpm typecheck","pnpm build"],"es":["commit Hyperlane Warp Route","pnpm prettier","pnpm lint","pnpm typecheck","Herramientas de desarrollo de software","Mejores prácticas de commit","Hyperlane Warp Route UIs","Desarrollo de interfaces de usuario"],"fr":["commit Hyperlane Warp Route","pnpm prettier","pnpm lint","pnpm typecheck","Outils de développement de logiciels","Meilleures pratiques de commit","Interfaces utilisateur Hyperlane Warp Route","Développement d''interfaces utilisateur"],"de":["Commit Hyperlane Warp Route","pnpm prettier","pnpm lint","pnpm typecheck","Software-Entwicklungstools","Commit-Best-Practices","Hyperlane Warp Route Benutzeroberflächen","Benutzeroberflächen-Entwicklung"],"pt":["commit","hyperlane","warp route","ui","pnpm prettier","pnpm lint","pnpm typecheck","pnpm build","ferramenta de código aberto"],"ru":["commit","hyperlane","warp route","ui","pnpm prettier","pnpm lint","pnpm typecheck","pnpm build","ИИ Агенты","открытый инструмент"],"ar":["commit","hyperlane","warp route","ui","pnpm prettier","pnpm lint","pnpm typecheck","pnpm build","أداة مفتوحة المصدر","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"hyperlane-xyz","repo":"hyperlane-warp-ui-template","repoPath":"hyperlane-xyz/hyperlane-warp-ui-template","stars":184,"forks":206,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T22:03:59Z","topics":["hyperlane","interchain","route","template","warp"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"commit","description":"Commit changes following project quality gates and best practices. Run before creating any git commit.","bodyPreview":"# Commit Skill\n\nUse this skill when committing changes to ensure quality and correctness.\n\n## Pre-Commit Checklist\n\nRun these in order. **Do not commit if any fail.**\n\n1. **`pnpm prettier`** — Format all source files\n2. **`pnpm lint`** — Check for ESLint errors\n3. **`pnpm typecheck`** — Verify TypeScript compiles\n4. **`pnpm build`** — Ensure production build succeeds (optional for small changes, required before PR)\n\n## Staging Rules\n\n- **Only stage files related to the current task.** Review `gi","body":"# Commit Skill\n\nUse this skill when committing changes to ensure quality and correctness.\n\n## Pre-Commit Checklist\n\nRun these in order. **Do not commit if any fail.**\n\n1. **`pnpm prettier`** — Format all source files\n2. **`pnpm lint`** — Check for ESLint errors\n3. **`pnpm typecheck`** — Verify TypeScript compiles\n4. **`pnpm build`** — Ensure production build succeeds (optional for small changes, required before PR)\n\n## Staging Rules\n\n- **Only stage files related to the current task.** Review `git status` carefully.\n- **Never stage unrelated files** — markdown notes, scratch files, `.monorepo-tarballs/`, `agent/`, etc. should not be committed unless explicitly requested.\n- **Use specific file paths** with `git add`, not `git add .` or `git add -A`.\n- **Review `git diff --staged`** before committing to verify only intended changes are included.\n\n## Commit Message Format\n\n- Use conventional commit prefixes: `feat:`, `fix:`, `style:`, `chore:`, `refactor:`, `docs:`, `test:`\n- Keep the first line under 72 characters\n- Add a blank line then bullet points for multi-change commits\n- End with `Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>`\n- Use a HEREDOC to pass the message to avoid shell escaping issues\n\n## Things to Watch For\n\n- **Secrets**: Never commit `.env`, credentials, or API keys\n- **Large files**: Don''t commit binaries, build artifacts, or font files (check `.gitignore`)\n- **Formatting drift**: If prettier changed files you didn''t touch, stage them separately or skip them\n\n## Example Flow\n\n```bash\npnpm prettier\npnpm lint\npnpm typecheck\ngit status                    # review what changed\ngit diff                      # verify changes are correct\ngit add <specific-files>      # only related files\ngit diff --staged             # double-check staged changes\ngit commit -m \"$(cat <<''EOF''\nfeat: description of change\n\n- Detail 1\n- Detail 2\n\nEOF\n)\"\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T06:29:04.413Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing precise code quality control and formatting using pnpm and TypeScript.","zh":"适合需要使用pnpm和TypeScript进行精确代码质量控制和格式化的开发代理。","ja":"pnpmとTypeScriptを使用して精密なコード品質管理とフォーマットが必要な開発エージェントに適しています。","ko":"pnpm과 TypeScript를 사용하여 정확한 코드 품질 제어 및 형식 지정이 필요한 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo que necesitan un control y formato de código preciso utilizando pnpm y TypeScript.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin d''un contrôle et d''un formatage de code précis en utilisant pnpm et TypeScript.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine präzise Codequalitätskontrolle und -formatierung mit pnpm und TypeScript benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de controle e formatação de código precisa usando pnpm e TypeScript.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, которым необходим точный контроль качества и форматирования кода с использованием pnpm и TypeScript.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذي يحتاج إلى التحكم الدقيق في جودة الشفرة وتنسيقها باستخدام pnpm و TypeScript."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to ensure code correctness and quality by running pre-commit checks with pnpm prettier, pnpm lint, and pnpm typecheck, guaranteeing adherence to TypeScript and ESLint standards.","zh":"赋予代理人在提交前运行pnpm prettier、pnpm lint和pnpm typecheck检查以确保代码正确性和质量，保证遵守TypeScript和ESLint标准的能力。","ja":"pnpm prettier、pnpm lint、pnpm typecheckの事前コミットチェックを実行してコードの正しさと品質を保証し、TypeScriptとESLintの標準に従うことを可能にします。","ko":"pnpm prettier, pnpm lint, pnpm typecheck의 사전 커밋 체크를 실행하여 코드의 정확성과 품질을 보장하고, TypeScript와 ESLint의 표준을 준수하도록 에이전트를 능력화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a garantizar la corrección y calidad del código al ejecutar controles pre-commit con pnpm prettier, pnpm lint y pnpm typecheck, asegurando el cumplimiento de los estándares de TypeScript y ESLint.","fr":"Permet aux agents de garantir la correction et la qualité du code en exécutant des vérifications pré-commit avec pnpm prettier, pnpm lint et pnpm typecheck, assurant ainsi le respect des normes TypeScript et ESLint.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, die Richtigkeit und Qualität des Codes sicherzustellen, indem sie Vor-Commit-Prüfungen mit pnpm prettier, pnpm lint und pnpm typecheck durchführen und so die Einhaltung der TypeScript- und ESLint-Standards gewährleisten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a garantir a correção e a qualidade do código, executando verificações pré-commit com pnpm prettier, pnpm lint e pnpm typecheck, garantindo a aderência aos padrões do TypeScript e ESLint.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечить правильность и качество кода, запуская проверки перед фиксацией с pnpm prettier, pnpm lint и pnpm typecheck, гарантируя соблюдение стандартов TypeScript и ESLint.","ar":"يسمح للعميل بالتأكد من صحة الشفرة وجودتها من خلال تشغيل فحص ما قبل الالتزام مع pnpm prettier و pnpm lint و pnpm typecheck، مما يضمن الامتثال لمعايير TypeScript و ESLint."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating code formatting with pnpm prettier","Validating TypeScript compilations with pnpm typecheck","Debugging ESLint errors with pnpm lint"],"zh":["使用pnpm prettier自动化代码格式化","使用pnpm typecheck验证TypeScript编译","使用pnpm lint调试ESLint错误"],"ja":["pnpm prettierを使用してコードのフォーマットを自動化する","pnpm typecheckを使用してTypeScriptのコンパイルを検証する","pnpm lintを使用してESLintのエラーをデバッグする"],"ko":["pnpm prettier를 사용하여 코드 형식화를 자동화하는 것","pnpm typecheck를 사용하여 TypeScript 컴파일을 확인하는 것","pnpm lint를 사용하여 ESLint 오류를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar el formato de código con pnpm prettier","Validar compilaciones de TypeScript con pnpm typecheck","Depurar errores de ESLint con pnpm lint"],"fr":["Automatiser le formatage de code avec pnpm prettier","Valider les compilations de TypeScript avec pnpm typecheck","Déboguer les erreurs ESLint avec pnpm lint"],"de":["Automatisieren des Code-Formatierens mit pnpm prettier","Validieren von TypeScript-Kompilierungen mit pnpm typecheck","Fehler von ESLint mit pnpm lint debuggen"],"pt":["Automar formatação de código com pnpm prettier","Validar compilações do TypeScript com pnpm typecheck","Depurar erros do ESLint com pnpm lint"],"ru":["Автоматизировать форматирование кода с помощью pnpm prettier","Проверить компиляции TypeScript с помощью pnpm typecheck","Отладить ошибки ESLint с помощью pnpm lint"],"ar":["التحكم الآلي في تنسيق الشفرة مع pnpm prettier"," التحقق من مجمعات TypeScript مع pnpm typecheck","تصحيح أخطاء ESLint مع pnpm lint"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires pnpm and TypeScript setup","Limited to Hyperlane Warp Route UIs development"],"zh":["需要pnpm和TypeScript的设置","仅限于Hyperlane Warp Route UIs开发"],"ja":["pnpmとTypeScriptの設定が必要","Hyperlane Warp Route UIs開発のみに限定"],"ko":["pnpm과 TypeScript 설정이 필요","Hyperlane Warp Route UIs 개발에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere configuración de pnpm y TypeScript","Limitado al desarrollo de interfaces de usuario de Hyperlane Warp Route"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de pnpm et TypeScript","Limité au développement des interfaces utilisateur de Hyperlane Warp Route"],"de":["Benötigt eine Einrichtung von pnpm und TypeScript","Begrenzt auf die Entwicklung von Benutzeroberflächen von Hyperlane Warp Route"],"pt":["Requer configuração do pnpm e do TypeScript","Limitado ao desenvolvimento de UIs do Hyperlane Warp Route"],"ru":["Требует настройки pnpm и TypeScript","Ограничен разработкой интерфейсов Hyperlane Warp Route"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد pnpm و TypeScript","محدود بالتطوير لواجهات المستخدم Hyperlane Warp Route"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"3151de25bc6b438850b2b47d4abe31719a88141694d8eca7179869e7fd053d9a","qualityScore":43}');
