INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('whtoo/How_to_implment_PL_in_Antlr4/vm-dev', 'vm-dev', 'whtoo', 'How_to_implment_PL_in_Antlr4', 'community', 'vm-dev whtoo How_to_implment_PL_in_Antlr4 community The vm-dev skill enables developers to create a virtual machine with core capabilities such as bytecode execution, instruction sets, and memory management. It benefits developers looking to implement custom programming languages. vm-dev 是一个虚拟机开发的技能，涵盖字节码设计、栈式虚拟机和寄存器虚拟机等核心能力 vm-dev は仮想マシン開発のスキルで、バイトコード設計、スタックベースの仮想マシン、レジスタベースの仮想マシンなどのコア機能を含みます vm-dev는 가상머신 개발의 기술로 바이트코드 설계, 스택 기반 가상머신, 레지스터 기반 가상머신 등의 핵심 기능을 포함합니다 vm-dev es un entorno de desarrollo de lenguajes de programación que incluye bytecode, pilas y registros vm-dev est un environnement de développement de langages de programmation qui comprend du bytecode, des piles et des enregistreurs vm-dev ist eine Entwicklungsumgebung für Programmiersprachen, die Bytecode, Stack und Register umfasst vm-dev é uma habilidade de desenvolvimento de máquina virtual que inclui design de bytecode, gerenciamento de memória e execução de instruções vm-dev - это навык разработки виртуальных машин, который включает проектирование байтового кода, управление памятью и выполнение инструкций vm-dev هو مهارة لتطوير آلة افتراضية تشمل تصميم بايت كود وإدارة الذاكرة وتنفيذ الإرشادات how to use vm-dev vm-dev alternative vm-dev setup guide what is vm-dev vm-dev vs antlr vm-dev install virtual machine development custom programming language implementation bytecode design vm-dev 虚拟机开发 字节码设计 栈式虚拟机 寄存器虚拟机 ANTLR Cyson 语言 AIエージェント 虚拟机实现 Defines bytecode instructions such as IADD, ISUB, IMUL, and IDIV using BytecodeDefinition.java Implements a stack-based virtual machine with a Last-In-First-Out (LIFO) operand stack Supports register-based virtual machine architecture with core components like CymbolRegisterVM.java Manages memory using stack frames with local variables, operand stacks, and return addresses Executes instructions using a custom-designed instruction set vm-dev is a virtual machine development skill that provides a comprehensive framework for designing and implementing custom programming languages, including bytecode definition and execution.');
