r contenido 3D con código","fr":"Remotion est un outil pour créer du contenu 3D avec du code","de":"Remotion ist ein Tool für die Erstellung von 3D-Inhalten mit Code","pt":"Remotion é uma ferramenta de código aberto para criar vídeos personalizados com React e Three.js","ru":"Remotion - это открытая платформа для создания персонализированных видеороликов с использованием React и Three.js","ar":"Remotion هو أداة مفتوحة المصدر لإنشاء فيديوهات مخصصة باستخدام React و Three.js"},"features":{"en":["Provides detailed explanations and code examples for 3D content in Remotion using Three.js and React Three Fiber","Offers fundamental animation skills for Remotion","Supports importing images, videos, audio, and fonts into Remotion","Includes rules for audio management in Remotion","Covers best practices for Remotion development"],"zh":["使用Three.js创建3D内容","使用React Three Fiber创建3D场景","掌握动画技能","导入图像、视频、音频和字体","使用Remotion规则创建高质量的动画"],"ja":["Three.jsを使用して3Dコンテンツを作成","React Three Fiberを使用して3Dシーンを作成","アニメーションスキルをマスター","画像、ビデオ、オーディオ、フォントをインポート","Remotionルールを使用して高品質のアニメーションを作成"],"ko":["Three.js를 사용하여 3D 콘텐츠를 생성","React Three Fiber를 사용하여 3D 씬을 생성","애니메이션 스킬을 마스터","이미지, 비디오, 오디오, 글꼴을 가져오기","Remotion 규칙을 사용하여 고품질의 애니메이션을 생성"],"es":["Uso de Three.js para crear contenido 3D","Integración con React Three Fiber para renderizar gráficos 3D","Importación de imágenes, videos, audio y fuentes en Remotion","Creación de animaciones fundamentales con Remotion","Uso de reglas personalizadas para optimizar el rendimiento"],"fr":["Utilisation de Three.js pour créer du contenu 3D","Intégration avec React Three Fiber pour rendre des graphiques 3D","Importation d''images, de vidéos, d''audio et de polices en Remotion","Création d''animations fondamentales avec Remotion","Utilisation de règles personnalisées pour optimiser les performances"],"de":["Verwendung von Three.js für die Erstellung von 3D-Inhalten","Integration mit React Three Fiber für die Rendering von 3D-Grafiken","Import von Bildern, Videos, Audio und Schriftarten in Remotion","Erstellung von grundlegenden Animationen mit Remotion","Verwendung von benutzerdefinierten Regeln für die Optimierung der Leistung"],"pt":["Criação de conteúdo 3D com Three.js e React Three Fiber","Animações personalizadas com Remotion","Importação de ativos, incluindo imagens, vídeos, áudio e fontes","Uso de React para criar interfaces de usuário personalizadas","Integração com bibliotecas de áudio e vídeo"],"ru":["Создание 3D-контента с помощью Three.js и React Three Fiber","Пользовательские анимации с Remotion","Импорт активов, включая изображения, видео, аудио и шрифты","Использование React для создания пользовательских интерфейсов","Интеграция с библиотеками аудио и видео"],"ar":["إنشاء محتوى 3D باستخدام Three.js و React Three Fiber","الرسوم المتحركة المخصصة مع Remotion","استيراد الأصول، بما في ذلك الصور وملفات الفيديو والصوت والخطوط","استخدام React لإنشاء واجهات مستخدم مخصصة","التكامل مع مكتبات الصوت والفيديو"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use remotion-best-practices","remotion-best-practices tutorial","remotion development best practices","three.js remotion integration","react three fiber remotion","remotion-best-practices setup guide","remotion-best-practices install","remotion-best-practices alternative"],"zh":["Remotion最佳实践","Three.js","React Three Fiber","3D内容创建","动画技能","Remotion规则","AIエージェント","Remotion代码"],"ja":["Remotionベストプラクティス","Three.js","React Three Fiber","3Dコンテンツ作成","アニメーションスキル","Remotionルール","AIエージェント","Remotionコード"],"ko":["Remotion最佳实践","Three.js","React Three Fiber","3D 콘텐츠 생성","애니메이션 스킬","Remotion 규칙","AI 에이전트","Remotion 코드"],"es":["Remotion","Three.js","React Three Fiber","contenido 3D","animaciones","importación de activos","reglas personalizadas","herramientas de desarrollo","mejores prácticas de Remotion"],"fr":["Remotion","Three.js","React Three Fiber","contenu 3D","animations","importation de ressources","règles personnalisées","outils de développement","bonnes pratiques de Remotion"],"de":["Remotion","Three.js","React Three Fiber","3D-Inhalte","Animationen","Import von Ressourcen","benutzerdefinierte Regeln","Entwicklungstools","Remotion-Best-Practices"],"pt":["remotion","melhores práticas","react","three.js","animações","importação de ativos","vídeos personalizados","desenvolvimento de vídeo"],"ru":["remotion","лучшие практики","react","three.js","анимации","импорт активов","персонализированные видеоролики","разработка видео","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["remotion","أفضل الممارسات","react","three.js","الرسوم المتحركة","استيراد الأصول","فيديوهات مخصصة","تطوير الفيديو","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"WeWriteApp","repo":"WeWrite","repoPath":"WeWriteApp/WeWrite","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.310Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"remotion-best-practices","description":"Best practices for Remotion - Video creation in React","tags":"remotion, video, react, animation, composition","bodyPreview":"## When to use\n\nUse this skills whenever you are dealing with Remotion code to obtain the domain-specific knowledge.\n\n## How to use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n- [rules/3d.md](rules/3d.md) - 3D content in Remotion using Three.js and React Three Fiber\n- [rules/animations.md](rules/animations.md) - Fundamental animation skills for Remotion\n- [rules/assets.md](rules/assets.md) - Importing images, videos, audio, and fonts into Remotion\n- [rules/audio.md]","body":"## When to use\n\nUse this skills whenever you are dealing with Remotion code to obtain the domain-specific knowledge.\n\n## How to use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n- [rules/3d.md](rules/3d.md) - 3D content in Remotion using Three.js and React Three Fiber\n- [rules/animations.md](rules/animations.md) - Fundamental animation skills for Remotion\n- [rules/assets.md](rules/assets.md) - Importing images, videos, audio, and fonts into Remotion\n- [rules/audio.md](rules/audio.md) - Using audio and sound in Remotion - importing, trimming, volume, speed, pitch\n- [rules/calculate-metadata.md](rules/calculate-metadata.md) - Dynamically set composition duration, dimensions, and props\n- [rules/can-decode.md](rules/can-decode.md) - Check if a video can be decoded by the browser using Mediabunny\n- [rules/charts.md](rules/charts.md) - Chart and data visualization patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/compositions.md](rules/compositions.md) - Defining compositions, stills, folders, default props and dynamic metadata\n- [rules/display-captions.md](rules/display-captions.md) - Displaying captions in Remotion with TikTok-style pages and word highlighting\n- [rules/extract-frames.md](rules/extract-frames.md) - Extract frames from videos at specific timestamps using Mediabunny\n- [rules/fonts.md](rules/fonts.md) - Loading Google Fonts and local fonts in Remotion\n- [rules/get-audio-duration.md](rules/get-audio-duration.md) - Getting the duration of an audio file in seconds with Mediabunny\n- [rules/get-video-dimensions.md](rules/get-video-dimensions.md) - Getting the width and height of a video file with Mediabunny\n- [rules/get-video-duration.md](rules/get-video-duration.md) - Getting the duration of a video file in seconds with Mediabunny\n- [rules/gifs.md](rules/gifs.md) - Displaying GIFs synchronized with Remotion''s timeline\n- [rules/images.md](rules/images.md) - Embedding images in Remotion using the Img component\n- [rules/import-srt-captions.md](rules/import-srt-captions.md) - Importing .srt subtitle files into Remotion using @remotion/captions\n- [rules/lottie.md](rules/lottie.md) - Embedding Lottie animations in Remotion\n- [rules/measuring-dom-nodes.md](rules/measuring-dom-nodes.md) - Measuring DOM element dimensions in Remotion\n- [rules/measuring-text.md](rules/measuring-text.md) - Measuring text dimensions, fitting text to containers, and checking overflow\n- [rules/sequencing.md](rules/sequencing.md) - Sequencing patterns for Remotion - delay, trim, limit duration of items\n- [rules/tailwind.md](rules/tailwind.md) - Using TailwindCSS in Remotion\n- [rules/text-animations.md](rules/text-animations.md) - Typography and text animation patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/timing.md](rules/timing.md) - Interpolation curves in Remotion - linear, easing, spring animations\n- [rules/transcribe-captions.md](rules/transcribe-captions.md) - Transcribing audio to generate captions in Remotion\n- [rules/transitions.md](rules/transitions.md) - Scene transition patterns for Remotion\n- [rules/trimming.md](rules/trimming.md) - Trimming patterns for Remotion - cut the beginning or end of animations\n- [rules/videos.md](rules/videos.md) - Embedding videos in Remotion - trimming, volume, speed, looping, pitch\n- [rules/parameters.md](rules/parameters.md) - Make a video parametrizable by adding a Zod schema\n- [rules/maps.md](rules/maps.md) - Add a map using Mapbox and animate it\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:02:30.702Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced Remotion development capabilities with 3D content, animations, and asset management.","zh":"非常适合需要高级Remotion开发能力的前端代理，包括3D内容、动画和资产管理。","ja":"Remotion開発の高度な機能を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。3Dコンテンツ、動画、資産管理などが含まれます。","ko":"고급 Remotion 개발 기능이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 3D 콘텐츠, 애니메이션, 자산 관리 등을 포함합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades de desarrollo de Remotion avanzadas con contenido 3D, animaciones y gestión de activos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin de capacités de développement Remotion avancées avec du contenu 3D, des animations et une gestion d''actifs.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die erweiterte Remotion-Entwicklungsfunktionen mit 3D-Inhalt, Animationen und Asset-Management benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de desenvolvimento Remotion com conteúdo 3D, animações e gerenciamento de ativos.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы расширенные возможности разработки Remotion с 3D-контентом, анимациями и управлением активами.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لتطوير Remotion مع محتوى 3D والرسوم المتحركة وإدارة الأصول."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create immersive 3D experiences using Three.js and React Three Fiber, while mastering fundamental animation skills and efficiently importing images, videos, audio, and fonts into Remotion projects.","zh":"赋予代理创建使用Three.js和React Three Fiber的沉浸式3D体验的能力，同时掌握基本的动画技能，并高效地将图像、视频、音频和字体导入Remotion项目。","ja":"Three.jsとReact Three Fiberを使用した没入型3D体験を作成するエージェントの能力を与え、基本的なアニメーションスキルをマスターし、Remotionプロジェクトに画像、ビデオ、オーディオ、フォントを効率的にインポートする。","ko":"Three.js와 React Three Fiber를 사용하여 몰입형 3D 경험을 생성하는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하고, 기본 애니메이션 스킬을 마스터하며, Remotion 프로젝트에 이미지를 효율적으로 가져오고, 비디오, 오디오, 글꼴을 가져옵니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear experiencias inmersivas 3D utilizando Three.js y React Three Fiber, mientras dominan habilidades de animación fundamentales e importan de forma eficiente imágenes, videos, audio y fuentes en proyectos de Remotion.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des expériences 3D immersives en utilisant Three.js et React Three Fiber, tout en maîtrisant les compétences d''animation fondamentales et en important efficacement des images, des vidéos, des audio et des polices dans les projets Remotion.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, immersive 3D-Erfahrungen mit Three.js und React Three Fiber zu erstellen, während sie grundlegende Animationsfähigkeiten beherrschen und Bilder, Videos, Audio und Schriftarten in Remotion-Projekte effizient importieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criarem experiências imersivas 3D usando Three.js e React Three Fiber, ao mesmo tempo em que dominam habilidades de animação fundamentais e importam imagens, vídeos, áudio e fontes para projetos Remotion de forma eficiente.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать иммерсивные 3D-опыты с помощью Three.js и React Three Fiber, одновременно осваивая фундаментальные навыки анимации и эффективно импортируя изображения, видео, аудио и шрифты в проекты Remotion.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء تجارب 3D الغامرة باستخدام Three.js و React Three Fiber، في الوقت نفسه الذي يتقنون فيه المهارات الأساسية للرسوم المتحركة ويعملون على استيراد الصور و الفيديوهات و الصوت و الخطوط إلى مشاريع Remotion بشكل فعال."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating 3D content for Remotion projects","Debugging animations in Remotion using provided best practices","Optimizing asset management for Remotion development"],"zh":["为Remotion项目生成3D内容","使用提供的最佳实践在Remotion中调试动画","优化Remotion开发的资产管理"],"ja":["Remotionプロジェクト用の3Dコンテンツを生成する","提供されたベストプラクティスを使用してRemotionでアニメーションをデバッグする","Remotion開発のアセット管理を最適化する"],"ko":["Remotion 프로젝트를 위한 3D 콘텐츠 생성","제공된 모범 사례를 사용하여 Remotion에서 애니메이션을 디버깅","Remotion 개발을 위한 자산 관리 최적화"],"es":["Generación de contenido 3D para proyectos de Remotion","Depuración de animaciones en Remotion utilizando las mejores prácticas proporcionadas","Optimización de la gestión de activos para el desarrollo de Remotion"],"fr":["Génération de contenu 3D pour les projets Remotion","Débogage des animations dans Remotion en utilisant les meilleures pratiques fournies","Optimisation de la gestion des actifs pour le développement Remotion"],"de":["Erzeugung von 3D-Inhalt für Remotion-Projekte","Fehlerbehebung von Animationen in Remotion unter Verwendung der bereitgestellten Best Practices","Optimierung des Asset-Managements für die Remotion-Entwicklung"],"pt":["Geração de conteúdo 3D para projetos Remotion","Depuração de animações em Remotion usando as melhores práticas fornecidas","Otimização do gerenciamento de ativos para desenvolvimento Remotion"],"ru":["Генерация 3D-контента для проектов Remotion","Отладка анимаций в Remotion с использованием предоставленных最佳 практик","Оптимизация управления активами для разработки Remotion"],"ar":["генерация محتوى 3D لمشاريع Remotion","تصحيح أخطاء الرسوم المتحركة في Remotion باستخدام أفضل الممارسات المقدمة","تحسين إدارة الأصول لتطوير Remotion"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Remotion codebase access","Specific to Remotion development only"],"zh":["需要Remotion代码库访问","仅限Remotion开发"],"ja":["Remotionコードベースへのアクセスが必要","Remotion開発専用"],"ko":["Remotion 코드베이스 액세스가 필요","Remotion 개발 전용"],"es":["Requiere acceso al código base de Remotion","Específico solo para el desarrollo de Remotion"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au code base de Remotion","Spécifique uniquement au développement Remotion"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf den Remotion-Codebase","Spezifisch nur für die Remotion-Entwicklung"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao código base Remotion","Específico apenas para desenvolvimento Remotion"],"ru":["Требует доступа к кодовой базе Remotion","Относится только к разработке Remotion"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى قاعدة код Remotion","محدد لتطوير Remotion فقط"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"b03b063f350e484c5b56641a4afd2b71e0ee171e082bd73b494ae217fef3805f","qualityScore":43}');
