"TypeScript com Fastify","Testes com Fastify","Validação e serialização","Tratamento de erros em Fastify","ИИ Агенты para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["Fastify","Разработка backend","Плагины Fastify","Обработчики маршрутов","TypeScript с Fastify","Тестирование с Fastify","Валидация и сериализация","Обработка ошибок в Fastify","ИИ Агенты для разработчиков"],"ar":["Fastify","تطوير التطبيقات الخلفية","برامج مساعدة Fastify","معالجات المسارات","TypeScript مع Fastify","اختبار مع Fastify","التحقق و التدوير","معالجة الأخطاء في Fastify","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للdevelopers"]}},"owner":"blesstosam","repo":"trpc-fastify-starter","repoPath":"blesstosam/trpc-fastify-starter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.341Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"fastify-best-practices","description":"Comprehensive best practices for Fastify development","tags":"fastify, nodejs, typescript, backend, api, server, http","bodyPreview":"## When to use\n\nUse this skill when you need to:\n- Develop backend applications using Fastify\n- Implement Fastify plugins and route handlers\n- Get guidance on Fastify architecture and patterns\n- Use TypeScript with Fastify (strip types)\n- Implement testing with Fastify''s inject method\n- Configure validation, serialization, and error handling\n\n## How to use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n- [rules/schemas.md](rules/schemas.md) - JSON Schema validation\n- [","body":"## When to use\n\nUse this skill when you need to:\n- Develop backend applications using Fastify\n- Implement Fastify plugins and route handlers\n- Get guidance on Fastify architecture and patterns\n- Use TypeScript with Fastify (strip types)\n- Implement testing with Fastify''s inject method\n- Configure validation, serialization, and error handling\n\n## How to use\n\nRead individual rule files for detailed explanations and code examples:\n\n- [rules/schemas.md](rules/schemas.md) - JSON Schema validation\n- [rules/error-handling.md](rules/error-handling.md) - Error handling patterns\n- [rules/hooks.md](rules/hooks.md) - Hooks and request lifecycle\n- [rules/authentication.md](rules/authentication.md) - Authentication and authorization\n- [rules/testing.md](rules/testing.md) - Testing with inject()\n- [rules/performance.md](rules/performance.md) - Performance optimization\n- [rules/logging.md](rules/logging.md) - Logging with Pino\n- [rules/typescript.md](rules/typescript.md) - TypeScript integration\n- [rules/content-type.md](rules/content-type.md) - Content type parsing\n- [rules/serialization.md](rules/serialization.md) - Response serialization\n- [rules/cors-security.md](rules/cors-security.md) - CORS and security headers\n- [rules/websockets.md](rules/websockets.md) - WebSocket support\n- [rules/configuration.md](rules/configuration.md) - Application configuration\n- [rules/http-proxy.md](rules/http-proxy.md) - HTTP proxying and reply.from()\n\n## Core Principles\n\n- **Encapsulation**: Fastify''s plugin system provides automatic encapsulation\n- **Schema-first**: Define schemas for validation and serialization\n- **Performance**: Fastify is optimized for speed; use its features correctly\n- **Async/await**: All handlers and hooks support async functions\n- **Minimal dependencies**: Prefer Fastify''s built-in features and official plugins\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:03:28.767Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Node.js Agents needing high-performance backend development with Fastify","zh":"适合需要高性能后端开发的Node.js代理，使用Fastify","ja":"Node.jsエージェントが高性能のバックエンド開発を必要とする場合に適しています。Fastifyを使用","ko":"고성능 백엔드 개발이 필요한 Node.js 에이전트에 적합합니다. Fastify 사용","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Node.js que necesitan desarrollo de backend de alto rendimiento con Fastify","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Node.js nécessitant un développement backend haute performance avec Fastify","de":"Perfekt für Node.js-Agents, die eine Hochleistungs-Backend-Entwicklung mit Fastify benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Node.js que necessitam de desenvolvimento de backend de alto desempenho com Fastify","ru":"Идеально для агентов Node.js, требующих высокопроизводительное развитие бэкенда с Fastify","ar":"مثالي لعميل Node.js الذي يحتاج إلى تطوير الخلفية بعيد المدى مع Fastify"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build efficient backend applications using Fastify, providing guidance on architecture, patterns, and testing, including TypeScript integration and JSON Schema validation with Fastify''s inject method for testing","zh":"赋予代理使用Fastify构建高效的后端应用程序的能力，提供有关架构、模式和测试的指导，包括TypeScript集成和使用Fastify的inject方法进行测试的JSON Schema验证","ja":"Fastifyを使用して効率的なバックエンドアプリケーションを構築するエージェントの能力を提供し、アーキテクチャ、パターン、テストに関するガイダンスを提供し、TypeScript統合とFastifyのinjectメソッドを使用したテストのJSON Schemaバリデーションを含む","ko":"Fastify를 사용하여 효율적인 백엔드 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 제공하며, 아키텍처, 패턴, 테스트에 대한 가이드를 제공하고, TypeScript 통합 및 Fastify의 inject 메서드를 사용한 테스트의 JSON 스키마 유효성을 포함","es":"Habilita a los agentes para construir aplicaciones backend eficientes utilizando Fastify, proporcionando orientación sobre arquitectura, patrones y pruebas, incluyendo la integración de TypeScript y la validación de JSON Schema con el método de inyección de Fastify para pruebas","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications backend efficaces en utilisant Fastify, en fournissant des conseils sur l''architecture, les modèles et les tests, y compris l''intégration de TypeScript et la validation de JSON Schema avec la méthode d''injection de Fastify pour les tests","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, effiziente Backend-Anwendungen mit Fastify zu erstellen, indem es eine Anleitung zur Architektur, Muster und Tests bietet, einschließlich der Integration von TypeScript und der Validierung von JSON Schema mit der Injektionsmethode von Fastify für Tests","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir aplicações de backend eficientes usando Fastify, fornecendo orientação sobre arquitetura, padrões e testes, incluindo integração com TypeScript e validação de JSON Schema com o método inject do Fastify para testes","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать эффективные бэкенд-приложения с использованием Fastify, предоставляя рекомендации по архитектуре, шаблонам и тестированию, включая интеграцию с TypeScript и валидацию JSON Schema с помощью метода inject Fastify для тестирования","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من بناء تطبيقات الخلفية الفعالة باستخدام Fastify، وتقديم إرشادات حول الهندسة المعمارية والنماذج واختبارها، بما في ذلك دمج TypeScript وتحقق مخطط JSON باستخدام أسلوب الحقن من Fastify للاختبار"},"useCases":{"en":["Developing scalable backend applications with Fastify","Implementing Fastify plugins and route handlers for customized functionality","Configuring validation, serialization, and error handling for robust API design"],"zh":["使用Fastify开发可扩展的后端应用程序","实现Fastify插件和路由处理程序以实现自定义功能","配置验证、序列化和错误处理以实现强大的API设计"],"ja":["Fastifyを使用してスケーラブルなバックエンドアプリケーションを開発する","Fastifyプラグインとルートハンドラーを実装してカスタマイズされた機能を実現する","検証、シリアル化、エラーハンドリングを構成して強力なAPI設計を実現する"],"ko":["Fastify를 사용하여 확장 가능한 백엔드 애플리케이션을 개발하는 것","Fastify 플러그인과 라우트 핸들러를 구현하여 사용자 정의 기능을 구현하는 것","검증, 직렬화, 오류 처리를 구성하여 강력한 API 디자인을 구현하는 것"],"es":["Desarrollar aplicaciones backend escalables con Fastify","Implementar plugins y controladores de rutas de Fastify para funcionalidades personalizadas","Configurar la validación, serialización y el manejo de errores para un diseño de API robusto"],"fr":["Développer des applications backend escalables avec Fastify","Implémenter des plugins et des gestionnaires de routes Fastify pour des fonctionnalités personnalisées","Configurer la validation, la sérialisation et la gestion des erreurs pour une conception d''API robuste"],"de":["Erstellen von skalierbaren Backend-Anwendungen mit Fastify","Implementieren von Fastify-Plugins und Route-Handlern für benutzerdefinierte Funktionalitäten","Konfigurieren von Validierung, Serialisierung und Fehlerbehandlung für einen robusten API-Design"],"pt":["Desenvolver aplicações de backend escaláveis com Fastify","Implementar plug-ins e manipuladores de rotas do Fastify para funcionalidade personalizada","Configurar validação, serialização e tratamento de erros para design de API robusto"],"ru":["Разработка масштабируемых бэкенд-приложений с Fastify","Реализация плагинов и обработчиков маршрутов Fastify для настраиваемой функциональности","Настройка валидации, сериализации и обработки ошибок для прочного дизайна API"],"ar":["تطوير تطبيقات الخلفية القابلة للتوسيع مع Fastify","تنفيذ إضافات ومعالجين مسارات Fastify للوظائف المخصصة","تكوين التحقق والتعريب ومعالجة الأخطاء لتصميم واجهة برمجة التطبيقات المتين"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Node.js environment","Fastify-specific, may not be compatible with other frameworks"],"zh":["需要Node.js环境","特定于Fastify，可能与其他框架不兼容"],"ja":["Node.js環境が必要","Fastify固有のため、他のフレームワークと互換性がない可能性がある"],"ko":["Node.js 환경이 필요","Fastify에 특정되어 있으므로 다른 프레임워크와 호환되지 않을 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere un entorno Node.js","Específico de Fastify, puede que no sea compatible con otros frameworks"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Node.js","Spécifique à Fastify, peut ne pas être compatible avec d''autres frameworks"],"de":["Benötigt eine Node.js-Umgebung","Spezifisch für Fastify, kann möglicherweise nicht mit anderen Frameworks kompatibel sein"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Node.js","Específico do Fastify, pode não ser compatível com outros frameworks"],"ru":["Требует среды Node.js","Специфичен для Fastify, может быть несовместим с другими фреймворками"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Node.js","محدد ل Fastify، قد لا يكون متوافقًا مع إطارات عمل أخرى"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"a81c75ef8a1ed2db7537d8c4116a638453922a6b11fd121e4af2787135cc657f","qualityScore":43}');
