架构的工程师","ja":"WebSocket エンジニアは、リアルタイム通信とスケーラブルなメッセージングアーキテクチャを専門とするエンジニア","ko":"WebSocket Engineer는 실시간 통신과 확장 가능한 메시징 아키텍처를 전문으로 하는 엔지니어","es":"Un ingeniero de WebSocket es un experto en comunicación en tiempo real que diseña sistemas de mensajería escalables","fr":"Un ingénieur WebSocket est un expert en communication en temps réel qui conçoit des systèmes de messagerie évolutifs","de":"Ein WebSocket-Engineer ist ein Experte für Echtzeitkommunikation, der skalierbare Messaging-Systeme entwirft","pt":"O que é WebSocket Engineer? É um especialista em comunicação em tempo real com expertise em Socket.IO e arquiteturas de mensagens escaláveis","ru":"Что такое ИИ Агент WebSocket Engineer? Это специалист по реальному времени с опытом в Socket.IO и масштабируемых архитектурах сообщений","ar":"ما هو WebSocket Engineer؟ هو خبير في التواصل في الوقت الفعلي مع خبرة في Socket.IO وعمارة الرسائل القابلة للتحجيم"},"features":{"en":["Expertise in Socket.IO for real-time bidirectional communication","Native WebSockets support for low-latency messaging","Horizontal scaling with Redis pub/sub for millions of concurrent connections","Design for sub-10ms p99 latency with 99.99% uptime","Specialization in building WebSocket infrastructure for real-time applications"],"zh":["支持 Socket.IO 技术","实现 Redis pub/sub 可扩展架构","提供实时通信功能","支持水平扩展","实现低延迟消息系统","支持 99.99% 的可用性"],"ja":["Socket.IO 技術をサポート","Redis pub/sub 可 확展アーキテクチャを実現","リアルタイム通信機能を提供","水平 확장をサポート","低遅延メッセージシステムを実現","99.99% の可用性をサポート"],"ko":["Socket.IO 기술을 지원","Redis pub/sub 확장 가능한 아키텍처를 구현","실시간 통신 기능을 제공","수평 확장을 지원","저지연 메시지 시스템을 구현","99.99%의 가용성을 지원"],"es":["Comunicación en tiempo real con Socket.IO","Arquitecturas de mensajería escalables con Redis pub/sub","Diseño para latencia inferior a 10ms y tiempo de actividad del 99,99%","Soporte para millones de conexiones concurrentes","Implementación de sistemas de mensajería de baja latencia"],"fr":["Communication en temps réel avec Socket.IO","Architectures de messagerie évolutives avec Redis pub/sub","Conception pour une latence inférieure à 10ms et un temps d''activité de 99,99%","Prise en charge de millions de connexions concurrentes","Mise en œuvre de systèmes de messagerie à faible latence"],"de":["Echtzeitkommunikation mit Socket.IO","Skalierbare Messaging-Architekturen mit Redis pub/sub","Entwurf für Latenz unter 10ms und Verfügbarkeit von 99,99%","Unterstützung für Millionen von gleichzeitigen Verbindungen","Implementierung von Messaging-Systemen mit niedriger Latenz"],"pt":["Comunicação em tempo real com Socket.IO","Arquiteturas de mensagens escaláveis com Redis pub/sub","Baixa latência com tempo de resposta inferior a 10ms","Suporte a milhões de conexões concorrentes","Design para sub-10ms p99 latency com 99.99% uptime"],"ru":["Реальное время с помощью Socket.IO","Масштабируемые архитектуры сообщений с Redis pub/sub","Низкая задержка с временем ответа менее 10мс","Поддержка миллионов одновременных соединений","Проектирование для sub-10ms p99 latency с 99.99% uptime"],"ar":["التواصل في الوقت الفعلي مع Socket.IO","عمارة الرسائل القابلة للتحجيم مع Redis pub/sub","انخفاض التأخير مع وقت استجابة أقل من 10 مللي ثانية","دعم ملايين الاتصالات المتزامنة","تصميم لزمن استجابة أقل من 10 مللي ثانية مع 99.99% وقت التشغيل"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use websocket-engineer","websocket-engineer setup guide","websocket-engineer vs Socket.IO","websocket-engineer install","what is websocket-engineer","websocket-engineer alternative","real-time communication with websocket-engineer","scalable messaging systems with websocket-engineer","websocket-engineer and Redis pub/sub"],"zh":["WebSocket Engineer","实时通信","可扩展架构","Socket.IO","Redis pub/sub","水平扩展","低延迟消息系统","AIエージェント","实时系统工程师"],"ja":["WebSocket エンジニア","リアルタイム通信","スケーラブルなメッセージングアーキテクチャ","Socket.IO","Redis pub/sub","水平 확장","低遅延メッセージシステム","AIエージェント","リアルタイムシステムエンジニア"],"ko":["WebSocket Engineer","실시간 통신","확장 가능한 메시징 아키텍처","Socket.IO","Redis pub/sub","수평 확장","저지연 메시지 시스템","AI 에이전트","실시간 시스템 엔지니어"],"es":["WebSocket Engineer","comunicación en tiempo real","Socket.IO","arquitecturas de mensajería escalables","Redis pub/sub","latencia baja","tiempo de actividad alto","conexiones concurrentes","herramientas de desarrollo de WebSocket"],"fr":["WebSocket Engineer","communication en temps réel","Socket.IO","architectures de messagerie évolutives","Redis pub/sub","faible latence","temps d''activité élevé","connexions concurrentes","outils de développement de WebSocket"],"de":["WebSocket Engineer","Echtzeitkommunikation","Socket.IO","skalierbare Messaging-Architekturen","Redis pub/sub","niedrige Latenz","hohe Verfügbarkeit","gleichzeitige Verbindungen","Entwicklungstools für WebSocket"],"pt":["WebSocket Engineer","Comunicação em tempo real","Socket.IO","Redis pub/sub","Baixa latência","Milhões de conexões concorrentes","Desenvolvimento de sistemas em tempo real"],"ru":["ИИ Агент WebSocket Engineer","Реальное время","Socket.IO","Redis pub/sub","Низкая задержка","Миллионы одновременных соединений","Разработка систем реального времени"],"ar":["WebSocket Engineer","التواصل في الوقت الفعلي","Socket.IO","Redis pub/sub","انخفاض التأخير","ملايين الاتصالات المتزامنة","تطوير أنظمة التواصل في الوقت الفعلي"]}},"owner":"Satoru-Oki","repo":"naki-daifugo","repoPath":"Satoru-Oki/naki-daifugo","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:10:58Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"websocket-engineer","description":"Use when building real-time communication systems with WebSockets or Socket.IO. Invoke for bidirectional messaging, horizontal scaling with Redis, presence tracking, room management.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# WebSocket Engineer\n\nSenior WebSocket specialist with expertise in real-time bidirectional communication, Socket.IO, and scalable messaging architectures supporting millions of concurrent connections.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior real-time systems engineer with 10+ years building WebSocket infrastructure. You specialize in Socket.IO, native WebSockets, horizontal scaling with Redis pub/sub, and low-latency messaging systems. You design for sub-10ms p99 latency with 99.99% uptime.\n\n## W","body":"# WebSocket Engineer\n\nSenior WebSocket specialist with expertise in real-time bidirectional communication, Socket.IO, and scalable messaging architectures supporting millions of concurrent connections.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior real-time systems engineer with 10+ years building WebSocket infrastructure. You specialize in Socket.IO, native WebSockets, horizontal scaling with Redis pub/sub, and low-latency messaging systems. You design for sub-10ms p99 latency with 99.99% uptime.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building WebSocket servers (Socket.IO, ws, uWebSockets)\n- Implementing real-time features (chat, notifications, live updates)\n- Scaling WebSocket infrastructure horizontally\n- Setting up presence systems and room management\n- Optimizing message throughput and latency\n- Migrating from polling to WebSockets\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n1. **Analyze requirements** - Identify connection scale, message volume, latency needs\n2. **Design architecture** - Plan clustering, pub/sub, state management, failover\n3. **Implement** - Build WebSocket server with authentication, rooms, events\n4. **Scale** - Configure Redis adapter, sticky sessions, load balancing\n5. **Monitor** - Track connections, latency, throughput, error rates\n\n## Reference Guide\n\nLoad detailed guidance based on context:\n\n| Topic | Reference | Load When |\n|-------|-----------|-----------|\n| Protocol | `references/protocol.md` | WebSocket handshake, frames, ping/pong, close codes |\n| Scaling | `references/scaling.md` | Horizontal scaling, Redis pub/sub, sticky sessions |\n| Patterns | `references/patterns.md` | Rooms, namespaces, broadcasting, acknowledgments |\n| Security | `references/security.md` | Authentication, authorization, rate limiting, CORS |\n| Alternatives | `references/alternatives.md` | SSE, long polling, when to choose WebSockets |\n\n## Constraints\n\n### MUST DO\n- Implement automatic reconnection with exponential backoff\n- Use sticky sessions for load balancing\n- Handle connection state properly (connecting, connected, disconnecting)\n- Implement heartbeat/ping-pong to detect dead connections\n- Authenticate connections before allowing events\n- Use rooms/namespaces for message scoping\n- Queue messages during disconnection\n- Log connection metrics (count, latency, errors)\n\n### MUST NOT DO\n- Skip connection authentication\n- Broadcast sensitive data to all clients\n- Store large state in memory without clustering strategy\n- Ignore connection limit planning\n- Mix WebSocket and HTTP on same port without proper config\n- Forget to handle connection cleanup\n- Use polling when WebSockets are appropriate\n- Skip load testing before production\n\n## Output Templates\n\nWhen implementing WebSocket features, provide:\n1. Server setup (Socket.IO/ws configuration)\n2. Event handlers (connection, message, disconnect)\n3. Client library (connection, events, reconnection)\n4. Brief explanation of scaling strategy\n\n## Knowledge Reference\n\nSocket.IO, ws, uWebSockets.js, Redis adapter, sticky sessions, nginx WebSocket proxy, JWT over WebSocket, rooms/namespaces, acknowledgments, binary data, compression, heartbeat, backpressure, horizontal pod autoscaling\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:14:24.516Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Real-Time Systems Agents needing expertise in bidirectional communication with Socket.IO and native WebSockets.","zh":"非常适合需要在Socket.IO和本地WebSockets上进行双向通信的实时系统代理的专长。","ja":"Socket.IOとネイティブWebSocketsでの双方向通信を必要とするリアルタイムシステムエージェントに適しています。","ko":"Socket.IO와 네이티브 WebSockets를 사용한 양방향 통신을 필요로 하는 실시간 시스템 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de sistemas en tiempo real que necesitan experiencia en comunicación bidireccional con Socket.IO y WebSockets nativos.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de systèmes en temps réel nécessitant une expertise en communication bidirectionnelle avec Socket.IO et WebSockets natifs.","de":"Perfekt für Echtzeitsystemagenten, die Expertenwissen in bidirektionaler Kommunikation mit Socket.IO und nativen WebSockets benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Sistemas em Tempo Real que necessitam de especialização em comunicação bidirecional com Socket.IO e WebSockets nativos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов систем реального времени, которым требуется экспертиза в двусторонней связи с Socket.IO и родными WebSockets.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء أنظمة الوقت الحقيقي الذين يحتاجون إلى خبرة في الاتصال الثنائي الاتجاه مع Socket.IO والويب сокетات الأصلي"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design and implement scalable WebSocket infrastructure with expertise in horizontal scaling using Redis pub/sub, supporting millions of concurrent connections with sub-10ms p99 latency and 99.99% uptime, leveraging Socket.IO and native WebSockets for real-time messaging systems.","zh":"赋予代理设计和实现可扩展的WebSocket基础设施的能力，具有使用Redis pub/sub进行水平扩展的专长，支持数百万个并发连接，具有小于10ms的p99延迟和99.99%的正常运行时间，利用Socket.IO和本地WebSockets进行实时消息系统。","ja":"エージェントに水平スケーリングを使用して拡張可能なWebSocketインフラストラクチャを設計および実装する能力を与え、Redis pub/subを使用して百万を超える同時接続をサポートし、10ms未満のp99レイテンシと99.99%の正常稼働時間を実現し、Socket.IOとネイティブWebSocketsを使用してリアルタイムメッセージングシステムを実現します。","ko":"에이전트에게 수평 확장을 사용하여 확장 가능한 WebSocket 인프라를 설계 및 구현할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, Redis pub/sub를 사용하여 수백만 개의 동시 접속을 지원하고, 10ms 미만의 p99 지연 및 99.99%의 가동 시간을 обеспеч하며, Socket.IO 및 네이티브 WebSockets를 사용하여 실시간 메시징 시스템을 구축합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar e implementar una infraestructura de WebSocket escalable con experiencia en escalado horizontal utilizando Redis pub/sub, que admite millones de conexiones concurrentes con una latencia p99 inferior a 10 ms y un tiempo de actividad del 99,99%, aprovechando Socket.IO y WebSockets nativos para sistemas de mensajería en tiempo real.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir et de mettre en œuvre une infrastructure WebSocket scalable avec une expertise en scaling horizontal en utilisant Redis pub/sub, prenant en charge des millions de connexions concurrentes avec une latence p99 inférieure à 10 ms et un temps d''activité de 99,99 %, en exploitant Socket.IO et WebSockets natifs pour les systèmes de messagerie en temps réel.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, eine skalierbare WebSocket-Infrastruktur zu entwerfen und zu implementieren, mit Expertenwissen im horizontalen Skalieren unter Verwendung von Redis pub/sub, das Millionen von gleichzeitigen Verbindungen mit einer p99-Latenz von unter 10 ms und einer Betriebszeit von 99,99 % unterstützt, unter Ausnutzung von Socket.IO und nativen WebSockets für Echtzeit-Messaging-Systeme.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar e implementar infraestrutura de WebSocket escalável com especialização em escalonamento horizontal usando Redis pub/sub, suportando milhões de conexões concorrentes com latência p99 inferior a 10ms e tempo de atividade de 99,99%, utilizando Socket.IO e WebSockets nativos para sistemas de mensagens em tempo real.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать и реализовывать масштабируемую инфраструктуру WebSocket с опытом в горизонтальном масштабировании с использованием Redis pub/sub, поддерживающую миллионы одновременных соединений с задержкой p99 менее 10мс и доступностью 99,99%, используя Socket.IO и родные WebSockets для систем обмена сообщениями в реальном времени.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تصميم وتنفيذ بنية تحتية ويب сокيت قابلة للتوسع مع تخصص في التوسع الأفقي باستخدام Redis pub/sub ، ودعم ملايين الاتصالات المتزامنة مع تأخير p99 أقل من 10 مللي ثانية ووقت تشغيل 99.99٪ ، باستخدام Socket.IO وويب сокيتات الأصلي لنظام الرسائل في الوقت الحقيقي."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing real-time applications with low-latency messaging systems","Implementing horizontal scaling with Redis pub/sub for high-traffic WebSocket infrastructure","Optimizing WebSocket connections for sub-10ms p99 latency and 99.99% uptime"],"zh":["设计具有低延迟消息系统的实时应用程序","使用Redis pub/sub实现高流量WebSocket基础设施的水平扩展","优化WebSocket连接以实现小于10ms的p99延迟和99.99%的正常运行时间"],"ja":["低遅延メッセージングシステムを使用したリアルタイムアプリケーションの設計","Redis pub/subを使用した高トラフィックWebSocketインフラストラクチャの水平スケーリングの実装","sub-10msのp99レイテンシと99.99%の正常稼働時間を実現するためにWebSocket接続の最適化"],"ko":["저지연 메시징 시스템을 사용한 실시간 애플리케이션 설계","Redis pub/sub를 사용한 고트래픽 WebSocket 인프라의 수평 확장 구현","sub-10ms의 p99 지연 및 99.99%의 가동 시간을 달성하기 위한 WebSocket 연결 최적화"],"es":["Diseñar aplicaciones en tiempo real con sistemas de mensajería de baja latencia","Implementar escalado horizontal con Redis pub/sub para infraestructuras de WebSocket de alto tráfico","Optimizar conexiones de WebSocket para una latencia p99 inferior a 10 ms y un tiempo de actividad del 99,99%"],"fr":["Concevoir des applications en temps réel avec des systèmes de messagerie à faible latence","Mettre en œuvre un scaling horizontal avec Redis pub/sub pour des infrastructures WebSocket à fort trafic","Optimiser les connexions WebSocket pour une latence p99 inférieure à 10 ms et un temps d''activité de 99,99%"],"de":["Entwerfen von Echtzeit-Anwendungen mit Messaging-Systemen mit geringer Latenz","Implementieren von horizontalem Skalieren mit Redis pub/sub für WebSocket-Infrastrukturen mit hohem Traffik","Optimieren von WebSocket-Verbindungen für eine p99-Latenz von unter 10 ms und eine Betriebszeit von 99,99%"],"pt":["Projetar aplicações em tempo real com sistemas de mensagens de baixa latência","Implementar escalonamento horizontal com Redis pub/sub para infraestrutura de WebSocket de alto tráfego","Otimizar conexões de WebSocket para latência p99 inferior a 10ms e tempo de atividade de 99,99%"],"ru":["Проектировать приложения реального времени с системами обмена сообщениями низкой задержки","Реализовывать горизонтальное масштабирование с Redis pub/sub для инфраструктуры WebSocket с высоким трафиком","Оптимизировать соединения WebSocket для задержки p99 менее 10мс и доступности 99,99%"],"ar":["تصميم تطبيقات الوقت الحقيقي مع أنظمة الرسائل منخفضة التأخير","تنفيذ التوسع الأفقي مع Redis pub/sub لبنية تحتية ويب сокيت عالية الحركة","تحسين اتصالات الويب сокيت لتأخير p99 أقل من 10 مللي ثانية ووقت تشغيل 99.99٪"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires expertise in real-time systems engineering","Limited to WebSocket protocol and related technologies (Socket.IO, native WebSockets, Redis pub/sub)"],"zh":["需要实时系统工程的专长","仅限于WebSocket协议和相关技术（Socket.IO，native WebSockets，Redis pub/sub）"],"ja":["リアルタイムシステムエンジニアリングの専門知識が必要","WebSocketプロトコルと関連技術（Socket.IO、ネイティブWebSockets、Redis pub/sub）に限定される"],"ko":["실시간 시스템 엔지니어링의 전문 지식이 필요","WebSocket 프로토콜 및 관련 기술(소켓.IO, 네이티브 웹소켓, Redis pub/sub)에 제한"],"es":["Requiere experiencia en ingeniería de sistemas en tiempo real","Limitado al protocolo WebSocket y tecnologías relacionadas (Socket.IO, WebSockets nativos, Redis pub/sub)"],"fr":["Nécessite une expertise en ingénierie de systèmes en temps réel","Limité au protocole WebSocket et aux technologies liées (Socket.IO, WebSockets natifs, Redis pub/sub)"],"de":["Benötigt Expertenwissen in Echtzeitsystemtechnik","Begrenzt auf das WebSocket-Protokoll und verwandte Technologien (Socket.IO, native WebSockets, Redis pub/sub)"],"pt":["Requer especialização em engenharia de sistemas em tempo real","Limitado ao protocolo WebSocket e tecnologias relacionadas (Socket.IO, WebSockets nativos, Redis pub/sub)"],"ru":["Требует экспертизы в области инженерии систем реального времени","Ограничен протоколом WebSocket и связанными технологиями (Socket.IO, родные WebSockets, Redis pub/sub)"],"ar":["يتطلب خبرة في هندسة أنظمة الوقت الحقيقي","محدود ببروتوكول الويب сокيت والتكنولوجيا المرتبطة بها (Socket.IO ، الويب сокيتات الأصلي ، Redis pub/sub)"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"11461f743126147b1d82358b217f69300733b9a811c9b9120fadf3c78f111f53","qualityScore":43}');
