,"Utiliza Node.js","CLI disponível","Agent de IA integrado"],"ru":["Разработано с использованием React","Одностраничное приложение","Поддержка НПО SikhAid","Использует Node.js","Доступен CLI","Интегрированный ИИ Агент"],"ar":["تم تطويره باستخدام React","تطبيق صفحة واحدة","دعم المنظمة غير الحكومية SikhAid","يستخدم Node.js","CLI متاح","عامل ذكاء اصطناعي مدمج"]},"keywords":{"zh":["SikhAid数据AI工具","React单页应用","Node.js开发","AI工具安装","SikhAid NGO数据支持","如何使用SikhAid数据AI工具","SikhAid数据AI工具替代品","SikhAid数据AI工具与其他工具的比较"],"ja":["SikhAid AIエージェント","Reactシングルページアプリケーション","Node.js開発","AIエージェントのインストール","SikhAid NGOデータサポート","SikhAid AIエージェントの使用方法","SikhAid AIエージェントの代替品","SikhAid AIエージェントと他のツールの比較"],"ko":["SikhAid 데이터 AI 에이전트","React单页 응용 프로그램","Node.js 개발","AI 에이전트 설치","SikhAid NGO 데이터 지원","SikhAid 데이터 AI 에이전트 사용 방법","SikhAid 데이터 AI 에이전트 대안","SikhAid 데이터 AI 에이전트와 다른 도구의 비교"],"es":["herramientas de AI para ONG","desarrollo de aplicaciones de página única","gestión de datos eficiente","SikhAid Data alternativa","cómo usar SikhAid Data","guía de instalación de SikhAid Data"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour ONG","développement d''applications à page unique","gestion de données efficace","SikhAid Data alternative","comment utiliser SikhAid Data","guide d''installation de SikhAid Data"],"de":["KI-Tools für NRO","Entwicklung von Single-Page-Anwendungen","effiziente Datenverwaltung","SikhAid Data Alternative","wie man SikhAid Data verwendet","Installationsanleitung für SikhAid Data"],"pt":["como usar SikhAid-Data","o que é SikhAid-Data","SikhAid-Data alternativa","SikhAid-Data vs outros","instalar SikhAid-Data","guia de configuração do SikhAid-Data","desenvolvimento de aplicativos de IA","ferramentas de IA para ONG"],"ru":["как использовать SikhAid-Data","что такое SikhAid-Data","альтернатива SikhAid-Data","SikhAid-Data vs другие","установить SikhAid-Data","руководство по настройке SikhAid-Data","разработка ИИ-приложений","ИИ-инструменты для НПО"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام SikhAid-Data","ما هو SikhAid-Data","بديل SikhAid-Data","SikhAid-Data مقابل الآخرين","تثبيت SikhAid-Data","دليل إعداد SikhAid-Data","تطوير تطبيقات الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمنظمات غير الحكومية"]}},"owner":"the-non-expert","repo":"SikhAidSPA","repoPath":"the-non-expert/SikhAidSPA","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-05T06:20:06.273Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"sikhaid-data","description":"Use when working with data, state management, Firebase, or Firestore in SikhAid project. Covers Svelte stores, data flow patterns, Firebase initialization, Firestore CRUD operations, and data types.","bodyPreview":"# SikhAid Data & State Management\n\n## State Management Architecture\n\n### Svelte Stores\n**Pattern:** Reactive stores for client-side state management\n\n**Store Types Used:**\n- `writable()` - Read/write stores for component state\n- No derived stores currently\n- No custom stores (plain writable stores)\n\n**Store Locations:**\n```\nsrc/lib/stores/\n├── donation.ts       # Donation amount state\n├── contact.ts        # Contact form submissions\n├── volunteering.ts   # Volunteer form submissions\n└── csr.ts","body":"# SikhAid Data & State Management\n\n## State Management Architecture\n\n### Svelte Stores\n**Pattern:** Reactive stores for client-side state management\n\n**Store Types Used:**\n- `writable()` - Read/write stores for component state\n- No derived stores currently\n- No custom stores (plain writable stores)\n\n**Store Locations:**\n```\nsrc/lib/stores/\n├── donation.ts       # Donation amount state\n├── contact.ts        # Contact form submissions\n├── volunteering.ts   # Volunteer form submissions\n└── csr.ts            # CSR partnership submissions\n```\n\n## Store Patterns\n\n### 1. Donation Store\n**File:** `src/lib/stores/donation.ts`\n\n**Purpose:** Manage selected donation amount across components\n\n```typescript\nimport { writable } from ''svelte/store'';\n\nexport const selectedAmount = writable<number>(0);\n\nexport function setDonationAmount(amount: number) {\n  selectedAmount.set(amount);\n\n  // Side effect: scroll to payment form\n  setTimeout(() => {\n    const paymentSection = document.getElementById(''payment-form'');\n    paymentSection?.scrollIntoView({ behavior: ''smooth'' });\n  }, 100);\n}\n```\n\n**Usage:**\n```svelte\n<script lang=\"ts\">\n  import { selectedAmount, setDonationAmount } from ''$lib/stores/donation'';\n\n  // Read value with $ prefix\n  $: amount = $selectedAmount;\n\n  // Write value\n  function selectAmount(value: number) {\n    setDonationAmount(value);\n  }\n</script>\n\n<div>Selected: ₹{$selectedAmount}</div>\n<button on:click={() => selectAmount(1000)}>₹1,000</button>\n```\n\n### 2. Contact Submissions Store\n**File:** `src/lib/stores/contact.ts`\n\n**Purpose:** Store contact form submissions (in-memory and Firestore)\n\n```typescript\nimport { writable } from ''svelte/store'';\n\nexport interface ContactSubmission {\n  name: string;\n  email: string;\n  phone: string;\n  subject: string;\n  message: string;\n  timestamp: number;\n}\n\nexport const contactSubmissions = writable<ContactSubmission[]>([]);\n\nexport function addContactSubmission(submission: ContactSubmission) {\n  contactSubmissions.update(submissions => {\n    return [...submissions, submission];\n  });\n}\n```\n\n### 3. Volunteering Store\n**File:** `src/lib/stores/volunteering.ts`\n\n**Purpose:** Store volunteer applications\n\n```typescript\nexport interface VolunteerSubmission {\n  fullName: string;\n  email: string;\n  mobile: string;\n  gender: string;\n  address: string;\n  opportunity: string;\n  durationMonths: number;\n  durationYears: number;\n  startDate: string;\n  about: string;\n  timestamp: number;\n}\n\nexport const volunteerSubmissions = writable<VolunteerSubmission[]>([]);\n```\n\n### 4. CSR Store\n**File:** `src/lib/stores/csr.ts`\n\n**Purpose:** Store CSR partnership inquiries\n\n```typescript\nexport interface CSRSubmission {\n  companyName: string;\n  contactPerson: string;\n  email: string;\n  phone: string;\n  companySize: string;\n  interests: string[];\n  message: string;\n  timestamp: number;\n}\n\nexport const csrSubmissions = writable<CSRSubmission[]>([]);\n```\n\n## Data Flow Pattern\n\n### Standard Form Submission Flow\n```\n1. User fills form\n   ↓\n2. Form validation\n   ↓\n3. Create submission object with timestamp\n   ↓\n4. Update Svelte store (addSubmission)\n   ↓\n5. Write to Firestore (addToFirestore)\n   ↓\n6. Show success/error feedback\n   ↓\n7. Reset form (optional)\n```\n\n### Example Flow Implementation\n```svelte\n<script lang=\"ts\">\n  import { addContactSubmission } from ''$lib/stores/contact'';\n  import { addContactToFirestore } from ''$lib/firestore'';\n\n  let formData = { name: '''', email: '''', phone: '''', subject: '''', message: '''' };\n  let isSubmitting = false;\n  let successMessage = '''';\n  let errorMessage = '''';\n\n  async function handleSubmit() {\n    // 1. Validate\n    if (!validateForm()) return;\n\n    isSubmitting = true;\n    errorMessage = '''';\n\n    try {\n      // 2. Create submission object\n      const submission = {\n        ...formData,\n        timestamp: Date.now()\n      };\n\n      // 3. Update store\n      addContactSubmission(submission);\n\n      // 4. Write to Firestore\n      await addContactToFirestore(submission);\n\n      // 5. Success feedback\n      successMessage = ''Submission received!'';\n      formData = { name: '''', email: '''', phone: '''', subject: '''', message: '''' };\n    } catch (error) {\n      // 6. Error feedback\n      errorMessage = ''Submission failed. Please try again.'';\n      console.error(''❌ Error:'', error);\n    } finally {\n      isSubmitting = false;\n    }\n  }\n</script>\n```\n\n## Firebase Integration\n\n### Firebase Initialization\n**File:** `src/lib/firebase.ts`\n\n```typescript\nimport { initializeApp, type FirebaseApp } from ''firebase/app'';\nimport { getFirestore, type Firestore } from ''firebase/firestore'';\nimport { getAuth, type Auth } from ''firebase/auth'';\n\nconst firebaseConfig = {\n  apiKey: import.meta.env.VITE_FIREBASE_API_KEY,\n  authDomain: import.meta.env.VITE_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN,\n  projectId: import.meta.env.VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID,\n  storageBucket: import.meta.env.VITE_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET,\n  messagingSenderId: import.meta.env.VITE_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID,\n  appId: import.meta.env.VITE_FIREBASE_APP_ID\n};\n\nlet app: FirebaseApp | null = null;\nlet db: Firestore | null = null;\nlet auth: Auth | null = null;\n\n// Browser-only initialization\nif (typeof window !== ''undefined'') {\n  try {\n    app = initializeApp(firebaseConfig);\n    db = getFirestore(app);\n    auth = getAuth(app);\n    console.log(''✅ Firebase initialized successfully'');\n  } catch (error) {\n    console.error(''❌ Firebase initialization error:'', error);\n  }\n}\n\nexport { app, db, auth };\n```\n\n**Key Points:**\n- Browser-only initialization (`typeof window !== ''undefined''`)\n- Environment variables for configuration\n- Error handling with console logging\n- Exports app, db, and auth instances\n\n## Firestore Operations\n\n### Collections Structure\n```\nFirestore Database\n├── contact_submissions/\n│   └── [auto-generated-id]/\n│       ├── name: string\n│       ├── email: string\n│       ├── phone: string\n│       ├── subject: string\n│       ├── message: string\n│       ├── status: ''new'' | ''read'' | ''resolved''\n│       └── timestamp: Firestore Timestamp\n│\n├── volunteer_submissions/\n│   └── [auto-generated-id]/\n│       ├── fullName: string\n│       ├── email: string\n│       ├── mobile: string\n│       ├── opportunity: string\n│       ├── status: ''new'' | ''read'' | ''resolved''\n│       └── ...\n│\n└── csr_submissions/\n    └── [auto-generated-id]/\n        ├── companyName: string\n        ├── email: string\n        ├── status: ''new'' | ''read'' | ''resolved''\n        └── ...\n```\n\n### Firestore Functions\n**File:** `src/lib/firestore.ts`\n\n#### Add Contact Submission\n```typescript\nimport { collection, addDoc, Timestamp } from ''firebase/firestore'';\nimport { db } from ''./firebase'';\nimport type { ContactSubmission } from ''./stores/contact'';\n\nexport async function addContactToFirestore(\n  submission: ContactSubmission\n): Promise<string> {\n  if (!db) throw new Error(''Firestore not initialized'');\n\n  try {\n    const docRef = await addDoc(collection(db, ''contact_submissions''), {\n      ...submission,\n      status: ''new'',\n      timestamp: Timestamp.fromMillis(submission.timestamp)\n    });\n\n    console.log(''✅ Contact added to Firestore:'', docRef.id);\n    return docRef.id;\n  } catch (error) {\n    console.error(''❌ Error adding contact:'', error);\n    throw error;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n#### Get All Submissions\n```typescript\nimport { collection, getDocs, query, orderBy } from ''firebase/firestore'';\n\nexport interface FirestoreContactSubmission extends ContactSubmission {\n  id?: string;\n  status: ''new'' | ''read'' | ''resolved'';\n  firestoreTimestamp?: Timestamp;\n}\n\nexport async function getContactSubmissions(): Promise<FirestoreContactSubmission[]> {\n  if (!db) throw new Error(''Firestore not initialized'');\n\n  try {\n    const q = query(\n      collection(db, ''contact_submissions''),\n      orderBy(''timestamp'', ''desc'')\n    );\n\n    const querySnapshot = await getDocs(q);\n    const submissions: FirestoreContactSubmission[] = [];\n\n    querySnapshot.forEach((doc) => {\n      submissions.push({\n        id: doc.id,\n        ...doc.data() as FirestoreContactSubmission\n      });\n    });\n\n    console.log(`📊 Fetched ${submissions.length} contact submissions`);\n    return submissions;\n  } catch (error) {\n    console.error(''❌ Error fetching submissions:'', error);\n    throw error;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n#### Update Submission Status\n```typescript\nimport { doc, updateDoc } from ''firebase/firestore'';\n\nexport async function updateSubmissionStatus(\n  collectionName: string,\n  documentId: string,\n  status: ''new'' | ''read'' | ''resolved''\n): Promise<void> {\n  if (!db) throw new Error(''Firestore not initialized'');\n\n  try {\n    const docRef = doc(db, collectionName, documentId);\n    await updateDoc(docRef, { status });\n\n    console.log(`✅ Updated ${documentId} status to ${status}`);\n  } catch (error) {\n    console.error(''❌ Error updating status:'', error);\n    throw error;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n#### Add Volunteer Submission\n```typescript\nexport async function addVolunteerToFirestore(\n  submission: VolunteerSubmission\n): Promise<string> {\n  if (!db) throw new Error(''Firestore not initialized'');\n\n  try {\n    const docRef = await addDoc(collection(db, ''volunteer_submissions''), {\n      ...submission,\n      status: ''new'',\n      timestamp: Timestamp.fromMillis(submission.timestamp)\n    });\n\n    console.log(''✅ Volunteer added:'', docRef.id);\n    return docRef.id;\n  } catch (error) {\n    console.error(''❌ Error adding volunteer:'', error);\n    throw error;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n#### Get Volunteer Submissions\n```typescript\nexport async function getVolunteerSubmissions(): Promise<FirestoreVolunteerSubmission[]> {\n  if (!db) throw new Error(''Firestore not initialized'');\n\n  try {\n    const q = query(\n      collection(db, ''volunteer_submissions''),\n      orderBy(''timestamp'', ''desc'')\n    );\n\n    const querySnapshot = await getDocs(q);\n    const submissions: FirestoreVolunteerSubmission[] = [];\n\n    querySnapshot.forEach((doc) => {\n      submissions.push({\n        id: doc.id,\n        ...doc.data() as FirestoreVolunteerSubmission\n      });\n    });\n\n    return submissions;\n  } catch (error) {\n    console.error(''❌ Error fetching volunteers:'', error);\n    throw error;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### CSR Functions (Similar Pattern)\n- `addCSRToFirestore()` - Add CSR submission\n- `getCSRSubmissions()` - Get all CSR submissions\n- Both follow same pattern as contact/volunteer\n\n## Static Data Management\n\n### Campaigns Data\n**File:** `src/lib/data/campaigns.js`\n\n**Structure:**\n```javascript\nexport const campaigns = [\n  {\n    slug: ''langar-aid'',\n    title: ''Langar Aid'',\n    subtitle: ''Free Meals for All'',\n    shortDescription: ''Serving nutritious meals...'',\n    fullDescription: ''Detailed description...'',\n    image: ''/images/campaign.jpg'',\n    category: ''hunger-relief'',\n    status: ''ongoing'', // ''ongoing'' | ''completed'' | ''seasonal''\n    impactStats: [\n      { label: ''Meals Served'', value: ''100,000+'', icon: ''mdi:food'' }\n    ],\n    howItWorks: [\n      { step: 1, title: ''Step Title'', description: ''Step description'' }\n    ],\n    gallery: [\n      { src: ''/images/gallery1.jpg'', alt: ''Description'' }\n    ]\n  },\n  // More campaigns...\n];\n```\n\n**Usage:**\n```svelte\n<script lang=\"ts\">\n  import { campaigns } from ''$lib/data/campaigns'';\n  import type { Campaign } from ''$lib/types/campaign'';\n\n  // Filter campaigns\n  $: ongoingCampaigns = campaigns.filter(c => c.status === ''ongoing'');\n\n  // Find by slug\n  $: campaign = campaigns.find(c => c.slug === ''langar-aid'');\n</script>\n\n{#each ongoingCampaigns as campaign}\n  <div>{campaign.title}</div>\n{/each}\n```\n\n### Blog Data\n**File:** `src/lib/data/blogs.js`\n\n**Structure:**\n```javascript\nexport const blogs = [\n  {\n    slug: ''post-slug'',\n    title: ''Blog Post Title'',\n    excerpt: ''Short excerpt...'',\n    content: ''Full blog content...'',\n    author: ''Author Name'',\n    date: ''2024-01-15'',\n    image: ''/images/blog.jpg'',\n    category: ''community''\n  },\n  // More blog posts...\n];\n```\n\n## TypeScript Types & Interfaces\n\n### Campaign Types\n**File:** `src/lib/types/campaign.ts`\n\n```typescript\nexport interface Campaign {\n  slug: string;\n  title: string;\n  subtitle: string;\n  shortDescription: string;\n  fullDescription: string;\n  image: string;\n  category: string;\n  status: ''ongoing'' | ''completed'' | ''seasonal'';\n  impactStats: ImpactStat[];\n  howItWorks: HowItWorksStep[];\n  gallery: GalleryImage[];\n}\n\nexport interface ImpactStat {\n  label: string;\n  value: string;\n  icon: string;\n}\n\nexport interface HowItWorksStep {\n  step: number;\n  title: string;\n  description: string;\n}\n\nexport interface GalleryImage {\n  src: string;\n  alt: string;\n}\n```\n\n### Store Types (Defined in store files)\n\n```typescript\n// Contact\nexport interface ContactSubmission {\n  name: string;\n  email: string;\n  phone: string;\n  subject: string;\n  message: string;\n  timestamp: number;\n}\n\n// Volunteer\nexport interface VolunteerSubmission {\n  fullName: string;\n  email: string;\n  mobile: string;\n  gender: string;\n  address: string;\n  opportunity: string;\n  durationMonths: number;\n  durationYears: number;\n  startDate: string;\n  about: string;\n  timestamp: number;\n}\n\n// CSR\nexport interface CSRSubmission {\n  companyName: string;\n  contactPerson: string;\n  email: string;\n  phone: string;\n  companySize: string;\n  interests: string[];\n  message: string;\n  timestamp: number;\n}\n```\n\n### Firestore Extended Types\n\n```typescript\nimport type { Timestamp } from ''firebase/firestore'';\n\nexport interface FirestoreContactSubmission extends ContactSubmission {\n  id?: string;\n  status: ''new'' | ''read'' | ''resolved'';\n  firestoreTimestamp?: Timestamp;\n}\n\nexport interface FirestoreVolunteerSubmission extends VolunteerSubmission {\n  id?: string;\n  status: ''new'' | ''read'' | ''resolved'';\n  firestoreTimestamp?: Timestamp;\n}\n\nexport interface FirestoreCSRSubmission extends CSRSubmission {\n  id?: string;\n  status: ''new'' | ''read'' | ''resolved'';\n  firestoreTimestamp?: Timestamp;\n}\n```\n\n## Data Loading in Components\n\n### Loading Firestore Data (Admin Panel)\n```svelte\n<script lang=\"ts\">\n  import { onMount } from ''svelte'';\n  import {\n    getContactSubmissions,\n    type FirestoreContactSubmission\n  } from ''$lib/firestore'';\n\n  let submissions: FirestoreContactSubmission[] = [];\n  let isLoading = true;\n  let error = '''';\n\n  onMount(async () => {\n    try {\n      submissions = await getContactSubmissions();\n      isLoading = false;\n    } catch (err) {\n      error = ''Failed to load submissions'';\n      isLoading = false;\n    }\n  });\n</script>\n\n{#if isLoading}\n  <div>Loading...</div>\n{:else if error}\n  <div class=\"text-red-500\">{error}</div>\n{:else}\n  {#each submissions as submission}\n    <div>{submission.name}</div>\n  {/each}\n{/if}\n```\n\n### Using Static Data\n```svelte\n<script lang=\"ts\">\n  import { campaigns } from ''$lib/data/campaigns'';\n\n  // No onMount needed - data is already available\n  $: featuredCampaigns = campaigns.filter(c => c.featured);\n</script>\n\n{#each featuredCampaigns as campaign}\n  <div>{campaign.title}</div>\n{/each}\n```\n\n## Store Subscription Patterns\n\n### Auto-subscribing with $ Prefix\n```svelte\n<script lang=\"ts\">\n  import { selectedAmount } from ''$lib/stores/donation'';\n\n  // Automatic subscription\n  $: amount = $selectedAmount;\n</script>\n\n<div>Amount: ₹{$selectedAmount}</div>\n```\n\n### Manual Subscribe/Unsubscribe\n```svelte\n<script lang=\"ts\">\n  import { onDestroy } from ''svelte'';\n  import { contactSubmissions } from ''$lib/stores/contact'';\n\n  let submissions = [];\n\n  const unsubscribe = contactSubmissions.subscribe(value => {\n    submissions = value;\n  });\n\n  onDestroy(() => {\n    unsubscribe();\n  });\n</script>\n```\n\n## Common Data Patterns\n\n### Filtering Arrays\n```svelte\n<script lang=\"ts\">\n  import { campaigns } from ''$lib/data/campaigns'';\n\n  let selectedCategory = ''all'';\n\n  $: filteredCampaigns = selectedCategory === ''all''\n    ? campaigns\n    : campaigns.filter(c => c.category === selectedCategory);\n</script>\n```\n\n### Searching\n```svelte\n<script lang=\"ts\">\n  let searchQuery = '''';\n  let campaigns = [...];\n\n  $: searchResults = campaigns.filter(campaign =>\n    campaign.title.toLowerCase().includes(searchQuery.toLowerCase()) ||\n    campaign.shortDescription.toLowerCase().includes(searchQuery.toLowerCase())\n  );\n</script>\n```\n\n### Sorting\n```svelte\n<script lang=\"ts\">\n  let submissions = [...];\n  let sortBy = ''timestamp''; // ''timestamp'' | ''name'' | ''status''\n\n  $: sortedSubmissions = [...submissions].sort((a, b) => {\n    if (sortBy === ''timestamp'') {\n      return b.timestamp - a.timestamp; // Newest first\n    }\n    if (sortBy === ''name'') {\n      return a.name.localeCompare(b.name);\n    }\n    return 0;\n  });\n</script>\n```\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n- Working with Svelte stores\n- Integrating Firebase/Firestore\n- Managing form submissions\n- Loading or filtering data\n- Creating new data types\n- Implementing CRUD operations\n- Understanding data flow in the app\n\n## Related Skills\n- `sikhaid-forms` - Form submission patterns\n- `sikhaid-components` - Component state management\n- `sikhaid-overview` - Firebase configuration\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-05T08:09:40.465Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing reactive state management for client-side applications","zh":"非常适合需要响应式状态管理的前端代理，用于客户端应用程序","ja":"フロントエンドエージェントがクライアントサイドアプリケーションにリアクティブ状態管理を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"클라이언트 측 애플리케이션에 대한 반응형 상태 관리가 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes frontend que necesitan gestión de estado reactivo para aplicaciones del lado del cliente","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend ayant besoin d''une gestion d''état réactive pour les applications côté client","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine reaktive Zustandsverwaltung für Client-Seiten-Anwendungen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de gerenciamento de estado reativo para aplicações de lado do cliente","ru":"Идеально подходит для фронтенд-агентов, требующих реактивного управления состоянием для клиентских приложений","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة حالة تفاعلية للتطبيقات على جانب العميل"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage donation, contact, and volunteering form submissions using Svelte Stores, providing a robust state management architecture with writable stores for component state","zh":"使代理能够使用Svelte Stores管理捐赠、联系人和志愿者表单提交，提供具有可写存储的组件状态的强大状态管理架构","ja":"Svelte Storesを使用して、エージェントが寄付、連絡先、ボランティアフォームの提出を管理できるようにし、コンポーネント状態の書き込み可能なストアを備えた堅牢な状態管理アーキテクチャを提供","ko":"에이전트가 Svelte Stores를 사용하여 기부, 연락처 및 자원봉사자 양식 제출을 관리할 수 있도록 하여 컴포넌트 상태에 대한 쓰기 가능한 저장소를 갖춘 강력한 상태 관리 아키텍처를 제공","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar las solicitudes de donaciones, contacto y voluntariado utilizando Svelte Stores, proporcionando una arquitectura de gestión de estado robusta con tiendas writables para el estado de los componentes","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les soumissions de dons, de contact et de volontariat en utilisant Svelte Stores, fournissant une architecture de gestion d''état robuste avec des magasins réinscriptibles pour l''état des composants","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Spenden-, Kontakt- und Freiwilligenformulareinreichungen mithilfe von Svelte Stores zu verwalten, wodurch eine robuste Zustandsverwaltungsarchitektur mit beschreibbaren Stores für den Komponentenzustand bereitgestellt wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar doações, contatos e envios de formulários de voluntariado usando Svelte Stores, fornecendo uma arquitetura de gerenciamento de estado robusta com lojas graváveis para estado de componentes","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять пожертвованиями, контактами и подачами форм волонтерства с помощью Svelte Stores, предоставляя прочную архитектуру управления состоянием с записываемыми хранилищами для состояния компонентов","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إدارة التبرعات والاتصالات وإرسال استمارات التطوع باستخدام Svelte Stores ، مما يوفر هندسة قوية لإدارة الحالة مع متاجر قابلة للكتابة لحالة المكونات"},"useCases":{"en":["Managing donation amount state","Handling contact form submissions","Tracking volunteer form submissions"],"zh":["管理捐赠金额状态","处理联系人表单提交","跟踪志愿者表单提交"],"ja":["寄付金額状態の管理","連絡先フォームの提出の処理","ボランティアフォームの提出の追跡"],"ko":["기부 금액 상태 관리","연락처 양식 제출 처리","자원봉사자 양식 제출 추적"],"es":["Gestión del estado del monto de la donación","Gestión de las solicitudes de formulario de contacto","Seguimiento de las solicitudes de formulario de voluntariado"],"fr":["Gestion de l''état du montant du don","Gestion des soumissions de formulaire de contact","Suivi des soumissions de formulaire de volontariat"],"de":["Verwaltung des Zustands des Spendenbetrags","Verwaltung von Kontaktformulareinreichungen","Verfolgung von Freiwilligenformulareinreichungen"],"pt":["Gerenciamento do estado da quantidade de doação","Tratamento de envios de formulários de contato","Rastreamento de envios de formulários de voluntariado"],"ru":["Управление состоянием суммы пожертвования","Обработка подач форм контактов","Отслеживание подач форм волонтерства"],"ar":["إدارة حالة مبلغ التبرع","معالجة إرسال استمارات الاتصال","تتبع إرسال استمارات التطوع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Limited to client-side state management","No support for derived or custom stores"],"zh":["仅限客户端状态管理","不支持派生或自定义存储"],"ja":["クライアントサイド状態管理のみ","派生またはカスタムストアをサポートしない"],"ko":["클라이언트 측 상태 관리만","파생 또는 사용자 지정 저장소를 지원하지 않음"],"es":["Limitado a la gestión de estado del lado del cliente","No admite tiendas derivadas o personalizadas"],"fr":["Limité à la gestion d''état côté client","N''admet pas les magasins dérivés ou personnalisés"],"de":["Begrenzt auf die Zustandsverwaltung auf Client-Seite","Unterstützt keine abgeleiteten oder benutzerdefinierten Stores"],"pt":["Limitado ao gerenciamento de estado do lado do cliente","Sem suporte para lojas derivadas ou personalizadas"],"ru":["Ограничен управлением состоянием на стороне клиента","Нет поддержки для производных или пользовательских хранилищ"],"ar":["محدود بالإدارة الحالة على جانب العميل","بدون دعم لمتاجر مشتقة أو مخصصة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"5cbeadb924bbf74f6984457c3d1d47e222b74b9c07cfd19d9191e73183e08220","qualityScore":43}');
