INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('vllm-project/vllm-ascend/vllm-ascend-model-adapter', 'vllm-ascend-model-adapter', 'vllm-project', 'vllm-ascend', 'community', 'vllm-ascend-model-adapter vllm-project vllm-ascend community ascend inference llm llm-serving llmops mlops model-serving transformer vllm The vllm-ascend-model-adapter skill enables developers to adapt Hugging Face or local models for vLLM on Ascend with minimal changes. It benefits developers working with transformer models and inference pipelines. vllm-ascend-model-adapter 是一个社区维护的硬件插件，用于在 Ascend 上运行 vLLM，支持 Hugging Face 或本地模型 vllm-ascend-model-adapter は、Ascend 上で vLLM を実行するためのコミュニティメンテナンス型ハードウェアプラグインです。Hugging Face またはローカル モデルをサポート vllm-ascend-model-adapter는 Ascend에서 vLLM를 실행하기 위한 커뮤니티 유지 보수형 하드웨어 플러그인입니다. Hugging Face 또는 로컬 모델을 지원 El adaptador de modelo vllm-ascend permite ejecutar modelos de Hugging Face o locales en vllm-ascend con validación determinista y entrega de un solo compromiso L''adaptateur de modèle vllm-ascend permet d''exécuter des modèles Hugging Face ou locaux sur vllm-ascend avec une validation déterministe et une livraison en un seul commit Der vllm-ascend-Modelladapter ermöglicht die Ausführung von Hugging Face- oder lokalen Modellen auf vllm-ascend mit deterministischer Validierung und Single-Commit-Lieferung O vllm-ascend-model-adapter é um plugin de hardware de código aberto para vLLM no Ascend, permitindo a adaptação de modelos com mudanças mínimas vllm-ascend-model-adapter - это плагин аппаратного обеспечения с открытым исходным кодом для vLLM на Ascend, позволяющий адаптировать модели с минимальными изменениями vllm-ascend-model-adapter هو ملحق أجهزة مفتوح المصدر ل vLLM على Ascend، يسمح بتعديل النماذج بأقل التغييرات vllm-ascend-model-adapter setup guide how to use vllm-ascend-model-adapter for model serving vllm-ascend-model-adapter vs other hardware plugins vllm-ascend-model-adapter install for Ascend what is vllm-ascend-model-adapter and its benefits vllm-ascend-model-adapter troubleshooting for inference issues vllm-ascend-model-adapter alternative for transformer models vllm-ascend-model-adapter for MLOps and model operations vllm-ascend-model-adapter AIエージェント Ascend vLLM Hugging Face 模型适配 确定性验证 单次提交交付 多模态 EP ACLGraph Adapts Hugging Face or local models to run on vLLM on Ascend with minimal changes Supports deterministic validation for reliable model deployment Enables single-commit delivery for streamlined model serving Compatible with both already-supported models and new architectures Provides troubleshooting guides for startup and inference issues References workflow checklists and feature-first guidelines for effective implementation vllm-ascend-model-adapter is a community-maintained hardware plugin for adapting models to run on vLLM on Ascend, supporting deterministic validation and single-commit delivery');
