ion du code","Prise en charge de defineModel, defineProps et defineExpose"],"de":["Konfiguration von TypeScript für Vue 3-Projekte","Integration mit Vite für eine schnellere Kompilierung","Verwendung von Vue Router mit typisierten Routen","Komponententests mit Vitest","Muster der Composition-API für eine bessere Codeorganisation","Unterstützung für defineModel, defineProps und defineExpose"],"pt":["Configuração do Vue 3 com TypeScript","Melhores práticas para desenvolver aplicações web escaláveis","Integração com Vite e Volar","Uso de Composition API e defineModel","Testes de componentes com Vitest","Configuração de rotas tipadas com Vue Router"],"ru":["Настройка Vue 3 с TypeScript","Лучшие практики для разработки масштабируемых веб-приложений","Интеграция с Vite и Volar","Использование Composition API и defineModel","Тестирование компонентов с Vitest","Настройка типизированных маршрутов с Vue Router"],"ar":["ضبط فيو 3 مع تايب سكريبت","أفضل الممارسات لتطوير تطبيقات ويب قابلة للتوسعة","التكامل مع Vite و Volar","استخدام Composition API و defineModel","اختبار المكونات مع Vitest","ضبط المسارات المُفصلة مع Vue Router"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use vue-best-practices","vue-best-practices setup guide","vue 3 typescript configuration","vue-best-practices vs vue-cli","vue-best-practices install","vue router typed routes","vitest component testing","what is vue-best-practices"],"zh":["Vue最佳实践","Vue 3应用","TypeScript配置","Vite集成","Vue Router类型路由","AIエージェント","Vue开发指南"],"ja":["Vue Best Practices","Vue 3アプリケーション","TypeScript構成","Vite統合","Vue Routerタイプルーティング","AIエージェント","Vue開発ガイド"],"ko":["Vue 베스트 프랙티스","Vue 3 애플리케이션","TypeScript 구성","Vite 통합","Vue Router 유형 라우팅","인공지능 에이전트","Vue 개발 가이드"],"es":["vue best practices","configuración de vue 3","typescript para vue","vite para vue","vue router","vitest","composition api","defineModel","defineProps","defineExpose"],"fr":["meilleures pratiques vue","configuration de vue 3","typescript pour vue","vite pour vue","vue router","vitest","api de composition","defineModel","defineProps","defineExpose"],"de":["vue best practices","konfiguration von vue 3","typescript für vue","vite für vue","vue router","vitest","composition-api","defineModel","defineProps","defineExpose"],"pt":["vue best practices","configuração vue 3","typescript","vite","volar","composition api","vitest","vue router","desenvolvimento web","aplicações web escaláveis"],"ru":["vue best practices","настройка vue 3","typescript","vite","volar","composition api","vitest","vue router","разработка веб-приложений","масштабируемые веб-приложения"],"ar":["أفضل الممارسات لفيو","ضبط فيو 3","تايب سكريبت","فايت","فولار","كومبوزيشن.api","فيتست","فيو روتر","تطوير تطبيقات الويب","تطبيقات ويب قابلة للتوسعة"]}},"owner":"jianxcao","repo":"qbittorrent-web","repoPath":"jianxcao/qbittorrent-web","stars":21,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-03T13:14:43Z","topics":["qb","qbittorent","webui"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vue-best-practices","description":"Comprehensive Vue 3 development best practices, TypeScript configuration, tooling troubleshooting, testing patterns, and composition API gotchas. Covers vue-tsc, Volar, Vite configuration, Vue Router typing, component testing, reactivity patterns, and SFC features. Use when working with Vue 3 + TypeScript projects, debugging build errors, writing tests, or following best practices.","version":"5.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Vue Best Practices\n\nComprehensive development guidelines, TypeScript configuration, and best practices for Vue 3 applications.\n\n## When to Apply\n\n- Setting up or configuring Vue 3 + TypeScript projects\n- Debugging type checking issues with vue-tsc\n- Fixing IDE/editor integration with Volar\n- Configuring Vite for Vue projects\n- Working with Vue Router typed routes\n- Writing component tests with Vitest\n- Using Composition API patterns\n- Working with defineModel, defineProps, defineExpose\n- Writi","body":"# Vue Best Practices\n\nComprehensive development guidelines, TypeScript configuration, and best practices for Vue 3 applications.\n\n## When to Apply\n\n- Setting up or configuring Vue 3 + TypeScript projects\n- Debugging type checking issues with vue-tsc\n- Fixing IDE/editor integration with Volar\n- Configuring Vite for Vue projects\n- Working with Vue Router typed routes\n- Writing component tests with Vitest\n- Using Composition API patterns\n- Working with defineModel, defineProps, defineExpose\n- Writing reusable composables\n\n---\n\n## Capability Rules\n\nRules that enable AI to solve problems it cannot solve without the skill.\n\n### Type Checking\n\n| Rule | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| [vue-tsc-strict-templates](rules/vue-tsc-strict-templates.md) | HIGH | Enable strict template checking to catch undefined components |\n| [vue-define-model-generics](rules/vue-define-model-generics.md) | HIGH | Fix vue-tsc errors when using defineModel with generic components |\n\n### vueCompilerOptions Settings\n\n| Rule | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| [fallthrough-attributes](rules/fallthrough-attributes.md) | HIGH | Type-check fallthrough attributes on wrapper components |\n| [strict-css-modules](rules/strict-css-modules.md) | MEDIUM | Catch typos in CSS module class names at compile time |\n| [data-attributes-config](rules/data-attributes-config.md) | MEDIUM | Allow data-* attributes with strictTemplates enabled |\n\n### Tooling & Configuration\n\n| Rule | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| [vue-tsc-typescript-compatibility](rules/vue-tsc-typescript-compatibility.md) | HIGH | Fix vue-tsc and TypeScript version incompatibility issues |\n| [volar-3-breaking-changes](rules/volar-3-breaking-changes.md) | HIGH | Fix editor integration after Volar/vue-language-server 3.0 upgrade |\n| [module-resolution-bundler](rules/module-resolution-bundler.md) | HIGH | Fix \"Cannot find module\" errors after @vue/tsconfig upgrade |\n| [unplugin-auto-import-conflicts](rules/unplugin-auto-import-conflicts.md) | HIGH | Fix component types resolving as any with unplugin conflicts |\n| [codeactions-save-performance](rules/codeactions-save-performance.md) | HIGH | Fix 30-60 second save delays in large Vue projects |\n\n### Vite Configuration\n\n| Rule | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| [path-alias-vue-sfc](rules/path-alias-vue-sfc.md) | HIGH | Fix resolve.alias failures in Vue SFC files |\n| [duplicate-plugin-detection](rules/duplicate-plugin-detection.md) | MEDIUM | Detect and fix duplicate Vue plugin registration |\n\n### Component Patterns\n\n| Rule | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| [use-template-ref-generics](rules/use-template-ref-generics.md) | MEDIUM | Fix incorrect type inference for refs to generic components |\n| [define-model-update-event](rules/define-model-update-event.md) | MEDIUM | Fix runtime errors from unexpected undefined in model updates |\n| [with-defaults-union-types](rules/with-defaults-union-types.md) | MEDIUM | Fix incorrect default value behavior with union type props |\n| [verbatim-module-syntax](rules/verbatim-module-syntax.md) | MEDIUM | Fix Vite dev server errors with type-only imports |\n| [deep-watch-numeric](rules/deep-watch-numeric.md) | MEDIUM | Enable efficient array mutation watching with Vue 3.5+ numeric deep |\n\n### Template Patterns\n\n| Rule | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| [vue-directive-comments](rules/vue-directive-comments.md) | HIGH | Control template type checking with @vue-ignore, @vue-skip directives |\n\n### SFC Patterns\n\n| Rule | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| [script-setup-jsdoc](rules/script-setup-jsdoc.md) | MEDIUM | Add JSDoc documentation to script setup components |\n\n### Vue Router\n\n| Rule | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| [vue-router-typed-params](rules/vue-router-typed-params.md) | MEDIUM | Fix route params type narrowing with unplugin-vue-router |\n\n### Testing Patterns\n\n| Rule | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| [teleport-testing](rules/teleport-testing.md) | HIGH | Test teleported content (modals, tooltips) |\n\n### TypeScript Patterns\n\n| Rule | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| [vueuse-emits-conflict](rules/vueuse-emits-conflict.md) | MEDIUM | Fix $emit type conflicts with VueUse element composables |\n\n---\n\n## Efficiency Rules\n\nRules that help AI solve problems more effectively and consistently.\n\n### Vite Configuration\n\n| Rule | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| [runtime-env-variables](rules/runtime-env-variables.md) | HIGH | Implement runtime environment variables for multi-env deployments |\n| [hmr-vue-ssr](rules/hmr-vue-ssr.md) | MEDIUM | Fix HMR issues in Vue SSR applications |\n\n### Component Patterns\n\n| Rule | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| [define-expose-types](rules/define-expose-types.md) | MEDIUM | Fix \"Property does not exist\" errors when accessing exposed methods |\n| [provide-inject-types](rules/provide-inject-types.md) | MEDIUM | Enable type-safe dependency injection with InjectionKey |\n\n### Vue Router\n\n| Rule | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| [route-meta-types](rules/route-meta-types.md) | HIGH | Extend RouteMeta interface for type-safe metadata |\n| [scroll-behavior-types](rules/scroll-behavior-types.md) | MEDIUM | Properly type scrollBehavior function |\n| [dynamic-routes-typing](rules/dynamic-routes-typing.md) | MEDIUM | Type-safe dynamic route configuration |\n\n### Testing Patterns\n\n| Rule | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| [suspense-testing](rules/suspense-testing.md) | HIGH | Test async components with Suspense properly |\n| [pinia-store-mocking](rules/pinia-store-mocking.md) | HIGH | Mock Pinia stores correctly with Vitest |\n| [router-mocking](rules/router-mocking.md) | HIGH | Mock Vue Router with useRoute and useRouter |\n| [vue-test-utils-types](rules/vue-test-utils-types.md) | MEDIUM | Fix wrapper.vm property access types in Vue Test Utils |\n\n### Composition API Patterns\n\n| Rule | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| [reactive-destructuring](rules/reactive-destructuring.md) | HIGH | Avoid reactivity loss when destructuring reactive objects |\n| [composable-cleanup](rules/composable-cleanup.md) | HIGH | Prevent memory leaks in composables with proper cleanup |\n| [ref-unwrapping](rules/ref-unwrapping.md) | MEDIUM | Understand ref auto-unwrapping in reactive objects |\n| [watcheffect-tracking](rules/watcheffect-tracking.md) | MEDIUM | Fix conditional dependency tracking in watchEffect |\n\n### SFC Patterns\n\n| Rule | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| [script-setup-patterns](rules/script-setup-patterns.md) | HIGH | Best practices for script setup syntax |\n| [css-v-bind](rules/css-v-bind.md) | MEDIUM | Safely use reactive values in CSS |\n\n### TypeScript Patterns\n\n| Rule | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| [component-type-helpers](rules/component-type-helpers.md) | HIGH | Extract component prop and emit types |\n| [event-handler-typing](rules/event-handler-typing.md) | MEDIUM | Type event handlers correctly |\n\n---\n\n## Reference\n\n- [Vue Language Tools](https://github.com/vuejs/language-tools)\n- [Vue 3 Documentation](https://vuejs.org/)\n- [Vite Documentation](https://vite.dev/)\n- [Vue Router](https://router.vuejs.org/)\n- [Vue Test Utils](https://test-utils.vuejs.org/)\n- [VueUse](https://vueuse.org/)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T06:41:08.811Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing expert Vue 3 development guidance and TypeScript configuration optimization.","zh":"非常适合需要Vue 3开发指导和TypeScript配置优化的前端代理","ja":"Vue 3の開発ガイダンスとTypeScriptの設定最適化が必要なフロントエンドエージェントに最適","ko":"Vue 3 개발 가이드와 TypeScript 설정 최적화가 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan orientación experta en desarrollo de Vue 3 y optimización de configuración de TypeScript.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin d''une guidance d''expert pour le développement de Vue 3 et l''optimisation de la configuration de TypeScript.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die eine Experten-Anleitung für die Entwicklung von Vue 3 und die Optimierung der TypeScript-Konfiguration benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam de orientação especializada em desenvolvimento Vue 3 e otimização de configuração do TypeScript.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходима экспертная помощь в разработке Vue 3 и оптимизации конфигурации TypeScript.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى إرشادات خبيرة في تطوير Vue 3 وتحسين تكوين TypeScript."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to develop scalable and maintainable Vue 3 applications with best practices for debugging and optimization using Vue Router, Vite, and Vitest, while leveraging TypeScript configuration and Composition API patterns.","zh":"赋予代理开发可扩展和可维护的Vue 3应用程序的能力，使用最佳实践进行调试和优化，利用Vue Router、Vite和Vitest，同时利用TypeScript配置和Composition API模式","ja":"Vue Router、Vite、Vitestを使用したデバッグと最適化のベストプラクティスを使用して、拡張可能で保守可能なVue 3アプリケーションを開発するエージェントの能力を与え、TypeScript設定とComposition APIパターンを活用","ko":"Vue Router, Vite, Vitest를 사용하여 디버깅과 최적화를 위한 최고의 관행을 사용하여 확장 가능하고 유지 보수 가능한 Vue 3 애플리케이션을 개발할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하며, TypeScript 설정과 Composition API 패턴을 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a desarrollar aplicaciones escalables y mantenibles de Vue 3 con las mejores prácticas para la depuración y la optimización utilizando Vue Router, Vite y Vitest, aprovechando los patrones de configuración de TypeScript y Composition API.","fr":"Permet aux agents de développer des applications Vue 3 évolutives et maintenables avec les meilleures pratiques pour le débogage et l''optimisation en utilisant Vue Router, Vite et Vitest, en exploitant les modèles de configuration de TypeScript et Composition API.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, skalierbare und wartbare Vue 3-Anwendungen mit den besten Praktiken für die Fehlerbehebung und Optimierung unter Verwendung von Vue Router, Vite und Vitest zu entwickeln, indem sie die Muster der TypeScript-Konfiguration und Composition API nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a desenvolver aplicações Vue 3 escaláveis e mantidas, com as melhores práticas para depuração e otimização usando Vue Router, Vite e Vitest, ao mesmo tempo em que aproveita os padrões de configuração do TypeScript e da Composition API.","ru":"Позволяет агентам разрабатывать масштабируемые и поддерживаемые приложения Vue 3, используя лучшие практики для отладки и оптимизации с помощью Vue Router, Vite и Vitest, а также использует шаблоны конфигурации TypeScript и Composition API.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تطوير تطبيقات Vue 3 قابلة للتطوير والصيانة، بما في ذلك أفضل الممارسات لتصحيح الأخطاء وتحسين الأداء باستخدام Vue Router و Vite و Vitest، مع الاستفادة من أنماط تكوين TypeScript و Composition API."},"useCases":{"en":["Configuring Vue 3 projects with TypeScript for optimal performance","Debugging type checking issues with vue-tsc and Volar","Implementing efficient component testing with Vitest and Vue Router typed routes"],"zh":["使用TypeScript配置Vue 3项目以实现最佳性能","使用vue-tsc和Volar调试类型检查问题","使用Vitest和Vue Router类型化路由实现高效的组件测试"],"ja":["TypeScript設定を使用してVue 3プロジェクトを最適なパフォーマンスで構成する","vue-tscとVolarを使用して型チェックの問題をデバッグする","VitestとVue Routerの型付きルートを使用して効率的なコンポーネントテストを実装する"],"ko":["TypeScript 설정을 사용하여 Vue 3 프로젝트를 최적의 성능으로 구성","vue-tsc와 Volar를 사용하여 타입 검사 문제를 디버깅","Vitest와 Vue Router 타입화된 경로를 사용하여 효율적인 컴포넌트 테스트를 구현"],"es":["Configuración de proyectos Vue 3 con TypeScript para un rendimiento óptimo","Depuración de problemas de comprobación de tipos con vue-tsc y Volar","Implementación de pruebas de componentes eficientes con Vitest y rutas tipadas de Vue Router"],"fr":["Configuration de projets Vue 3 avec TypeScript pour des performances optimales","Débogage des pr