Conception Mobile pour Outils d''IA","de":"Einrichtungsleitfaden für Mobiles Design für KI-Agents","pt":"Guia de Configuração de Design Móvel: Melhores Práticas p...","ru":"Настройка ИИ Агентов: Руководство по Мобильному Дизайну д...","ar":"دليل تصميم الهاتف المحمول: إرشادات لأفضل الممارسات"},"description":{"en":"Unlock mobile design potential with touch-first philosophy, platform-respectful approach, and offline capabilities. Get started with mobile-design today!","zh":"了解移动设计系统的核心原则和运行脚本，优化移动应用的用户体验","ja":"モバイルデザインシステムのコアプリンシプルとランタイムスクリプトを学び、モバイルアプリのユーザーエクスペリエンスを最適化する","ko":"모바일 디자인 시스템의 핵심 원칙과 런타임 스크립트를 알아보고 모바일 애플리케이션의 사용자 경험을 최적화하세요","es":"Aprende a configurar y optimizar el diseño móvil para agentes de IA con nuestra guía paso a paso y mejora la experiencia del usuario","fr":"Découvrez comment configurer et optimiser la conception mobile pour les outils d''IA avec notre guide étape par étape et améliorez l''expérience utilisateur","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie das mobile Design für KI-Agents konfigurieren und optimieren können, mit unserem Schritt-für-Schritt-Leitfaden und verbessern Sie die B...","pt":"Aprenda a criar designs móveis eficazes com nossa guia de configuração, incluindo validação de UX e execução de scripts em Python","ru":"Узнайте, как создать эффективный мобильный дизайн с нашей помощью, включая проверку UX и запуск скриптов на Python","ar":"تعلم كيفية إنشاء تصميمات الهاتف المحمول الفعالة باستخدام دليلنا الإرشادي، بما في ذلك التحقق من UX وتنفيذ البرامج النصية في Python"},"definition":{"en":"mobile-design is a development approach that prioritizes touch-first interactions, battery efficiency, and platform-specific design, enabling the creation of effective mobile applications","zh":"移动设计系统是一种为移动设备设计的用户界面设计方法","ja":"モバイルデザインシステムはモバイルデバイス向けのユーザーインターフェイス設計方法です","ko":"모바일 디자인 시스템은 모바일 디바イス를 위한 사용자 인터페이스 디자인 방법입니다","es":"El diseño móvil es un enfoque de diseño que prioriza la experiencia del usuario en dispositivos móviles","fr":"La conception mobile est une approche de design qui donne la priorité à l''expérience utilisateur sur les appareils mobiles","de":"Das mobile Design ist ein Designansatz, der die Benutzererfahrung auf mobilen Geräten priorisiert","pt":"Design móvel é uma filosofia de design que prioriza a experiência do usuário em dispositivos móveis","ru":"Мобильный дизайн - это философия дизайна, которая отдает приоритет опыту пользователя на мобильных устройствах","ar":"التصميم المحمول هو فلسفة تصميم تركز على تجربة المستخدم على أجهزة الهاتف المحمول"},"features":{"en":["Executes mobile UX and touch audits using scripts/mobile_audit.py","Validates mobile applications for platform-respectful design","Supports offline-capable mobile application development","Applies core principle that mobile is not a small desktop","Utilizes runtime scripts for validation and testing","Runs on Python using commands like python scripts/mobile_audit.py"],"zh":["基于Python的移动UX和触摸审计脚本","支持离线能力和平台尊重的设计","提供移动应用的用户体验优化方案","包含移动设计系统的核心原则和哲学","支持使用CLI运行脚本"],"ja":["PythonベースのモバイルUXとタッチオーディットスクリプト","オフライン可能性とプラットフォーム尊重の設計をサポート","モバイルアプリのユーザーエクスペリエンス最適化ソリューションを提供","モバイルデザインシステムのコアプリンシプルと哲学を含む","CLIでスクリプトを実行することをサポート"],"ko":["파이썬 기반 모바일 UX와 터치 오디트 스크립트","오프라인 가능성과 플랫폼 존중의 설계를 지원","모바일 애플리케이션의 사용자 경험 최적화 솔루션을 제공","모바일 디자인 시스템의 핵심 원칙과 철학을 포함","CLI에서 스크립트를 실행하는 것을 지원"],"es":["Filosofía de diseño touch-first","Validación de experiencia de usuario con scripts de Python","Optimización para dispositivos con batería limitada","Compatibilidad con plataformas móviles","Capacidad de funcionamiento sin conexión"],"fr":["Philosophie de conception touch-first","Validation de l''expérience utilisateur avec des scripts Python","Optimisation pour les appareils à batterie limitée","Compatibilité avec les plateformes mobiles","Capacité de fonctionnement hors ligne"],"de":["Design-Philosophie touch-first","Validierung der Benutzererfahrung mit Python-Skripten","Optimierung für Geräte mit begrenzter Batterieleistung","Kompatibilität mit mobilen Plattformen","Fähigkeit zur Offline-Funktionalität"],"pt":["Abordagem touch-first para design móvel","Validação de UX com scripts em Python","Execução de scripts para auditoria de design móvel","Foco em dispositivos móveis com restrições de plataforma","Desenvolvimento de designs offline-capable"],"ru":["Подход touch-first для мобильного дизайна","Проверка UX с помощью скриптов на Python","Запуск скриптов для аудита мобильного дизайна","Фокус на мобильных устройствах с ограничениями платформы","Разработка дизайнов с возможностью работы offline"],"ar":["نهج تعتمد على اللمس لتصميم الهاتف المحمول","التحقق من UX باستخدام البرامج النصية في Python","تنفيذ البرامج النصية لتدقيق تصميم الهاتف المحمول","التركيز على أجهزة الهاتف المحمول مع قيود منصة","تطوير تصميمات تعمل بدون اتصال بالإنترنت"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use mobile-design","what is mobile-design","mobile-design alternative","mobile-design vs responsive design","mobile-design install","mobile-design setup guide","touch-first design principles","platform-respectful mobile development","offline-capable mobile applications"],"zh":["移动设计系统","AIエージェント","移动UX","触摸审计","Python脚本","离线能力","平台尊重","移动应用设计"],"ja":["モバイルデザインシステム","AIエージェント","モバイルUX","タッチオーディット","Pythonスクリプト","オフライン可能性","プラットフォーム尊重","モバイルアプリ設計"],"ko":["모바일 디자인 시스템","AI 에이전트","모바일 UX","터치 오디트","파이썬 스크립트","오프라인 가능성","플랫폼 존중","모바일 애플리케이션 디자인"],"es":["diseño móvil para agentes de IA","configuración de diseño móvil","mejora de la experiencia del usuario","optimización de la batería","compatibilidad con plataformas móviles","desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles","python para diseño móvil","herramientas de diseño móvil"],"fr":["conception mobile pour outils d''IA","configuration de la conception mobile","amélioration de l''expérience utilisateur","optimisation de la batterie","compatibilité avec les plateformes mobiles","développement d''applications mobiles","python pour la conception mobile","outils de conception mobile"],"de":["mobiles Design für KI-Agents","Einrichtung des mobilen Designs","Verbesserung der Benutzererfahrung","Optimierung der Batterieleistung","Kompatibilität mit mobilen Plattformen","Entwicklung von mobilen Anwendungen","python für mobiles Design","Werkzeuge für mobiles Design"],"pt":["design móvel","desenvolvimento de aplicativos móveis","ux design","python para design móvel","auditoria de design móvel","desenvolvimento de designs offline","ferramentas de design móvel","melhores práticas de design móvel"],"ru":["мобильный дизайн","разработка мобильных приложений","ux дизайн","python для мобильного дизайна","аудит мобильного дизайна","разработка дизайнов с возможностью работы offline","инструменты мобильного дизайна","лучшие практики мобильного дизайна","ИИ Агенты для дизайна"],"ar":["تصميم الهاتف المحمول","تطوير تطبيقات الهاتف المحمول","ux تصميم","python لتصميم الهاتف المحمول","تدقيق تصميم الهاتف المحمول","تطوير تصميمات تعمل بدون اتصال بالإنترنت","أدوات تصميم الهاتف المحمول","أفضل الممارسات لتصميم الهاتف المحمول","أدوات ذكاء اصطناعي لتصميم الهاتف المحمول"]}},"owner":"apptolast","repo":"FamilyFilmApp","repoPath":"apptolast/FamilyFilmApp","stars":10,"forks":1,"updatedAt":"2026-02-21T19:16:28Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"mobile-design","description":"Mobile-first design thinking and decision-making for iOS and Android apps. Touch interaction, performance patterns, platform conventions. Teaches principles, not fixed values. Use when building React Native, Flutter, or native mobile apps.","bodyPreview":"# Mobile Design System\n\n> **Philosophy:** Touch-first. Battery-conscious. Platform-respectful. Offline-capable.\n> **Core Principle:** Mobile is NOT a small desktop. THINK mobile constraints, ASK platform choice.\n\n---\n\n## 🔧 Runtime Scripts\n\n**Execute these for validation (don''t read, just run):**\n\n| Script | Purpose | Usage |\n|--------|---------|-------|\n| `scripts/mobile_audit.py` | Mobile UX & Touch Audit | `python scripts/mobile_audit.py <project_path>` |\n\n---\n\n## 🔴 MANDATORY: Read Reference","body":"# Mobile Design System\n\n> **Philosophy:** Touch-first. Battery-conscious. Platform-respectful. Offline-capable.\n> **Core Principle:** Mobile is NOT a small desktop. THINK mobile constraints, ASK platform choice.\n\n---\n\n## 🔧 Runtime Scripts\n\n**Execute these for validation (don''t read, just run):**\n\n| Script | Purpose | Usage |\n|--------|---------|-------|\n| `scripts/mobile_audit.py` | Mobile UX & Touch Audit | `python scripts/mobile_audit.py <project_path>` |\n\n---\n\n## 🔴 MANDATORY: Read Reference Files Before Working!\n\n**⛔ DO NOT start development until you read the relevant files:**\n\n### Universal (Always Read)\n\n| File | Content | Status |\n|------|---------|--------|\n| **[mobile-design-thinking.md](mobile-design-thinking.md)** | **⚠️ ANTI-MEMORIZATION: Forces thinking, prevents AI defaults** | **⬜ CRITICAL FIRST** |\n| **[touch-psychology.md](touch-psychology.md)** | **Fitts'' Law, gestures, haptics, thumb zone** | **⬜ CRITICAL** |\n| **[mobile-performance.md](mobile-performance.md)** | **RN/Flutter performance, 60fps, memory** | **⬜ CRITICAL** |\n| **[mobile-backend.md](mobile-backend.md)** | **Push notifications, offline sync, mobile API** | **⬜ CRITICAL** |\n| **[mobile-testing.md](mobile-testing.md)** | **Testing pyramid, E2E, platform-specific** | **⬜ CRITICAL** |\n| **[mobile-debugging.md](mobile-debugging.md)** | **Native vs JS debugging, Flipper, Logcat** | **⬜ CRITICAL** |\n| [mobile-navigation.md](mobile-navigation.md) | Tab/Stack/Drawer, deep linking | ⬜ Read |\n| [mobile-typography.md](mobile-typography.md) | System fonts, Dynamic Type, a11y | ⬜ Read |\n| [mobile-color-system.md](mobile-color-system.md) | OLED, dark mode, battery-aware | ⬜ Read |\n| [decision-trees.md](decision-trees.md) | Framework/state/storage selection | ⬜ Read |\n\n> 🧠 **mobile-design-thinking.md is PRIORITY!** This file ensures AI thinks instead of using memorized patterns.\n\n### Platform-Specific (Read Based on Target)\n\n| Platform | File | Content | When to Read |\n|----------|------|---------|--------------|\n| **iOS** | [platform-ios.md](platform-ios.md) | Human Interface Guidelines, SF Pro, SwiftUI patterns | Building for iPhone/iPad |\n| **Android** | [platform-android.md](platform-android.md) | Material Design 3, Roboto, Compose patterns | Building for Android |\n| **Cross-Platform** | Both above | Platform divergence points | React Native / Flutter |\n\n> 🔴 **If building for iOS → Read platform-ios.md FIRST!**\n> 🔴 **If building for Android → Read platform-android.md FIRST!**\n> 🔴 **If cross-platform → Read BOTH and apply conditional platform logic!**\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ CRITICAL: ASK BEFORE ASSUMING (MANDATORY)\n\n> **STOP! If the user''s request is open-ended, DO NOT default to your favorites.**\n\n### You MUST Ask If Not Specified:\n\n| Aspect | Ask | Why |\n|--------|-----|-----|\n| **Platform** | \"iOS, Android, or both?\" | Affects EVERY design decision |\n| **Framework** | \"React Native, Flutter, or native?\" | Determines patterns and tools |\n| **Navigation** | \"Tab bar, drawer, or stack-based?\" | Core UX decision |\n| **State** | \"What state management? (Zustand/Redux/Riverpod/BLoC?)\" | Architecture foundation |\n| **Offline** | \"Does this need to work offline?\" | Affects data strategy |\n| **Target devices** | \"Phone only, or tablet support?\" | Layout complexity |\n\n### ⛔ AI MOBILE ANTI-PATTERNS (YASAK LİSTESİ)\n\n> 🚫 **These are AI default tendencies that MUST be avoided!**\n\n#### Performance Sins\n\n| ❌ NEVER DO | Why It''s Wrong | ✅ ALWAYS DO |\n|-------------|----------------|--------------|\n| **ScrollView for long lists** | Renders ALL items, memory explodes | Use `FlatList` / `FlashList` / `ListView.builder` |\n| **Inline renderItem function** | New function every render, all items re-render | `useCallback` + `React.memo` |\n| **Missing keyExtractor** | Index-based keys cause bugs on reorder | Unique, stable ID from data |\n| **Skip getItemLayout** | Async layout = janky scroll | Provide when items have fixed height |\n| **setState() everywhere** | Unnecessary widget rebuilds | Targeted state, `const` constructors |\n| **Native driver: false** | Animations blocked by JS thread | `useNativeDriver: true` always |\n| **console.log in production** | Blocks JS thread severely | Remove before release build |\n| **Skip React.memo/const** | Every item re-renders on any change | Memoize list items ALWAYS |\n\n#### Touch/UX Sins\n\n| ❌ NEVER DO | Why It''s Wrong | ✅ ALWAYS DO |\n|-------------|----------------|--------------|\n| **Touch target < 44px** | Impossible to tap accurately, frustrating | Minimum 44pt (iOS) / 48dp (Android) |\n| **Spacing < 8px between targets** | Accidental taps on neighbors | Minimum 8-12px gap |\n| **Gesture-only interactions** | Motor impaired users excluded | Always provide button alternative |\n| **No loading state** | User thinks app crashed | ALWAYS show loading feedback |\n| **No error state** | User stuck, no recovery path | Show error with retry option |\n| **No offline handling** | Crash/block when network lost | Graceful degradation, cached data |\n| **Ignore platform conventions** | Users confused, muscle memory broken | iOS feels iOS, Android feels Android |\n\n#### Security Sins\n\n| ❌ NEVER DO | Why It''s Wrong | ✅ ALWAYS DO |\n|-------------|----------------|--------------|\n| **Token in AsyncStorage** | Easily accessible, stolen on rooted device | `SecureStore` / `Keychain` / `EncryptedSharedPreferences` |\n| **Hardcode API keys** | Reverse engineered from APK/IPA | Environment variables, secure storage |\n| **Skip SSL pinning** | MITM attacks possible | Pin certificates in production |\n| **Log sensitive data** | Logs can be extracted | Never log tokens, passwords, PII |\n\n#### Architecture Sins\n\n| ❌ NEVER DO | Why It''s Wrong | ✅ ALWAYS DO |\n|-------------|----------------|--------------|\n| **Business logic in UI** | Untestable, unmaintainable | Service layer separation |\n| **Global state for everything** | Unnecessary re-renders, complexity | Local state default, lift when needed |\n| **Deep linking as afterthought** | Notifications, shares broken | Plan deep links from day one |\n| **Skip dispose/cleanup** | Memory leaks, zombie listeners | Clean up subscriptions, timers |\n\n---\n\n## 📱 Platform Decision Matrix\n\n### When to Unify vs Diverge\n\n```\n                    UNIFY (same on both)          DIVERGE (platform-specific)\n                    ───────────────────           ──────────────────────────\nBusiness Logic      ✅ Always                     -\nData Layer          ✅ Always                     -\nCore Features       ✅ Always                     -\n                    \nNavigation          -                             ✅ iOS: edge swipe, Android: back button\nGestures            -                             ✅ Platform-native feel\nIcons               -                             ✅ SF Symbols vs Material Icons\nDate Pickers        -                             ✅ Native pickers feel right\nModals/Sheets       -                             ✅ iOS: bottom sheet vs Android: dialog\nTypography          -                             ✅ SF Pro vs Roboto (or custom)\nError Dialogs       -                             ✅ Platform conventions for alerts\n```\n\n### Quick Reference: Platform Defaults\n\n| Element | iOS | Android |\n|---------|-----|---------|\n| **Primary Font** | SF Pro / SF Compact | Roboto |\n| **Min Touch Target** | 44pt × 44pt | 48dp × 48dp |\n| **Back Navigation** | Edge swipe left | System back button/gesture |\n| **Bottom Tab Icons** | SF Symbols | Material Symbols |\n| **Action Sheet** | UIActionSheet from bottom | Bottom Sheet / Dialog |\n| **Progress** | Spinner | Linear progress (Material) |\n| **Pull to Refresh** | Native UIRefreshControl | SwipeRefreshLayout |\n\n---\n\n## 🧠 Mobile UX Psychology (Quick Reference)\n\n### Fitts'' Law for Touch\n\n```\nDesktop: Cursor is precise (1px)\nMobile:  Finger is imprecise (~7mm contact area)\n\n→ Touch targets MUST be 44-48px minimum\n→ Important actions in THUMB ZONE (bottom of screen)\n→ Destructive actions AWAY from easy reach\n```\n\n### Thumb Zone (One-Handed Usage)\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────┐\n│      HARD TO REACH          │ ← Navigation, menu, back\n│        (stretch)            │\n├─────────────────────────────┤\n│      OK TO REACH            │ ← Secondary actions\n│       (natural)             │\n├─────────────────────────────┤\n│      EASY TO REACH          │ ← PRIMARY CTAs, tab bar\n│    (thumb''s natural arc)    │ ← Main content interaction\n└─────────────────────────────┘\n        [  HOME  ]\n```\n\n### Mobile-Specific Cognitive Load\n\n| Desktop | Mobile Difference |\n|---------|-------------------|\n| Multiple windows | ONE task at a time |\n| Keyboard shortcuts | Touch gestures |\n| Hover states | NO hover (tap or nothing) |\n| Large viewport | Limited space, scroll vertical |\n| Stable attention | Interrupted constantly |\n\nFor deep dive: [touch-psychology.md](touch-psychology.md)\n\n---\n\n## ⚡ Performance Principles (Quick Reference)\n\n### React Native Critical Rules\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ CORRECT: Memoized renderItem + React.memo wrapper\nconst ListItem = React.memo(({ item }: { item: Item }) => (\n  <View style={styles.item}>\n    <Text>{item.title}</Text>\n  </View>\n));\n\nconst renderItem = useCallback(\n  ({ item }: { item: Item }) => <ListItem item={item} />,\n  []\n);\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: FlatList with all optimizations\n<FlatList\n  data={items}\n  renderItem={renderItem}\n  keyExtractor={(item) => item.id}  // Stable ID, NOT index\n  getItemLayout={(data, index) => ({\n    length: ITEM_HEIGHT,\n    offset: ITEM_HEIGHT * index,\n    index,\n  })}\n  removeClippedSubviews={true}\n  maxToRenderPerBatch={10}\n  windowSize={5}\n/>\n```\n\n### Flutter Critical Rules\n\n```dart\n// ✅ CORRECT: const constructors prevent rebuilds\nclass MyWidget extends StatelessWidget {\n  const MyWidget({super.key}); // CONST!\n\n  @override\n  Widget build(BuildContext context) {\n    return const Column( // CONST!\n      children: [\n        Text(''Static content''),\n        MyConstantWidget(),\n      ],\n    );\n  }\n}\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: Targeted state with ValueListenableBuilder\nValueListenableBuilder<int>(\n  valueListenable: counter,\n  builder: (context, value, child) => Text(''$value''),\n  child: const ExpensiveWidget(), // Won''t rebuild!\n)\n```\n\n### Animation Performance\n\n```\nGPU-accelerated (FAST):     CPU-bound (SLOW):\n├── transform               ├── width, height\n├── opacity                 ├── top, left, right, bottom\n└── (use these ONLY)        ├── margin, padding\n                            └── (AVOID animating these)\n```\n\nFor complete guide: [mobile-performance.md](mobile-performance.md)\n\n---\n\n## 📝 CHECKPOINT (MANDATORY Before Any Mobile Work)\n\n> **Before writing ANY mobile code, you MUST complete this checkpoint:**\n\n```\n🧠 CHECKPOINT:\n\nPlatform:   [ iOS / Android / Both ]\nFramework:  [ React Native / Flutter / SwiftUI / Kotlin ]\nFiles Read: [ List the skill files you''ve read ]\n\n3 Principles I Will Apply:\n1. _______________\n2. _______________\n3. _______________\n\nAnti-Patterns I Will Avoid:\n1. _______________\n2. _______________\n```\n\n**Example:**\n```\n🧠 CHECKPOINT:\n\nPlatform:   iOS + Android (Cross-platform)\nFramework:  React Native + Expo\nFiles Read: touch-psychology.md, mobile-performance.md, platform-ios.md, platform-android.md\n\n3 Principles I Will Apply:\n1. FlatList with React.memo + useCallback for all lists\n2. 48px touch targets, thumb zone for primary CTAs\n3. Platform-specific navigation (edge swipe iOS, back button Android)\n\nAnti-Patterns I Will Avoid:\n1. ScrollView for lists → FlatList\n2. Inline renderItem → Memoized\n3. AsyncStorage for tokens → SecureStore\n```\n\n> 🔴 **Can''t fill the checkpoint? → GO BACK AND READ THE SKILL FILES.**\n\n---\n\n## 🔧 Framework Decision Tree\n\n```\nWHAT ARE YOU BUILDING?\n        │\n        ├── Need OTA updates + rapid iteration + web team\n        │   └── ✅ React Native + Expo\n        │\n        ├── Need pixel-perfect custom UI + performance critical\n        │   └── ✅ Flutter\n        │\n        ├── Deep native features + single platform focus\n        │   ├── iOS only → SwiftUI\n        │   └── Android only → Kotlin + Jetpack Compose\n        │\n        ├── Existing RN codebase + new features\n        │   └── ✅ React Native (bare workflow)\n        │\n        └── Enterprise + existing Flutter codebase\n            └── ✅ Flutter\n```\n\nFor complete decision trees: [decision-trees.md](decision-trees.md)\n\n---\n\n## 📋 Pre-Development Checklist\n\n### Before Starting ANY Mobile Project\n\n- [ ] **Platform confirmed?** (iOS / Android / Both)\n- [ ] **Framework chosen?** (RN / Flutter / Native)\n- [ ] **Navigation pattern decided?** (Tabs / Stack / Drawer)\n- [ ] **State management selected?** (Zustand / Redux / Riverpod / BLoC)\n- [ ] **Offline requirements known?**\n- [ ] **Deep linking planned from day one?**\n- [ ] **Target devices defined?** (Phone / Tablet / Both)\n\n### Before Every Screen\n\n- [ ] **Touch targets ≥ 44-48px?**\n- [ ] **Primary CTA in thumb zone?**\n- [ ] **Loading state exists?**\n- [ ] **Error state with retry exists?**\n- [ ] **Offline handling considered?**\n- [ ] **Platform conventions followed?**\n\n### Before Release\n\n- [ ] **console.log removed?**\n- [ ] **SecureStore for sensitive data?**\n- [ ] **SSL pinning enabled?**\n- [ ] **Lists optimized (memo, keyExtractor)?**\n- [ ] **Memory cleanup on unmount?**\n- [ ] **Tested on low-end devices?**\n- [ ] **Accessibility labels on all interactive elements?**\n\n---\n\n## 📚 Reference Files\n\nFor deeper guidance on specific areas:\n\n| File | When to Use |\n|------|-------------|\n| [mobile-design-thinking.md](mobile-design-thinking.md) | **FIRST! Anti-memorization, forces context-based thinking** |\n| [touch-psychology.md](touch-psychology.md) | Understanding touch interaction, Fitts'' Law, gesture design |\n| [mobile-performance.md](mobile-performance.md) | Optimizing RN/Flutter, 60fps, memory/battery |\n| [platform-ios.md](platform-ios.md) | iOS-specific design, HIG compliance |\n| [platform-android.md](platform-android.md) | Android-specific design, Material Design 3 |\n| [mobile-navigation.md](mobile-navigation.md) | Navigation patterns, deep linking |\n| [mobile-typography.md](mobile-typography.md) | Type scale, system fonts, accessibility |\n| [mobile-color-system.md](mobile-color-system.md) | OLED optimization, dark mode, battery |\n| [decision-trees.md](decision-trees.md) | Framework, state, storage decisions |\n\n---\n\n> **Remember:** Mobile users are impatient, interrupted, and using imprecise fingers on small screens. Design for the WORST conditions: bad network, one hand, bright sun, low battery. If it works there, it works everywhere.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T01:51:20.815Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Interface Agents needing to design touch-first, battery-conscious, and platform-respectful mobile applications.","zh":"非常适合需要设计面向触摸、节能和尊重平台的移动应用程序的接口代理。","ja":"タッチ優先、バッテリー意識、プラットフォームに配慮したモバイルアプリケーションを設計する必要があるインターフェイスエージェントに最適です。","ko":"터치 우선, 배터리意识, 플랫폼을尊重하는 모바일 애플리케이션을 설계하는 인터페이스 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Interfaz que necesitan diseñar aplicaciones móviles orientadas a la pantalla táctil, conscientes de la batería y respetuosas con la plataforma.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Interface ayant besoin de concevoir des applications mobiles tactiles, économes en batterie et respectueuses de la plateforme.","de":"Perfekt für Interface-Agents, die touch-first-, batteriebewusste und plattformrespektierende mobile Anwendungen entwerfen müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Interface que precisam projetar aplicações móveis touch-first, conscientes da bateria e respeitosas com a plataforma.","ru":"Идеально для Интерфейсных Агентов, которым необходимо разрабатывать сенсорные, экономящие батарею и уважающие платформу мобильные приложения.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الواجهة الذين يحتاجون إلى تصميم تطبيقات الهاتف المحمول التي تعمل باللمس أولاً ، وتهدف إلى توفير الطاقة ، والاحترام للمنصة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create mobile interfaces with offline capabilities, respecting platform choices and considering mobile constraints, utilizing runtime scripts like mobile_audit.py for validation.","zh":"赋予代理创建具有离线功能的移动接口的能力，尊重平台选择并考虑移动约束，利用运行时脚本如mobile_audit.py进行验证。","ja":"エージェントがオフライン機能を備えたモバイルインターフェイスを作成できるようにし、プラットフォームの選択を尊重し、モバイルの制約を考慮し、mobile_audit.pyのようなランタイムスクリプトを使用して検証します。","ko":"에이전트가 오프라인 기능을 갖춘 모바일 인터페이스를 생성할 수 있도록 하며, 플랫폼 선택을尊重하고 모바일 제약을 고려하며, mobile_audit.py와 같은 런타임 스크립트를 사용하여 검증합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear interfaces móviles con capacidades sin conexión, respetando las opciones de plataforma y considerando las limitaciones móviles, utilizando scripts de tiempo de ejecución como mobile_audit.py para la validación.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des interfaces mobiles avec des capacités hors ligne, en respectant les choix de plateforme et en considérant les contraintes mobiles, en utilisant des scripts d''exécution tels que mobile_audit.py pour la validation.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, mobile Schnittstellen mit Offline-Fähigkeiten zu erstellen, die Plattformauswahl respektieren und mobile Einschränkungen berücksichtigen, wobei Laufzeit-Skripte wie mobile_audit.py für die Validierung verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar interfaces móveis com capacidades offline, respeitando as escolhas de plataforma e considerando as restrições móveis, utilizando scripts de tempo de execução como mobile_audit.py para validação.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать мобильные интерфейсы с возможностями offline, уважая выбор платформы и учитывая мобильные ограничения, используя скрипты runtime, такие как mobile_audit.py, для проверки.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إنشاء واجهات الهاتف المحمول مع القدرات في وضع عدم الاتصال ، واحترام خيارات المنصة ومراعاة قيود الهاتف المحمول ، باستخدام سكريبتات وقت التشغيل مثل mobile_audit.py للتحقق."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing touch-first mobile interfaces","Developing battery-conscious mobile applications","Validating mobile UX and touch capabilities using scripts like mobile_audit.py"],"zh":["设计面向触摸的移动接口","开发节能的移动应用程序","使用mobile_audit.py等脚本验证移动UX和触摸功能"],"ja":["タッチ優先のモバイルインターフェイスを設計する","バッテリー意識のあるモバイルアプリケーションを開発する","mobile_audit.pyのようなスクリプトを使用してモバイルUXとタッチ機能を検証する"],"ko":["터치 우선 모바일 인터페이스를 설계한다","배터리意识 있는 모바일 애플리케이션을 개발한다","mobile_audit.py와 같은 스크립트를 사용하여 모바일 UX 및 터치 기능을 검증한다"],"es":["Diseñar interfaces móviles táctiles","Desarrollar aplicaciones móviles conscientes de la batería","Validar la experiencia del usuario móvil y las capacidades táctiles mediante scripts como mobile_audit.py"],"fr":["Concevoir des interfaces mobiles tactiles","Développer des applications mobiles économes en batterie","Valider l''expérience utilisateur mobile et les capacités tactiles à l''aide de scripts tels que mobile_audit.py"],"de":["Entwerfen von touch-first-mobilen Schnittstellen","Entwickeln von batteriebewussten mobilen Anwendungen","Validieren der mobilen Benutzeroberfläche und der Touch-Fähigkeiten mithilfe von Skripten wie mobile_audit.py"],"pt":["Projeto de interfaces móveis touch-first","Desenvolvimento de aplicações móveis conscientes da bateria","Validação da experiência do usuário móvel e capacidades de toque usando scripts como mobile_audit.py"],"ru":["Разработка сенсорных мобильных интерфейсов","Создание мобильных приложений, экономящих батарею","Проверка мобильного UX и сенсорных возможностей с помощью скриптов, таких как mobile_audit.py"],"ar":["تصميم واجهات الهاتف المحمول التي تعمل باللمس أولاً","تطوير تطبيقات الهاتف المحمول التي تهدف إلى توفير الطاقة","التحقق من تجربة المستخدم المتنقلة وقدرات اللمس باستخدام السكريبتات مثل mobile_audit.py"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires consideration of mobile constraints","Platform choice must be respected","Offline capability implementation needed"],"zh":["需要考虑移动约束","必须尊重平台选择","需要实现离线功能"],"ja":["モバイルの制約を考慮する必要がある","プラットフォームの選択を尊重する必要がある","オフライン機能の実装が必要"],"ko":["모바일 제약을 고려해야 한다","플랫폼 선택을尊重해야 한다","오프라인 기능 구현이 필요하다"],"es":["Requiere la consideración de las limitaciones móviles","La elección de plataforma debe ser respetada","Se necesita la implementación de la capacidad sin conexión"],"fr":["Nécessite la prise en compte des contraintes mobiles","Le choix de plateforme doit être respecté","La mise en œuvre de la fonctionnalité hors ligne est nécessaire"],"de":["Erfordert die Berücksichtigung mobiler Einschränkungen","Die Plattformauswahl muss respektiert werden","Die Implementierung der Offline-Funktion ist erforderlich"],"pt":["Exige consideração das restrições móveis","A escolha da plataforma deve ser respeitada","Implementação da capacidade offline necessária"],"ru":["Требует учета мобильных ограничений","Выбор платформы должен быть уважен","Необходимо реализовать возможность offline"],"ar":["يتطلب مراعاة قيود الهاتف المحمول","يجب احترام اختيار المنصة","يحتاج إلى تنفيذ القدرة في وضع عدم الاتصال"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"ec74cda5e1954572e4282c3aaa9c1c32ec743cef83c53f8aef622c00dc8f0682","qualityScore":42}');
