tf）的更新"],"es":["Implementación de lógica de módulos en archivos root","Actualización de módulos secundarios como application y group","Actualización de interfaces de módulos como variables.tf","Compatibilidad con Terraform para la creación de entornos automatizados en Azure","Soporte para la creación de entornos seguros y escalables"],"fr":["Implémentation de la logique de modules dans les fichiers root","Mise à jour des sous-modules tels que application et group","Mise à jour des interfaces de modules comme variables.tf","Compatibilité avec Terraform pour la création d''environnements automatisés sur Azure","Prise en charge de la création d''environnements sécurisés et évolutifs"],"de":["Implementierung von Modullogik in Root-Dateien","Aktualisierung von Untermodulen wie application und group","Aktualisierung von Modulschnittstellen wie variables.tf","Kompatibilität mit Terraform für die Erstellung automatisierter Umgebungen in Azure","Unterstützung für die Erstellung sicherer und skalierbarer Umgebungen"],"pt":["Criação de ambientes seguros e automatizados no Azure","Alteração do comportamento em arquivos de módulo raiz","Atualização de módulos filhos, incluindo application, group e user_assigned_identity","Atualização de interfaces de módulo, incluindo variables.tf","Implementação de lógica de módulo para trabalhar com o Terraform"],"ru":["Создание безопасных и автоматизированных сред в Azure","Изменение поведения в корневых файлах модуля","Обновление дочерних модулей, включая application, group и user_assigned_identity","Обновление интерфейсов модуля, включая variables.tf","Реализация логики модуля для работы с Terraform"],"ar":["إنشاء بيئات آمنة وآلية في Azure","تحديث سلوك الملفات الرئيسية للموديل","تحديث الموديلات الفرعية، بما في ذلك application و group و user_assigned_identity","تحديث واجهات الموديل، بما في ذلك variables.tf","تنفيذ منطق الموديل للعمل مع Terraform"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use terraform-station-module","terraform-station-module vs terraform-station-test","terraform-station-module install","update azure station module variables.tf","what is the station module application/ child module","terraform-station-module setup guide","station module hashicorp tfe configuration","automate azure workloads with terraform"],"zh":["Terraform Station模块","Azure环境自动化","模块代码更改","模块测试执行","根模块文件","子模块更新","模块接口更新","AIエージェント","Terraform"],"ja":["Terraform Stationモジュール","Azure環境自動化","モジュールコードの変更","モジュールテストの実行","ルートモジュールファイル","サブモジュールの更新","モジュールインターフェースの更新","AIエージェント","Terraform"],"ko":["Terraform Station 모듈","Azure 환경 자동화","모듈 코드 변경","모듈 테스트 실행","루트 모듈 파일","서브 모듈 업데이트","모듈 인터페이스 업데이트","AI 에이전트","Terraform"],"es":["terraform-station-module","entornos automatizados en Azure","implementación de lógica de módulos","actualización de módulos secundarios","Terraform en Azure","creación de entornos seguros","escalabilidad en Azure","herramientas de AI para la automatización"],"fr":["terraform-station-module","environnements automatisés sur Azure","implémentation de la logique de modules","mise à jour des sous-modules","Terraform sur Azure","création d''environnements sécurisés","évolution sur Azure","outils d''IA pour l''automatisation"],"de":["terraform-station-module","automatisierte Umgebungen in Azure","Implementierung von Modullogik","Aktualisierung von Untermodulen","Terraform in Azure","Erstellung sicherer Umgebungen","Skalierbarkeit in Azure","AI-Tools für die Automatisierung"],"pt":["Terraform Station","Módulo Terraform","Ambientes seguros no Azure","Automação de ambientes","Terraform no Azure","Módulos de Terraform","Lógica de módulo Terraform","Interfaces de módulo Terraform"],"ru":["Terraform Station","Модуль Terraform","Безопасные среды в Azure","Автоматизация сред","Terraform в Azure","Модули Terraform","Логика модуля Terraform","Интерфейсы модуля Terraform"],"ar":["Terraform Station","موديل Terraform","بيئات آمنة في Azure","آلية بيئات","Terraform في Azure","موديلات Terraform","منطق موديل Terraform","واجهات موديل Terraform"]}},"owner":"blinqas","repo":"station","repoPath":"blinqas/station","stars":9,"forks":1,"updatedAt":"2026-02-27T11:40:30Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"terraform-station-module","description":"Maintain the Station Terraform module itself (not test authoring). Use this skill whenever the user asks to add, change, refactor, or troubleshoot Station module behavior in root *.tf files or child module folders (application/, group/, user_assigned_identity/, hashicorp/tfe/), update variables/outputs/validations, or adjust provider/resource wiring for module consumers.","bodyPreview":"# Terraform Station Module Skill\n\nUse this skill when working on Station module implementation logic.\n\nThis skill is for **module code changes**. For Terraform test authoring/execution in `tests/*.tftest.hcl`, use `terraform-station-test`.\n\n## What this skill covers\n\n- Adding/changing behavior in root module files (`*.tf` at repo root)\n- Updating child modules:\n  - `application/`\n  - `group/`\n  - `user_assigned_identity/`\n  - `hashicorp/tfe/`\n- Updating module interfaces:\n  - `variables.tf`\n  -","body":"# Terraform Station Module Skill\n\nUse this skill when working on Station module implementation logic.\n\nThis skill is for **module code changes**. For Terraform test authoring/execution in `tests/*.tftest.hcl`, use `terraform-station-test`.\n\n## What this skill covers\n\n- Adding/changing behavior in root module files (`*.tf` at repo root)\n- Updating child modules:\n  - `application/`\n  - `group/`\n  - `user_assigned_identity/`\n  - `hashicorp/tfe/`\n- Updating module interfaces:\n  - `variables.tf`\n  - `variables.applications.tf`\n  - `variables.identity.tf`\n  - `outputs.tf`\n- Keeping Station compatible as a **called module** (consumer-facing contract)\n- Updating documentation where interface/behavior changes\n\n## Station module invariants\n\n1. Treat Station as a module consumed by parent configurations.\n2. Preserve backward compatibility unless the user explicitly requests a breaking change.\n3. Keep variable schemas, validation rules, and defaults aligned with actual implementation.\n4. Keep outputs aligned with resources and child module wiring.\n5. Prefer extending existing patterns over introducing new structure.\n6. Keep changes focused and minimal.\n\n## Required discovery before changing code\n\nAlways inspect these first for impact analysis:\n\n- `variables.tf`\n- `variables.applications.tf`\n- `variables.identity.tf`\n- `outputs.tf`\n- relevant feature files (for example `applications.tf`, `groups.tf`, `connectivity.tf`, `tfe.tf`)\n- relevant child module `variables.tf` and `outputs.tf`\n\nThen map your change to:\n\n- inputs consumed\n- resources/data affected\n- outputs exposed\n- tests likely impacted\n\n## Implementation workflow\n\n1. Locate feature entry points in root module files.\n2. Identify whether behavior belongs in root module or child module.\n3. Update variable definitions/validations if interface changed.\n4. Update implementation (`resource`, `data`, `locals`, `module` calls).\n5. Update outputs if exposed behavior changed.\n6. Update docs/examples if user-visible behavior changed.\n7. Run formatting.\n8. Run relevant tests (or hand off to `terraform-station-test` flow).\n\n## Validation and formatting rules\n\n- Run:\n\n```bash\nterraform fmt -recursive\n```\n\n- Do **not** rely on `terraform validate` for this repository due provider alias/module limitations.\n\n- Prefer targeted Terraform tests for affected feature areas:\n  - `tests/application.tftest.hcl`\n  - `tests/group.tftest.hcl`\n  - `tests/tfe.tftest.hcl`\n  - `tests/connectivity.tftest.hcl`\n  - `tests/identity.tftest.hcl`\n  - `tests/user_assigned_identities.tftest.hcl`\n\n## Compatibility checklist for module changes\n\nBefore finishing a change, verify:\n\n- Input object shape matches actual references in code\n- Optional fields are guarded with `try(...)`, `lookup(...)`, `coalesce(...)`, or conditional logic where needed\n- Validation error messages still describe the true constraint\n- Resource naming/location/tag defaults still follow Station conventions\n- Identity and role-assignment side effects remain correct for enabled feature blocks\n- Outputs still reference valid resource/module attributes\n\n## Common Station-specific pitfalls\n\n- Adding new required fields to existing input objects without defaults\n- Changing map keys that tests/consumers depend on\n- Forgetting to propagate variable changes into child modules\n- Breaking app/group/identity auto-assignment behavior\n- Updating logic but not adjusting outputs/docs\n\n## CI-aware change planning\n\nStation uses selective test execution in CI.\n\nWhen changing module files, anticipate which tests are triggered using:\n\n- `.github/scripts/README.md`\n- `.github/workflows/terraform.yaml`\n\nIf core/shared files are touched, expect full-suite runs.\n\n## Use with testing skill\n\nAfter module edits:\n\n1. format with `terraform fmt -recursive`\n2. invoke `terraform-station-test` for test updates/execution\n3. ensure feature tests cover minimum + maximum scenarios when behavior changed\n\n## Done criteria for module tasks\n\n- Code change implemented at correct module boundary\n- Variable/validation/output updates included where needed\n- Formatting completed\n- Relevant tests run (or explicitly delegated)\n- No unrelated refactors bundled into the change\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T06:48:16.793Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Infrastructure Agents requiring advanced Terraform module management for Azure environments.","zh":"适用于需要高级Terraform模块管理的Azure基础设施代理的理想选择。","ja":"Azure環境向けに高度なTerraformモジュール管理を必要とするインフラストラクチャエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Azure 환경을 위한 고급 Terraform 모듈 관리가 필요한 인프라 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Infraestructura que requieren una gestión avanzada de módulos de Terraform para entornos de Azure.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''infrastructure nécessitant une gestion avancée de modules Terraform pour les environnements Azure.","de":"Ideal für Infrastrukturagenten, die eine erweiterte Verwaltung von Terraform-Modulen für Azure-Umgebungen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Infraestrutura que exigem gerenciamento avançado de módulos Terraform para ambientes do Azure.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов инфраструктуры, требующих расширенного управления модулями Terraform для сред Azure.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء البنية الذين يتطلبون إدارة متقدمة لوحدات Terraform لبيئات Azure."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to update root module files, modify child modules such as application/, group/, and user_assigned_identity/, and adjust module interfaces including variables.tf, all while ensuring secure and automated deployments via Terraform Station module for Azure.","zh":"赋予代理更新根模块文件、修改子模块（如application/、group/和user_assigned_identity/）的能力，并调整模块接口（包括variables.tf），同时确保通过Terraform Station模块为Azure提供安全和自动化的部署。","ja":"エージェントがルートモジュールファイルを更新し、application/、group/、user_assigned_identity/などのサブモジュールを変更し、variables.tfを含むモジュールインターフェイスを調整する能力を提供し、同時にTerraform Stationモジュールfor Azureを介したセキュアで自動化されたデプロイを保証します。","ko":"에이전트가 루트 모듈 파일을 업데이트 하고, application/, group/, user_assigned_identity/ 등의 하위 모듈을 수정하며, variables.tf를 포함한 모듈 인터페이스를 조정할 수 있도록 하며,同時에 Terraform Station 모듈 for Azure를 통해 보안 및 자동화된 배포를 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para actualizar archivos de módulos raíz, modificar módulos secundarios como application/, group/ y user_assigned_identity/, y ajustar interfaces de módulos que incluyen variables.tf, todo mientras se garantizan implementaciones seguras y automatizadas a través del módulo Terraform Station para Azure.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre à jour des fichiers de module racine, de modifier des modules enfants tels que application/, group/ et user_assigned_identity/, et d''ajuster les interfaces de module, y compris variables.tf, le tout en garantissant des déploiements sécurisés et automatisés via le module Terraform Station pour Azure.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Root-Modul-Dateien zu aktualisieren, untergeordnete Module wie application/, group/ und user_assigned_identity/ zu ändern und Modulschnittstellen anzupassen, einschließlich variables.tf, während sichergestellt wird, dass sichere und automatisierte Bereitstellungen über das Terraform-Station-Modul für Azure durchgeführt werden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes atualizem arquivos de módulos raiz, modifiquem módulos filho, como application/, group/ e user_assigned_identity/, e ajustem interfaces de módulos, incluindo variables.tf, garantindo implantações seguras e automatizadas via módulo Terraform Station para Azure.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обновлять файлы корневых модулей, изменять дочерние модули, такие как application/, group/ и user_assigned_identity/, и настраивать интерфейсы модулей, включая variables.tf, обеспечивая безопасные и автоматизированные развертывания через модуль Terraform Station для Azure.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تحديث ملفات الوحدات الجذرية، وتعديل الوحدات الفرعية مثل application/ و group/ و user_assigned_identity/، وتعديل واجهات الوحدات بما في ذلك variables.tf، مع ضمان التوزيعات الآمنة والآلية عبر وحدة Terraform Station لموقع Azure."},"useCases":{"en":["Updating root module files for customized Azure deployments","Modifying child modules to fit specific application or group requirements","Debugging module interfaces for optimized Terraform configurations"],"zh":["为自定义Azure部署更新根模块文件","修改子模块以满足特定应用程序或组的要求","调试模块接口以优化Terraform配置"],"ja":["カスタマイズされたAzureデプロイのためにルートモジュールファイルを更新する","特定のアプリケーションまたはグループの要件に合わせてサブモジュールを変更する","Terraform構成を最適化するためにモジュールインターフェイスをデバッグする"],"ko":["사용자 정의 Azure 배포를 위해 루트 모듈 파일을 업데이트 하는 것","특정 애플리케이션 또는 그룹의 요구 사항에 맞게 하위 모듈을 수정하는 것","Terraform 구성 최적화를 위해 모듈 인터페이스를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Actualizar archivos de módulo raíz para implementaciones personalizadas de Azure","Modificar módulos secundarios para adaptarse a requisitos específicos de aplicaciones o grupos","Depurar interfaces de módulos para configuraciones de Terraform optimizadas"],"fr":["Mettre à jour des fichiers de module racine pour des déploiements Azure personnalisés","Modifier des modules enfants pour répondre à des exigences spécifiques d''applications ou de groupes","Déboguer des interfaces de module pour des configurations Terraform optimisées"],"de":["Aktualisieren von Root-Modul-Dateien für benutzerdefinierte Azure-Bereitstellungen","Ändern von untergeordneten Modulen, um spezifischen Anforderungen von Anwendungen oder Gruppen zu entsprechen","Debuggen von Modulschnittstellen für optimierte Terraform-Konfigurationen"],"pt":["Atualizar arquivos de módulos raiz para implantações personalizadas do Azure","Modificar módulos filho para atender a requisitos específicos de aplicativos ou grupos","Depurar interfaces de módulos para configurações de Terraform otimizadas"],"ru":["Обновление файлов корневых модулей для настраиваемых развертываний Azure","Изменение дочерних модулей для удовлетворения конкретных требований приложений или групп","Отладка интерфейсов модулей для оптимизированных конфигураций Terraform"],"ar":["تحديث ملفات الوحدات الجذرية لاستخدامات Azure المخصصة","تعديل الوحدات الفرعية لتلبية متطلبات التطبيقات أو المجموعات المحددة","تصحيح أخطاء واجهات الوحدات لتحسين تكوينات Terraform"]},"limitations":{"en":["Specific to Terraform Station module for Azure","For testing purposes, use terraform-station-test skill instead","Requires knowledge of Terraform and Azure infrastructure"],"zh":["仅限于Terraform Station模块for Azure","测试目的使用terraform-station-test技能替代","需要Terraform和Azure基础设施的知识"],"ja":["Terraform Stationモジュールfor Azureに限定される","テスト目的の場合、terraform-station-testスキルを使用する","TerraformとAzureインフラストラクチャの知識が必要"],"ko":["Terraform Station 모듈 for Azure에만 국한됨","테스트 목적의 경우 terraform-station-test 스킬을 대신 사용","Terraform 및 Azure 인프라에 대한 지식이 필요"],"es":["Específico del módulo Terraform Station para Azure","Para fines de prueba, use la habilidad terraform-station-test en su lugar","Requiere conocimiento de Terraform y infraestructura de Azure"],"fr":["Spécifique au module Terraform Station pour Azure","Pour des fins de test, utilisez la compétence terraform-station-test à la place","Nécessite des connaissances en Terraform et infrastructure Azure"],"de":["Spezifisch für das Terraform-Station-Modul für Azure","Für Testzwecke verwenden Sie stattdessen die Fähigkeit terraform-station-test","Erfordert Kenntnisse von Terraform und Azure-Infrastruktur"],"pt":["Específico para o módulo Terraform Station para Azure","Para fins de teste, use a habilidade terraform-station-test em vez disso","Exige conhecimento de Terraform e infraestrutura do Azure"],"ru":["Спецефичен для модуля Terraform Station для Azure","Для целей тестирования используйте навык terraform-station-test вместо этого","Требует знания Terraform и инфраструктуры Azure"],"ar":["محدد لوحدة Terraform Station لموقع Azure","لأغراض الاختبار، استخدم مهارة terraform-station-test بدلاً من ذلك","يتطلب معرفة Terraform وبنية تحتية Azure"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"1e1a57d4ef004cd6198a42df2f12ade4707c91f42725cf192ac631c6af55f171","qualityScore":42}');
